<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Bahasa Buli</book>
  <para style="h">Lukas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Injil Lukas</para>
  <para style="mt">Lukas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Abar Mafia ga Yesus Kristus ta Lukase nfabinga</para>
  <para style="imt">Kitab tae ni fanfanna</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Abar Mafia</char>: kitab Lukas tae denabe du Abar Mafia i na (B. Ind: <char style="it">Ijil</char>), ga ni caritana Jou Lahatalla ncula Yesus Kristus nlafo mali dunia i, gabe ise ta ndela I, ini dosana, osta nduk ampung fare i osta ntub i re be Jou Lahatalla.</para>
  <para style="ip">Smat ta rtulis kitab taena, kitab tae Lukas ta ntulis i. Lukas tae dokter i (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol. 4:14</ref></char>), fare i bena Pauluse ni del mafia i. I bena nderera Paulus oras ta riri fan-fanca rfanye Jou ni mauting ta failuna (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:9-10">Kis. 16:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2Tim. 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Flm. 1:24</ref></char>). Lukas tae smat Yahudi i pa, ga i ndela Yesuse to. I nem Yesus laitanena bahnga paube, ga en smat ta rfabinga i ga Yesus. Lukas tae ntaro kirana mafia, gabe tina i niyawa bo ntoh famafia farumi mauting ta smatna duwa i na ga Yesus, gabe i nfato mauting tina mulain mali Yesuse ntubna denabe ndawil nais Soroga i (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luk. 1:1-4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Kitab tae bo ise.</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukase ntulis Yesuse ni carita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Apa Teofilus ta ya ihormati aw.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Smatna lale to ta rlefo carita ga ahai ta Yesuse npei na oras ta I nfarerer re itna. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Si rlefo farumi tina laisa ta si rlonga mali smat ta dem re mtari piluna. Smat tina ta deme ntuba oras ta farumi tina ndadi i, gabe rfalafo carita tina lali smate nesana. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ya itutuling ikem famafia to farumi carita ta si rlefo mulain mali tagapo. Gabe fola tina ya iyal faorit bo ilefo farumi carita ta ndadi i tona mali cicapo denabe lali cicapo, taga ifayeit lali Teofilus i. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Gabe ya ilefo carita tae bo apa mto fatutua, ahai ta smatna rfafcule aw ga Yesus tina fatutua.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaekatca nfabinga, Yohanes ta nfasisopca bo ntub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Oras ta Herodese ndadi Kolano mali batang Yudea, en imam isa mali agama Yahudina ngahnyo Zakharia. I cia isa mali imam ta du Abia. Zakharia ni ngolota ngahnyo Elisabet. Si smat silu tasa imam Harune ntu re bbu si. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Mane re maping silu tasine rtubna fatutua molang mali Lahatalla uhngona, fare si rderera ndumi ni fasula fare ni fatfatona, gabe isa pa ta bo nfasala sina. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Smat silu tasine dauahleo fare dangolo to, taga nturi pa hawe, ningalena Elisabet bisa nduke ntu pa.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Bahnga laitane, imam Abia ni smatna, nduk lowat karajan mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Gabe mali smat tinana, Zakharia ta nduk lowat bo nleleane Jou Lahatalla mana. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />I nduk karajan tina ningalena oras tina imam agama Yahudina biasa rcibit lot bo rto ise ta ngahnyona ncapang bo ntaping manyan mali Gagaw ta Jouca nlafo biasa nteteam mana pumul Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Ga oras cia Zakharia ngahnyona ta ncapang. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Gabe, Zakharia ncung Gagaw ta Jouca nlafo biasa nteteam mana mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, fare npe ni karajanna ntaping manyan, ga potalilna smatna lal ta rcombayang. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Garayanna Jou Lahatalla ni malaekatca nfaemi mali Zakharia i. Malaekat cia nosal mali wela mali gagaw ta rtapngo i ai ta pauna mafiaca. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Nem tinana, Zakharia engarayan fare namcaitna gaole. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Gabe malaekat cia nua i, “Zakharia, aw mati mamcaitna! Jou Lahatalla nlonga to anim sombayangna. Anim ngolota Elisabet osta ntu ca ntub waica man i. Wai cia aw nane mfangahnyo i, Yohanes. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Aw osta msangnangna gaole re wai cia, fare smatna lal bena ta rbasamna rcangnang oras ta wai cia ntubna, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />ningalena i bo ndadi smat mamagal mali Jou Lahatalla uhngo. Oras ta i ntub, i osta ndom pa anggur fare wo nesa ta nmonitna. Oras ta i mali hnye hnyao lolo sube, Jou ni Rohca nkawasa i to. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />I ta osta nfafcule smat Israelna bo rtaif, bo si rlolai rderera be Jou Lahatalla, si riri Jou i. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Wai cia osta ni kawasana mamagal laisa nabi Elia, ningalena Jou ni Rohca nkawasa i to. Gabe i osta nlafo ntuba, Jouca nlafo paubena. I bo npei manna wlorina bo rfamafiyo si re nturina. I ma osta npei smat ta rderera pa Jou Lahatalla ni parentana bo jaga rpei okosesi ta molang. Re laina, i bo nfasiap smatna bo bisa rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Gabe Zakharia nfautno malaekat cia, “Mfalaisa ya bo ito gabe ya re nik ngolota bo kduke ntumamna? Ga smat am lu tane kauahleo re kangolo tona.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Gabe malaekatca nua i, “Ya tane Gabriel ta dorame re wol ya re be Jou Lahatalla bo ileleane i. I ncula ya ifabinga Abar Mafia tae lali awi. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ta ya iku tane, osta bo ndadi i mali ni orasna. Ga aw, ningalena aw mdela pa ta ya ikuna, mulain oras tae, aw bisa mmauting pa, denabe farumi ta ya iku tane ndadi i.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Smat lalo ta rcombayang potalilna rtotoman be Zakharia. Si rherang ningalena i namnuna gaole pumul Gagaw ta Jouca nlafo biasa nteteam manaca mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Oras ta Zakharia ncapang, i bisa nmauting panto. Gabe i nfatailo re kakamo lali smatna ningalena i nmomow. Dem tinana, si rto to i nem paisa pumul Gagaw ta Jouca nlafo biasa nteteam mana mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Oras ta Zakharia npei ni karajanna fola to, i nuwe lali ni ebai i. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Mnu pana, ni ngolota Elisabet reni badan. Gabe ngah silim i be mali ebai lolo. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Elisabete nu laitane, “Jouca npo ni mafiana mali ya i. I n'gali ya denabe ya re nik badan, gabe ya imai pa ningalena ya bo ntuke to.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaekatca nfabinga, Yesuse bo ntub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Oras ta Elisabete reni badan ngah siwonam, Jou Lahatalla ncula malaekat Gabriel nfan lali bendar isa mali batang Galilea, ta ngahnyo Nasaret. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Jouca ncula i nfan lali males isa, ngahnyo Maria. Maria cia nto man paube ga nfajaji re man isa ngahnyo Yusuf. Yusuf tae kolano Daute ntu re bbu i. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Malaekat cia nlafo lali Maria i ga nu laitane, “Tabea, maping ta aw! Jouca bo nfaeme ni mafiana lali awi. I osta nfarerer re aw.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maria en garayan oras ta nlonga malaekatca nu lainana. I nututa mali wlona, ni ngale ahai malaekat cia nuna. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Gabe malaekat cia nua i, “Maria, mati mamcaitna, ningalena Jou Lahatalla npo ni mafiana lali awi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Bo mnu panto, aw bo renim badan, fare wai ta bo ntubca man i. Aw nane mfangahnyo wai cia, Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />I cia bo ndadi smat mamagal, fare smatna osta dololaw I Jou Lahatalla ta nkawasaca ntu I. Jou Lahatalla npei bo I nkawasa laisa Kolano Daut, i hma re bbu tantubana. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />I osta ndadi Kolano mali farumi smat Israelna ntu re bburi, fare I nkawasa ndadi Kolano denabe lali.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Nlonga tina, Maria nua malaekat cia, “Mfalaisa tina bo ndadi ina? Ya tane imales sube, ikamtuli re man bahnga paube.”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Malaekat cia ncanglo i, “Laitane: lomanta Jou ni Rohca bo nlafo aw. Jou Lahatalla ta tigo molang cia bo nkawasa aw. Gabe wai ta bo ntub cia nmafia fare Jouca ni i, fare smatna bo dololaw I, Lahatalla ntu I. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Tina be pa, Elisabet aw tenom cia, makse i nangolo to fare smatna du, i osta nduke ntu pa, ga tane i reni badan ngah si woname to waica mani. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Farumi tina osta ndadi i, ningalena Jou Lahatalla bisa npei ahai be.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Gabe Maria nua malaekat cia, “Ya tane ipei be okosesi ta Jouca nculana. Gabe makse ta apa muna ndadi i mali ya i.” Fola tina, malaekatca nfateam Maria.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria nfan lali Elisabet i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mnu pa mali tina, Maria fatoal be nfanna lali bendar isa mali gagaw ta nmapei lolasi, mali batang Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />I nfan lali Zakharia ni ebaica. Nlafo pulina, i ncung fare nu tabea lali Elisabet i.<verse eid="LUK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Oras ta Elisabete nlonga Maria nu tabeana, wai ta mali Elisabete hnyaoca ngangala, fare Jou ni Rohca nkawasa Elisabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Gabe Elisabete nu re liona mamagal, “Maria! Jou Lahatalla npo ni mafiana lali awi foloi mali farumi maping! I npo ni mafiana lali wai ta bo ntub mali awica. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ya i sangnangna gaole, ningalena makse ya smat ta nik ngale pa, ga ya nik Jouca hnye nlafo mali ya i to. <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nanai, oras ta ya ilonga nim tabeana, ya ntuk ta pumul hnyaok tae ngangala, ningalena i ncangnang. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Awe msangnange to, ningalena aw mdela ahai ta Jouca nu tina bo ndadi i.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Gabe Maria nu laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ya ifamamagal Jou.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Ya wlokna sangnangna gaole, ningalena Jou Lahatalla ta nfasalamat ya.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Ningalena, I ntarokira ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">ya tane smat ta nik ngale paisa pa, ya tane ipei be ahai ta I nculana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Mulain oras tae, farumi smatna bo du ya tane maping ta isangnangna gaole,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />ningalena Jou Lahatalla ta nkawasa npo ta mafiana mali ya i.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">I to ta nmafia re nbirahi.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Jou Lahatalla nfafcule ni masiena lali smat ta rdela Ina mali ntu re hbu ta isa denabe ntu re bbu ta nesana.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />I ni kawasana mamagal gabe npei okosesi ta mafia re birahi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">I nfalelang smat ta rcombongna denabe okosesi ta bo rpeina ndadi i pa.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />I nfadurea kolanona mali riri kawasana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">taga nlange smat ta riri ngale paisa pana.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />I npo okosesi ta mafia lali smat ta rcusana denabe nlafo si,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">ga lali smat ta rkayangna I ncula si rfan re mati dut fapaisana.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />I n'gali smat Israelna, smat ta I nfisang si tona bo rpei ahai ta I nculana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">I n'gali si, ningalena I nlolam I ni jaji bo nfaem I ni masiena,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />mali ite hma re hbur tantuba tina, Abrahame i re ntu re hbuna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">Jaji tina Jou Lahatalla nu ntuba to, fare tina myangis pa denabe lali.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mana, Maria ntetemo Elisabet sal pana ngah sitol. Fola tina, Maria nuwe lali ni ebai i.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohanese ntub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ni orasna bo nlafo ito Elisabete ntuca bo ntub, i ntu ta ntubca man i. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Smat ta mali Elisabete laporina fare teno re ramana rlonga Jou ca nfaeme ni masiena mamagal lali Elisabet i, denabe I npo wai isa, gabe farumi si rcenga farerer re i.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Oras wai cia ni wol piwai, wai cia bo rcunat i rderera agama Yahudi ni fatfatona. Gabe smat ta rdahle sina fare teno re ramana rlafo rfayalo si mana. Si bo rfangahnyo wai cia Zakharia laisa hma ngahnyona. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ga i hnye nailow pa. I nu, “Matina! Nane fangahnyo i Yohanes”.<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Gabe si duwa i, “Ga mali farumi mew ta fatenow fare faramaw tane, isa ngahnyo Yohanes pa.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Gabe, si rfatailo lali Zakharia i bo rfautan “Ntum tae bo tfangahnyo i ise?”<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakharia nfatailo ndor fapaisa bo nlefo gabe i nlefo mautingna tane, “I ngahnyo Yohanes”. Gabe farumi smat ta si manana ndadi rherang.<verse eid="LUK 1:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Oras cia to, Zakharia ndadi nmauting hawe, fare i nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Farumi smat ta rteteam rdahle manana rdadi rherang fare damcait. Gabe farumi ta ndadi i tina, smatna dafetang denabe mali farumi batang Yudea ta nmapei lolasna. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Farumi smat ta rlonga abar ciana dututa mali wlori, “Osta ndadi ahai wai cia gabe laisa i nmamagal?” Si dututa lainana, ningalena si rto Jou ni kawasana nfarerer re wai cia.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zakharia nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Fola tina, Jou ni Rohca nkawasa Zakharia, Yohanese hma. Fare Zakharia nfabinga ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nua i na,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Mali bo tfamamagal Jou Lahatalla, smat Israelna rir Jou i! Oras tae I nlafo bo n'gali I it smat Israel, bo nfabebas it.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />I ncula Smat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Smat ta bo nfasamat itca, Yesus Kristus.</char></note> isa ta ncicoal bo nfasalamat it.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">Smat cia Kolano Daute ntu re hbu i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">Kolano Daut cia tantuba, smat ta jaga npei ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nculana.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Jou Lahatalla njaji ntuba to,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">gabe Jou ni nabina ta rfabinga ni jajina laitane:<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Jouca bo nfabebas it</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">mali rir lawanna fare mali smat ta rkawasa ta riri le itna.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Jouca npei laina, ningalena I nlolam ta I jaji mali ite hma re hbur tantubana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">I nlolam I ni jaji ta mafia re birahi tina ni lalingna nfaem I ni gogoruna lali sili.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Jaji ta Jou Lahatalla nu tina fare ncasi mali Abraham i, ite hmar re hbur ta ntubaca,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />I njaji, I bo nfabebas it mali smat ta rlawang it na.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">Fare laina, ite osta tbasamna tamcait panto bo tfamamagal Ina.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Fare ite ttub ta mnuwo tae, ite ttubna tpei be okosesi ta Lahatalla ni mauna, fare ttub na tpei be okosesi ta tutuo mali Jou Lahatalla uhngo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Fola tina Zakharia nua Yohanes,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">“Ga aw, ya ntuk aw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">osta smatna bo du aw tina Jou Lahatalla ta tigo molangca ni nabi ta jaga nfalafo I ni fatnaw lali smatna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Si du laina ningalena aw mlafo ntuba mali dunia tae aw re Jou cana, bo mfasiap smatna wlorina bo dailow I.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Aw ta bo mfabinga Jou Lahatalla ni smatna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">I bo nfasalamat si fare ni lalingna bo nampung si mali riri dosana.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ite rir Jou Lahatalla nmasie it, nlafo mali sorogai mali bo nfasalamat it.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">I nlafo tina, osta ndadi laisa wolca bo ncana,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />bo npo plangan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">I cia nlafo bo nfaplangno smat ta rtub pumul dororam cana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">fare smat ta rtub re rbasamna damcait.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">I bo nlafo it bo ite tto laling ta ttub ta npei ite wlorina tengtengan.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Zakharia ntu cia wol de wol nbang i be nmamagal, fare Jouca npei wlona ga nbang i be ncicoal. Denabe i nmamagal, i nteteam mali padang gurun, gagaw ta namliley fare laspa mali pnu i, denabe i nfafcule smat Israelna, taga i nfateam gagaw cia.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse ntub</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat. 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Oras cia, en kolano mamagal Roma, i ngahnyo Agustus. I ncapnga parenta mali farumi batang ta i nkawasana, bo farumi smatna rfasunge ngahnyori. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Taga bahnga tane pamarenta Roma rfasunge smatna oras ta Kirenius ndadi gubernur mali batang Siria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Farumi smatna nane rfan lali riri bendar ta si hma re hnyeri tantuba rtetemo bo rfasunge ngahnyori. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Laina bena re Yusuf. I nfan mali Nasaret ta i ntetemona mali batang Galilea, gabe i nfan lali Daute ni bendar ta mali batang Yudea, ta ngahnyo Betlehem. Yusufe nfan lali mana, ningalena i cia kolano Daute ntu re bbu i. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Yusuf i re na tunangan ta bo nfasawa ica Maria, rfan farerer bo rfasunge ngahnyori pulina. Oras tina, Maria reni badan.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Oras ta si mali Betlehem, ga ni oras Maria ntuca bo ntub. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Maria ntuca ntub waica man i, wai ta uwati. Fola tina i nopi i re obat waica, taga nfatuli i mali aiwanina rari an gagaona, ningalena farumi ebai ta manana bakbaka re smate to.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaekatna rfabinga Yesuse ntube to</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Doram cia, en smat ta rjaga riri dombana mali gagaw ta ni mom mali batang ta ndahle bendar Betlehem. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Garayanna si dem Jou ni malaekatca nfaemi lali sili. Fare, Jou ni plangnona ntabak si, gabe si damcaitna gaole. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ga malaekat cia nua si, “Mati famcaitna! Flonga famafia. Ya ilafo mali tane bo ifabinga abar ta mafia lali mewi. Abar mafia tae npei farumi smat ta rlongana wlorina sangnang. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Abar mafia cia laitane: Wol tae, Smat ta bo nfasalamate smatca ntube to. I ntub mali Betlehem, kolano Daute ni bendarca. I cia smatna dololaw i Kristus, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate mew. I to Jouca. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Lomanta mew osta ffayala I re fafayal tae: mew osta fem wai isa dopi i re obat. Wai cia si rfatuli i mali aiwanina rari an gagaona.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Nu fola tina, n'garayan be en hawe malaekat mali sorogai malina lalna gaole rfaem si, si rfarerer re malaekat isa cia rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla, laitane,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Tfamamagal re tcuba Jou Lahatalla ta i mali sorogai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">Ga mali dunia tae, Jou Lahatalla osta npo wlow ta tengtengan lali smat ta rpei Jou Lahatalla wlona sangnangna.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Rfola rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla laina, malaekat tina rlolai hawe lali sorogai. Gabe smat ta rjaga dombana rfauo si du laitane, “Mali bo ite tfan lali Betlehem bo tem ahai ta Jouca nua it nanaina.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Gabe si damalela be rfan Betlehem. Pulinana, si rfadukduk re Maria re Yusuf. Si dem i bena wai nena cia namtuli mali aiwanina rari an gagaoca. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Oras ta si dem wai cia, si rfabinga smat ta mana farumi ahai ta malaekatca nua si bo wai ciana. <figure style="fig" file="CN01621B.png" size="col" loc="2:8" copy="David C Cook" ref="2:8">Malaekatna rfabinga Yesuse ntube to</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Farumi smat ta manana ndadi rherang oras ta rlonga smat ta rjaga domba tina dafetangna. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ga Maria nisinge ndumi ta ndadi i tina mali i wlo fare i nfikir famafia ndumi tina. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Fola tina, smat ta rjaga dombana rlolai hawe lali riri dombana. Si rfamamagal fare rcuba Jou Lahatallana rfola pa, ningalena farumi ta si rlonga fare dem tina, laisa ta malaekatna duna.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusuf i re Maria rpo Yesus lali Jou Lahatalla i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Oras ta wai cia ni umur wol piwai, I nane nduk sunat, rderera agama Yahudina riri fatfatona. Fare si rfangahnyo I, Yesus, laisa ngasan ta malaekatna dua Maria oras ta i re ni badan paubena. <verse eid="LUK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Yesuse ntube hola mnuwona wol yafafat, Maria i re Yusuf nane rfan Yerusalem bo rfaberesi riri badan rderera fatfato ta mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa. Gabe si rfan mali bendar Yerusalem fare dut Yesus bo rpo I lali Jouca, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />laisa re fatfato ta rlefo mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:23">“Ga wai man ta uatna, i nane rpo i lali Jouca, bo ndadi Jouca ni i.”<verse eid="LUK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Fare si bena rpo mani tekukur pasang pusa penepa mani pombo ta wawayo subena silu bo ndadi sadaka aiwani, rderera fatfato mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simeone nu Yesus tae mali Jou Lahatalla i mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Oras cia mali Yerusalem, en smat isa ngahnyo Simeon. I cia ntubna molang mali Jou Lahatalla uhngona fare i nlonga be Jou Lahatalla. Fare i ntotoman oras ta Jou Lahatalla bo nfasalamate smat Israelna. Fare Jou ni Rohca nfarerer re i. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Jou ni Rohca nfabinga i, i osta nmat pa gabe laisa i nem Mesias paube, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatca. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Gabe oras ta Yusuf i re Maria bo rcung Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna, gabe Jou ni Rohca ncula Simeone nfan mana. Simone i lali bo nem Yusuf i re Maria bo rpo Yesus lali Jou Lahatalla i, rderera fatfato ta mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa.<verse eid="LUK 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Oras ta Simeone nem Wai cia, i nyali ga n'gopi, fare nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla. I nu,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Ya Jou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">popiseina Jou mjaji ya, ga tane Jou nim jaji tina ndadi i mali ya i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ya ta jaga ipei ahai ta Jou msulana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">Gabe tane, biare to ya imat re wlokna tengtengan.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ningalena ya ikema re mtak pilu smat ta Jou Lahatalla ncula i bo nfasalamate smatca.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Smat ta bo nfasalamate smat cia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:31">Jou Lahatalla npake i bo smat mali farumi sukuna bisa rcalamat.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Smat cia osta laisa planganna, bo smatna rderera i. Gabe smat na rderera I to, osta smatna rfamamagal fare rcuba Jou Lahatalla ni smatna, smat Israel.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Rlonga Simeone nu laina, Yusuf i re Maria ndadi rherang. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Gabe Simeone ncombayang bo Jou Lahatalla npo ni mafiana lali Yusuf i, Maria fare wai cia. Fare nua Maria, Wai cia hnye, “Poko be Wai tae, smat Israelna lal ta rdela pa gabe rduk sal mali Jou Lahatalla i, ga lal bena smat Israel ta nesana si rdela gabe rduk salamat. Wai tae ndadi fafayal i, I imali Jou Lahatalla i mali, ga smatna lal ta dailowi pa. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Gabe laisa I nlafo, smatna dailowi pare dailo pa osta bo tto wlorina. Ga aw Maria, osta wlomna ncusa ningalena Wai tae, laisa smatna rcuceo nam pega isa lali ulamna.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla ningalena Yesuse ntube to</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagal ciana mana en bena maping isa nangolo to, ngahnyo Hana. I cia nabi i, ta jaga nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna. Hana tae hma ngahnyo Fanuel ta rderera sogaro Asyer. I nfasaw bahnga to nfarerer re ni uat cana taun faifit. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ga i ni uatca nmate to, gabe i nbalo. I ni umurna taun yafawai re pifat. I bahnga paube nfateam Ebai Sombayang Mamagalcana. Dorame re wol i ncuba be Jou Lahatalla. I jaga npuasa fare ncombayang. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Oras ta Simeon re Yusuf fare Maria rmau-mautingna, Hana nlafo mana fare i nmulaine ncuba Jou Lahatalla. Fare nfabinga Wai cia lali farumi smat ta si manana ta rtotoman Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamat smat Israelnaca.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusuf i re Maria rlolai hawe lali Nasaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Laina Yusuf i re Maria rpei fola ndumi okosesi ta rderera Jou Lahatalla ni fatfato mali Musa ni kitab silim tasana, si farumi duwe lali riri ebai i mali bendar Nasaret, mali batang Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Fare, Yesuse wol de wol nbang i be nmamagal fare ndadi ncicoal. I ma ndadi smat ta nto okosesina lal, fare Jou ni mafiana mamagal lali I ina.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ni taun yafasa re failu mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Etnga be taun, Yesuse hma re hnye tasa rfan lali Yerusalem bo rderera agama Yahudina riri Wol Mamagalca ta si du Paska. Wol mamagal cia si rlolam oras ta Jou Lahatalla ni mafia nfabebas hma re bburi ta ntubana oras ta rfasusa si mali Mesirna. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Oras ta Yesuse ni umur taun yafasa re failu, I hma re hnye tasa rfan lali Yerusalem rderera wol mamagalca laisa biasa be. Oras ciana, si dut Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Laina wol mamagal cia nmaralapis, Yesuse hma re hnye tasa rmulaine duwe lali Galilea. Si rto pa Yesus I mali Yerusalem sube, <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Ningalena si du nama Yesuse nfan nfarerer re smate nesa ta rfanna. Laina si rfanna wol pusa to, taga si diyawa Yesus mali si tenori re ramarina fare smat ta rfayala sina ta orasca rfanfan tina. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ga si rduk I pa. Gabe si rlolai hawe lali Yerusalem bo diyawa I pulina. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ni wol pitol, taga si rduk I mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca po talilna. I ntotolang guru agama Yahudina rfapaluno I, nlonga fare nfafautno si. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Farumi smat ta rlonga Yesuse ni nmautingna, si rdadi rherang, ningalena I ntaif fare I ncanglo ahai ta rfautno I na fatutua ndumi. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Dem tina, Yesuse hma re hnye tasa ndadi rherang. Gabe I hnye nua I, “Yesus, apa i re mama damcaitna gaole, ame kningo Awna lali re mali. Pesaga Aw mpeo apa i re mama laitanena?”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesuse nua si, “Apa aw re mama mati fningo Yana. Ningalena apa aw re mama fto to, Ya tane nane Ya mali Hmakca ni Ebaica.” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />I nu laina, ga si rtaif pa ni ngalena.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Fola tina, Yesuse nuwe lali Nasaret nfarerer re si, fare I ma nlonga be hma re hyena. Ga I hnye nlololam ahai ta Yesuse nuna gabe wlona nfaututan tina ni ngale ahai. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesuse nbang i be nmamagal fare nto okosesina lal. Jou Lahatalla nbange n'gogoru i, fare ni mafiana foloi mali smat ta rcangnang re Ina. <figure style="fig" file="CN01647B.TIF" size="col" loc="2:41-52" copy="David C. Cook" ref="2:41-52">Yesuse i re guru agamana mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohanese ncula farumi smatna dailow bo rderera Jou</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mrk. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Tiberiuse ndadi kolano mamagal mali Roma, ga oras ta ncung taun yafasa re hailim, Pontius Pilatus ta ndadi gubernur mali batang Yudea, fare Herodes ndadi kolano mali batang Galilea, Herodese tenoca ngahnyo Filipus ndadi kolano mali batang Iturea fare batang Trakhonitis, taga Lisanias ndadi kolano mali batang Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ta rdadi imam mamagal mali Agama Yahudina, si ngahnyorina Hanas re Kayafas. Oras cia Jou Lahatalla nmauting lali Yohanes i, Zakharia ntuca, puli Yudea mali Padang gurun gagaw ta namliley, fare nalaspa mali pnu i.<verse eid="LUK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Gabe tina, Yohanese nfan lali farumi batang ta ndahle waya Yordan, taga nfabinga smatna laitane, “Fiwane wlomewna bo fderera Jou Lahatalla, fare laina Jou Lahatalla osta nampunge mew. Gabe failowe to bo rsisope mew, tina ningalena mew ffailowe fderera Jou Lahatalla.”<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Yohanes cia smat ta popise i Jou Lahatalla nu bo nlafo, ga tina rlefo mali kitab Nabi Yesaya laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Osta en smat isa bo nmautingna nfacicoali lali smat ta rfayalo si mali padang gurunna gagaw isa ta namliley fare nalaspa mali pnuna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">I nu, ‘Famawah lalingna bo failow Jou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">faolang lalingna bo ftotoman I.’<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ga ta npei lolona nane rpuco re rakrak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ga lolas re popona nane ffarata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Laling ta molang pana ffaololang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">fare laling ta nmapei lopna fpuco bo ffasafsafo.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Fare farumi smatna osta dem mfalaisa Jou Lahatalla bo nfasalamate smatna mali riri dosana.”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Smatna lal rlafo lali Yohanes i bo ncisop si. Gabe Yohanese nua si, “Ee, mew tane smat ta fmayai! Nimew mayaina laisa gu ta nbisana. Mati fu mew flafo mali ga fduk sisope to, mew bisa fsalamat mali Jou Lahatalla ni sal-salna.<verse eid="LUK 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Gabe mew fatutua fiwane wlomewna fderera Jou, mew nane fpei okosesi ta mafia bo ndadi fafayal mew failow fderera Jou weto. Tina laisa ai ta nbokana, piyona mafia. Mati mew ffikir mew fbebas mali sal-sal ningalena mew Abrahame ntu re bbu. Ya ikuwa mew, gabe Jou Lahatalla nailow, I bisa npei pat tane ndadi Abrahame ntu re bbu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Jou Lahatalla nfapepeya I to bo nfasal farumi smat ta rderera I wlona pana. Tina ifatailo laisa smat isa nfapepeya i re bacu bo ncelap ai ta piyona mayai, taga ntopa ai cia lali yapca.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Gabe, lal smatna rfautno i, “Ahai ta amame nane kpeina bo Jou Lahatalla mati nfasal am na?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohanese nu, “Ise gabe ni kabayana ailu, isa nane noce smat ta ni kabaya paca, fare ise ga na an, nane noce smat ta na an paca.” <figure style="fig" file="CN01653b.tif" size="col" ref="3:11">Yohanese ncula farumi smatna diwane wlorina rderera Jou</figure><verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Smat ta rfayalo pajak nama rlafo Yohanes, rdore bo Yohanes ncisop si. Si rfautno Yohanes, “Guru, ahai ta amame nane kpeina?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Yohanese nu laitane, “Oras ta mew fayalo pajak, ffayalona mati foloi mali ta pamarentana rcula mew ffayalonana.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Mana, en bena tentara ta rlafona. Si rfautno Yohanes, “Gabe amam, ahai ta nane kpeina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Gabe Yohanese ncanglo si, “Mati ftolea smatna taga fyale riri tiwinana, fare mati fu smatna rcalna bo si doce mew tiwi. Fennyo mew re nimew sagige mulo ta fdukna.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Ga rlonga Yohanese ni mautingna, smatna dututa mali wlori, “Wahle Yohanes tae to Mesias, Kolano ta ite ttotoman fare tmaulango, ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamat it.” <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Ga Yohanese nua ndumi si, “Ya isisope mew re waya, ndadi fafayal mew failowe to bo fderera Jou Lahatalla. Ga osta, Smat isa bo nlafo, I ni kawasana foloi mamagalna mali ya i. Ga bo idadi i ni sulsula, ta bo isalawe ni wala nalna bere ya bisa pa. I cia ta bo ncisope mew npake Jou ni Rohca fare yap. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />I bo nfara smat ta rderera Ina fare smat ta rderera I pana. Tina laisa smat ta rfisang gandum bo rfara ni irna. Gandum ta mafiana i nisin mali gagaona, taga ni irna ntopa lali yap ta nmat-mat paca.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />En sogaro ta nesana lal ta Yohanese nua smat lalo tina bo si dailow rderera Jou, fare si rderera Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Yohanese ma ntolea kolano Herodes. Herodes tae nkawasa mali batang Galilea. Yohanese ntolea Herodes, ningalena Herodese nfasawa Herodias, i ni tamai tutuwo i. Yohanese ma ntolea hawe Herodes, ningalena lalna gaole to npei okosesi ta mayaina. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ga Herodese nailow pa nderera Jou. Taga i ntole nbang, i ncunga Yohanes namul buica.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohanes ncisop Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:3-17">Mat. 3:3-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mrk. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Oras ta Herodese nfasunga Yohanes bui paubena, Yohanese ncisope smatna lal. Fare Yesus, i ncisop i. Oras ta Yesuse nduk ncisop, I ncombayang gabe langitca nmarasia.<verse eid="LUK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Fare, Jou ni Rohca nlafo I. Jou ni Roh cia laisa mani pombona. Fare rlonga Jou Lahatalla nu mali langitca laitane, “Aw tane Ya Ntuk Aw, ta Ya imasiye Aw. Aw ta mpei Ya wlokna sangnang.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus Kristus hma re bbu tantubana ntu re bburi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat. 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesuse nmulain npei ni karajanna oras ciana I ni umur sal pana taun yafatol. Smat puli nana rfayala, Yesus cia Yusufe ntu i. Tane I hma re bbu tantuba ngahnyorina, tetang mali Yusuf i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yusufe hma ngahnyo Eli,<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eli hma Matat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:24">Matate hma Lewi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:24">Lewi hma Malkhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:24">Malkhi hma Yanai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:24">Yanai hma Yusuf,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusufe hma Matica,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:25">Matica hma Amos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:25">Amose hma Nahum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:25">Nahume hma Hesli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:25">Hesli hma Nagai,<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai hma Maat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:26">Maate hma Matica,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:26">Matica hma Simei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:26">Simei hma Yosekh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:26">Yosekh hma Yoda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda hma Yohanan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:27">Yohanan hma Resa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa hma Zerubabel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:27">Zerubabele hma Sealtiel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:27">Sealtiel hma Neri,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri hma Malkhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:28">Malkhi hma Adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:28">Adi hma Kosam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosame hma Elmadam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:28">Elmadame hma Er,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er hma Yesua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:29">Yesua hma Eliezer,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliezer hma Yorim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:29">Yorime hma Matat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:29">Matate hma Lewi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lewi hma Simeon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:30">Simeone hma Yehuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:30">Yehuda hma Yusuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:30">Yusufe hma Yonam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:30">Yoname hma Elyakim,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Fare Elyakim hma Melea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:31">Melea hma Mina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:31">Mina hma Matata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:31">Matata hma Natan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:31">taga Natane hma Daut,<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Daute hma Isai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:32">Isai hma Obet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:32">Obete hma Boas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:32">Boase hma Salmon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:32">Salmone hma Nahason,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nahasone hma Aminadab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:33">Aminadabe hma Admin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:33">Admine hma Arni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:33">Arni hma Hezron,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:33">Hezrone hma Peres,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:33">Perese hma Yehuda,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yehuda hma Yakub,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakube hma Ishak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:34">Ishake hma Abraham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:34">Abrahame hma Terah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:34">Terah hma Nahor,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahore hma Serug,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:35">Seruge hma Rehu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:35">Rehu hma Peleg,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:35">Pelege hma Eber,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:35">Ebere hma Salmon,<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Salmone hma Kenan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:36">Kenane hma Arpakhsad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:36">Arpakhsade hma Sem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:36">Seme hma Nuh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:36">Nuh hma Lamekh,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamekhe hma Metusalah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:37">Metusalah hma Henokh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:37">Henokhe hma Yared,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:37">Yarede hma Mahalaleel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalaleele hma Kenan,<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenane hma Enos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:38">Enose hma Set,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:38">Sete hma Adam. Taga Adam cia, Jou Lahatalla to ta npei i, gabe i ndadi Jou Lahatalla Ntu i.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Setanna riri kolanoca nyakul Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mrk. 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Oras ta Yesuse i mali waya Yordanna, Jou ni Rohca nkawasa I to. Fare nut Yesus lali gagaw isa ta namliley fare nalaspa mali pnu i. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Yesuse nteteam pulinana wol yafafat. Mana, setanna riri kolanoca, nyakul Yesus. Oras ta Yesuse imanana, I nan paisa pa denabe I nbibisilna gaole.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Gabe setanna riri kolanoca nua Yesus laitane, “Aw tane, Lahatalla ntu Aw paga? Gabe laina, Aw msula pat tane bo ndadi roti!”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesuse nailow pa, gabe nua i, “Mali Jou ni Kitabca en rlefo laitane, ‘Smatna rtubna mali roti be pa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Fola tina, setanna riri kolanoca nut Yesus lali gagaw isa ta tigo. Mana, fatoalna gaole setanna riri kolanoca nfaemo Yesus farumi karajan ta mali dunia taena. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Gabe setanna riri kolanoca nua Yesus, “Farumi karajan tina ni kawasa fare kayangna ya bo ipo Aw! Ningalena farumi tina ndadi ya nik, gabe ya bo ipo ise ta ya ilokolo i. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Gabe, laisa Aw msuba ya, ya bo ipo farumi tina ndadi Aw nim.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Gabe Yesuse nua i, “Mali Jou ni Kitabcana en rlefo laitane, ‘Mew nane fsuba Jou Lahatalla. I cia nimew Jou I, fare I be ta mew nane flonga I!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Fola tina, setanna riri kolano ca nut Yesus lali bendar Yerusalem, taga nising Yesus mali gagaw ta tigo molang mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Fare nua Yesus laitane, “Aw tane Lahatalla ntu Aw paga? Gabe laina, mpawil Aw mantane bo nap! <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Aw osta mpei paisa pa, ningalena mali Kitabcana en rlefo ga Aw laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">Jou Lahatalla bo ncula ni malaekatna rjaga Aw.<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Si bo rcagam Aw oras ta Aw marapawilna, bo ficomna, mati neta patnana.”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Ga Yesuse nailow pa, gabe I nu laitane, “En ta rlefo mali Jou ni Kitab cana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:12">‘Mati mtohnga Jou Lahatallana, me nimew Jou i.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Oras ta setanna riri kolano ca nyakul Yesuse re rupa lalo i, i nfateam Yesus, fare i ntotoman orase nesa ta mafia bo ntohnga I hawe.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nlolai lali Galilea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mrk. 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Fola tina, Yesuse nlolai hawe lali batang Galilea. Jou ni Rohca ni kawasana en mali I, Fare abar ga Ina ncapange ndumi mali farumi smat mali batang tina. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />I nfafcule smat mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina, gabe farumi smatna rfamamagal I.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse dailowi pa mali Nasaretna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mrk. 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Bahnga na, Yesuse nfan lali pnu Nasaret. Mali nnenena sube denabe nmamagal I mali pnu cia. Gabe neta wol Sabat, ta smat Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa, I ncung mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina, laisa re I ni biasana. I nosal potao bo nbaca Jou ni Kitab ca. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Gabe, en ta rpo Yesus kitab nabi Yesaya. I ncalawe kitab ta rfalululo i cia, gabe I nduk lefoanna laitane,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Jou Lahatalla ni Rohca i mali Ya i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ningalena I nfisang Ya bo ifabinga Abar Mafia lali smat ta rcusana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">I ta ncula Ya<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />bo ifabinga smatna laitane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:19">Smat ta rceya si puli buicana bo rcapang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:19">Smat ta rbiafna bisa dem hawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:19">Fare I ncula Ya ifabebas farumi smate nesa ta en rfakangela sina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">fare bo ifabinga, Jou Lahatalla ni oras ta bo n'gali smat nana nlafo i to.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Nbaca hola, Yesuse nfalululo kitab cia, taga npo smat ta njaga manaca, taga I ntotolang. Farumi smat ta si mali ebai sombayang ciana datngalo Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Farumi ta mew flonga ta Ya ibaca mali Jou ni Kitab cana, wol tae farumi ndadi i to.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Gabe farumi smat ta manana rlonga ahai ta I nuna, rfaiyo fare ndadi rherang re I ni mautingna mafia. Ga hola tina si du laitane, “I cia Yusufe ntu i paga?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Japa mew bo fua nak mauting pusa, laitane, ‘Woe dokter, mfamafia Aw ni dirica su.’ Mew fu laina ningalena mew bo fsula Ya bo ipei mujizat mali Ya nike pnu tae, laisa ta Ya ipei mali pnu Kapernaumna. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Mew flolam famafia ta Ya bo iku tane. Nabi ta jaga rfaturusa Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw laisa re Ya, enpa ta bo daraga i mali i ni pnunana. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Gabe ta Ya ikuwa mew tina fatutua, i ni andeande laitane: tantuba, jaman nabi Elia, ulan pana taun faicol re nga siwonam, denabe smatna rmata an mali farumi batang Israel. Oras cia mali Israelna en ngolo balona lal. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ga makse laina ma, nabi Elia rcula i pa bo nfan lali smat ta i re si batang isana, naga Jouca ncula i nfan lali ngolo balo isa ta smat Israelna ntu re bburi i pa. Balo cia nteteam mali Sarfat batang Sidona. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Laina bena oras ta jaman nabi Elisa tantuba. Mali Israelna smatna lal ta rduk panyaket rpadona. Ga isa bere enpa smat mali Israelna ta Jouca nfamafia. Jou Lahatalla nfamafia be smat isa ta smat Israel i pa, i smat Siria i. Smat cia ngahnyo Naaman.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Oras ta si farumi ta en mali ebai sombayang cia rlonga Yesuse nmauting lainana, si rtolena gaole lali Yesus i. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Si farumi dosal taga rfaungo Yesus. Si dut Yesus lali ta maratopasna mali bendarca potalil. Bendar cia si rpei puis lolasca. Si dut I lali ta maratopasna bo rtaf I nap. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ga Yesuse nfane ncapang mali smat lalo cia hapalunori tina taga nfan i nfateam si mana.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo setan ta ncunge smat isa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mrk. 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan lali bendar Kapernaum mali batang Galilea. Etnga be wol Sabat wol ta smat Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa, I nfafcule smat mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Smat ta manana rlonga I ni fafculenana rherang, ningalena I nfafculena ni kawasana mamagal.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mali ebai sombayang ciana, smat isa setane ncung i, gabe i n'gigam, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ee Yesus smat Nasaret! Mati mcampurna re animam urusan. Mati mfamatam na. Ya ito Aw ise. Aw tane smat ta mberesi mali Lahatalla i mali.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Gabe Yesuse ntolea setan ta i mali smat cia, “Liomna! Msapang aw mali i!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:35">Setan cia npesa smat cia mali smat laloca uhngorina. Npesa i fola, setan cia ncapang mali smat cia, ga smat cia npepaisa pa.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Dem tina, farumi smat ta si manana rdadi rherang gabe rfauwo si laitane, “Gampang pa ni mau-mautingna, bisa i bena! I npake I ni kawasa nfaungo setanna rcapang mali smat cia fare si ma rcapang!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Gabe ahai ta Yesuse npei tina, ncapang mali farumi gagaw mali batang tina.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia Simone ohmo ta maping ica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Oras ta si rcapang mali ebai sombayang cia, Yesuse nfan lali Simone ni ebaica. Simone ohmo ta mapingi nowilna mamagal. Gabe si rdore bo Yesuse nfamafia i. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Gabe, Yesuse nfan lali Simone ohmo i, taga nosal mali lapona, taga I nfaungo owil cia. Oras cia to, Simone ohmo ma nmafia gabe i npaling, fare nleleane si rceli.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Oras ta wolca bo ncop, smatna rlafo dute riri smat ta dowilna lali Yesus i. Smat ta dowil tina panyaket lalo i. Gabe Yesuse nisin kakamona lali isa-isa ta dowil tina taga nfamafia si. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Manana, en smat sifis setane ncung si. Yesuse ncula setan tina rcapang mali smat tina. Setanna ma rcapang re rgigam laitane, “Aw tane Lahatalla ntu Aw.” Ga Yesuse ntolea si re liona mamagal, I ma nua si, mati ffabingana, ningalena setanna rto, Yesus cia Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatca.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga Abar Mafia mali ebai-ebai sombayang agama Yahudina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mrk. 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ni semaca dororam i sube, Yesuse nfateam bendar cia taga nfan lali gagaw isa ta namliley. Ga smatna lal diyawa be I. Oras ta si rfadukduk re I, si rmario bo rceya I, bo mati I nfateam sina. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ya tane nane ifan lali bendare nesana bo Ya bisa ifabinga hawe Abar Mafia ga Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela Ina, ningalena Jou Lahatalla ncula Ya mali dunia tae bo ifabinga Abar Mafia tina.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Mana mali, Yesuse nfane nfabinga Abar Mafia mali ebai-ebai sombayang agama Yahudina mali batang Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw ni murit-murit ta ntubana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mrk. 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Bahnga na, Yesuse nosal mali talaga Genesarete mtopo, gabe smatna lal rfakoskoso si bo rlonga Jou Lahatalla ni mautingna. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Oras cia, Yesuse nem pelang salu mali talagaca mtopo. Smat ta rfalabang mali pelang tasana rfalabange hola to. Si rduri mali pelangna to gabe rfaberesi si riri labangna. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Gabe Yesuse ncaplo pelang asa mana. Pelang tasa Simone ni pelang si. I ndor Simone nturka pelang tasa lalaw faokoce. Taga I ntotolang mali pelang tasa, taga nmulaine nfafcule smat lalo ta si mali talagaca mtopona.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Nfafcule hola, Yesuse nua Simon, “Simon, msali lalaw ta mlamanna, fare mdurea nim labangca mana bo duk iyan.” <figure style="fig" file="CN01705B.TIF" size="col" ref="5:3">Yesuse nfafcule smat lalo ta si mali talagaca mtopona</figure><verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simone nu, “Guru, ga doram pusa to, amame kningo iyanna, ga amame kduk paisa pa. Ga tane, ningalena Guru ta mfasula, ya osta idurea i hawe labang tae.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Gabe si rpei hola ahai ta Yesuse nculana, si rduk iyanna lal denabe riri labangca bo nmarasekan. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Gabe si dololaw riri del-delo ta en mali pelange nesana rlafo mali bo rgali si. Gabe, si riri del-delo ta pelange nesana rlafo gabe farerer si dafrao iyan mali pelang salu tasa denabe pelang saluna bo mduri. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Oras ta Simone nem Yesuse ni kawasa tina, i naftiba pupuo tasa nap Yesuse nbona, fare nu laitane, “Jou, mfateam ya to, ningalena ya tane smat ta ibaradosa!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simone nu laina, ningalena i re ni del-delo ta pelang asa tina rherang re iyan ta lal ta si rduk tina. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Laina hawe re Simone ni del-delona: Yakobus i re Yohanes, Zebedeuse ntuna. Si rherang dem iyan ta lal tina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Gabe Yesuse nua Simon, “Simon, mati mamcaitna! Aw jaga miyawa iyan, ga mulain oras tae aw miyawa smat bo si rderera Ya”. <figure style="fig" file="LB00212B.jpg" size="span" copy="David C. Cook" ref="5:10">Petrus i re ni del-delona rduk iyanna lal</figure><verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Fola tina, Simon i re ni delna rdu riri pelangna mali talagaca mtopo. Si rfateam farumi riri okosesi tina taga rderera Yesus.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa npado</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mrk. 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Bahnga na, Yesuse nfan lali bendar isa, ga mana en smat isa npado. Smat tae ni padona badanca farumi i. Oras ta smat tae nem Yesus, i naftiba pupuo tasa nap nyinyenca fare ndor laitane, “Apa, gabe Apa mailow, mfamafia ya!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Gabe, Yesuse nfatila smat cia fare nu, “Ya ikalow, aw mmafia. Gabe tane aw mafia to!” Oras tina to, smat cia ni padona mnyangis. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Gabe Yesuse nlarang smat cia mdel pa ta bo nafetngo smatna, I ta nfamafia aw. Yesuse nu, “Aw mfan lali imamca bo i nem aw mmafia to, fare aw mpo nim aiwani faisa bo mpo i sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla i, laisa ta nabi Musa nfasulana. Aw mpei laina bo ndadi fafayal lali smatna, aw fatutua ta mafia to.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ga makse Yesuse nu matina, i osta nafetang be ga Yesuse ni kawasa nfayangis panyaket tina. Gabe abar tina, ncapang manca-manca. Gabe nbang i ga lal smat ta rlafo rlonga Yesuse nfafcule fare rdore bo I nfayangis si riri panyaketna. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ga Yesuse jaga nfan lali gagaw ta mlileina bo ncombayang.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa ta nfanfan pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mrk. 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Bahnga na, Yesuse nfafcule smat mali ebai isa. Oras ciana en smat Yahudi diranca ta rderera fatfato Farisi fare en bena guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa. Si tina rtotolang rlonga I nfafculena. Si rlafo mali farumi pnu ta mali batang Galilea fare Yudea, fare mali bendar Yerusalem bena. Jou Lahatalla ni kawasana en mali Yesus i denabe I bisa nfamafia smat ta dowilna. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Garayanna, en smat diranca dute smat isa nfanfan pa, ga si rfatuli i puis musalaca. Si rmario bo rcunga smat ta nfanfan pa cia bo rfatigi mali ta Yesuse nbona. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ga smatna lalna gaole, si bisa rcunga i pa smat ta nfanfan paca. Gabe si rdawil nais ebaica rcalawe ni yatafna, taga rdurea smat ta nfanfan pa cia bahnga be re gagaw ta namtulo ica nap mali smat laloca fapaluan neta mali Yesuse nbona.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Oras ta Yesuse nem smat ta nfanfan paca ni delna rpei lainana, Yesuse nto, si rdela I. Gabe Yesuse nua smat ta nfanfan paca, “Apa, apa nim dosana Ya ikampunge to.” <figure style="fig" file="CN01685B.TIF" size="col" ref="5:20">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa ta nfanfan pa</figure><verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Rlonga ta Yesuse nu lainana, guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina rmauting mali wlori laitane, “I ise ga tae, denabe I npei ni dirica laisa Jou Lahatalla? Ningalena, isa pa ta bo nampunge smatna riri dosa, ta bisana Jou Lahatalla be.”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Ga Yesuse nto si wlorina. Gabe I nu laitane, “Pesaga mew ffikir lainana? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Oras ta Ya ikuwa smat ta nfanfan pa tae, ‘Apa nim dosana nduk ampunge to’, Mew laisa fdela pana ga smat cia ni dosana nduk ampunge to. Gabe laisa Ya iku, ‘Mpalinge bo mfane to’, mew osta fto Ya en nik kawasa ningalena mew fem i nfan. <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Gabe tane Ya bo ifamafia i, bo mew fto, mali dunia tae Smate ntu ta nlafo mali sorogaica, en nkawasa bo nampung smatna riri dosa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:24">Gabe Yesuse nua smat ta nfanfan pa cia, “Ya ikuwa aw apa, mpalinge to, mlange ni musalaca, fare muwe to lali nim ebai i!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Oras tina to, smat ta nfanfan pa cia nosal mali smat lalo tina uhngorina. Fare, i nlange ni musalaca taga nuwe lali i ni ebai i. Oras ta nuwena, i nfamamagal be Jou Lahatalla. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Dem ahai ta ndadi i tina, farumi smatna rherang gabe rfamamagal fare rcuba Jou Lahatalla. Fare rbasamna damcait si du laitane, “Wol tae ite teme to Jou npei okosesi ta mafia.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw Lewi bo nderera I</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mrk. 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Fola tina, Yesuse ncapang mali ebai cia, gabe I neme smat isa ta jaga nfayalo pajakca, ntotolang mali gagaw ta biasa rfayalo pajakna. Ta jaga nfayalo pajak cia ngahnyo Lewi. Yesuse nua i, “Mali bo mderera Ya!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Nlonga tina, Lewi nosal, nfateam farumi okosesina, taga nderera Yesus.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Fola tina, Lewi npei an mali ni ebaica taga nololaw Yesuse bo nceli mana. I nololaw bena, ni del-delo ta i re si rfayalo pajakna fare smate nesa ta manana bo rceli farerer. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Manana en bena smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi, fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa. Oras ta si dem Yesuse nceli farerer re smat ta du si rbaradosa tina, si rtole, gabe duwa Yesuse ni muritna, “E, pesaga mew re nimew Guruca fseli fare fdomna farerer re smat ta rfayalo pajakna fare smat ta rbaradosa nesa nana?” <figure style="fig" alt="." file="CN01691B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="5:28">Yesuse nololaw Matius bo nderera I</figure><verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesuse nlonga neta si du tina, gabe I nua si laitane, “Ga smat ta rcehatna pa ta rparlu mamana, ga smat ta dowilna. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ya ilafo bo ikololaw smat ta rbasam riri dirica damolangna pa, ga Ya ilafo bo ikololaw smat ta rbaradosana bo si diwane wlorina rderera Ya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ni muritna rpuasa pa oras ta i re si rfarererna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mrk. 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina, si rfautno Yesus, “Animam muritna jaga rpuasa fare rcombayang. Yohanese ni muritna ma laina bena. Pesaga Apa nim muritna rpuasa pa, taga rceli fare rdomna?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Gabe Yesuse ncanglo si npake andeande tae, “Laisa man ta nfasawca i mali rameca sube? Ncung akal pa, bo i ncula ni del-delona rceli re rdom pana, laisa I nfarerer re si mana sube. <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ga lomane ni orasna nlafo i, smatna rlafo bo jal manca mali ni del-delona, taga ni del-delona rceli re rdom pa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ni fafculena mdel pa bo ffabanga re agamaca ni fatfato ta smatna rpeina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mrk. 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Gabe Yesuse nua smat farisi tina npake andeande laitane, “Enpa smat ta bo dailow rcekane riri kabaya ta pona, taga rdilpe lali kabaya ta agonana. Ningalena kabaya ta poi cia bo nmayai, fare kabaya po cia pantas pa re kabaya ta ago i cia ni kaingna. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Laina bena, osta enpa smat ta dafrai anggur ta po subena nap anggur gagaw ta agona. Ningalena gabe laisa anggur gagao ta mali aiwani gico tina ago to ni gicoca ncicoale to. Gabe, smatna dafrai anggur po mali anggur gagao ta agona, osta anggur po tina ndawil, fare nfarapes anggur gagao ta agona, fare anggurna maraepa. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Gabe, anggur ta pona nane tisin mali gagao ta pona bena. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Smat ta biasa rndom anggur ta agona, i osta nailow panto bo ndom anggur ta ponana, ningalena anggur ta agona ni jame.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse ni muritna rkati gandum mali wol Sabatca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mrk. 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Bahnga na, neta wol ta smat Yahudina bisa rkarajan paca, Yesus I re ni muritna rfan rdel mali bet gandumca. Oras ciana, ni muritna rkati gandum ese, fare si rloba gicona rpake kakamorina taga dan. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mana, smat Yahudi diranca ta rderera fatfato Farisina. Si du laitane, “Pesaga mew fkarajan fkati gandum mali wol Sabat taena? Tina mew fsapiyal animam agamaca ni fatfatona!”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ga mew japa fbaca to mali Jou ni Kitabcana ga kolano Daut, oras ta i re ni smat ta rderera ina rbibisil. <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Kolano Daute ncung namul Jou Lahatalla ni Ebaica, taga nan roti ta ndadi sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla i tona. I ma noce rotina lali smat ta rderera Ina. Ga roti tina, gabe tderera animam agamaca ni fatfatona, imamna be ta danna.<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ya iku farumi tina, ningalena Smat ta mali sorogaica, ni kawasa bo nfato ahai ta smatna bisa rpei mali wol Sabat taena.” <figure style="fig" file="LB00101B.TIF" size="col" ref="6:2">Yesuse ni muritna rkati gandum mali wol Sabatca</figure><verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smatna neta wol Sabat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mrk. 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Bahnga na, mali wol Sabate nesana, Yesuse ncung mali ebai sombayang smat Yahudina ga nfafcule. Mana en smat isa kakamo welana nmat. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Mana bena en guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina. Si jelyelo be Yesus, gabe laisa I bo nfamafia smat mali wol Sabat tae, si bisa rduk laling bo du I ncal. Gabe si dailowe bo rto ga Yesus osta nfamafia smat mali wol Sabat tae pare enpa. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ga Yesuse nto wlorina, gabe nua smat ta kakamo pao nmat cia, “Mali aw mosal mali ta ibo tane!” <figure style="fig" file="CN01695B.TIF" size="col" ref="6:8">Yesuse nfamafia smatna neta wol Sabat</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:8">Gabe smat cia i lali ga nosal mana. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfautno smat ta si manana laitane, “Ya ifautno mew. Gabe tderera ite smat agama Yahudina rir fatfatona, ahai ta ite nane tpei mali wol Sabat taena? Tpei okosesi ta mafia pare tpei okosesi ta mayai? Tfasalamate smat pare tpune smat?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Gabe Yesuse natngalo si ndumi, fare nua smat ta kakamo pao nmat cia laitane, “Mtena kakamomna mali!” Smat cia npei laisa ta Yesuse nuna, fare kakamona ma mafia.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Dem tinana, smat ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare smat ta rderera fatfato Farisina, rtolena gaole. Gabe si mulaine rpei sogaro ta mayaina lali Yesus i.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw ni rasul yafasa re silu tasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mrk. 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Bahnga laitane, Yesuse nfan lali lolas isa bo ncombayang. Mana, I ncombayang doram pusa lolo lali Jou Lahatalla i. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Semaca dororam i sube, Yesuse nololaw smat ta jaga rderera Ina, taga I nfisang smat yafasa re silu mali sili. Smat yafasa re silu tasa ta bo rdadi I ni susula. Tane si ngahnyorina: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simon (ta Yesuse jaga nololaw i Petrusca), Andreas (Simone teno i), Yakobus, Yohanes, Filipus, Bartolomeus, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matius, Tomas, Yakobus (Alfeuse ntu i), Simon ta smatna du nfaungo smat roma ta rkawasa mali batang Israelna, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yudas (Yakobuse ntu i), fare Yudas Iskariot ta hola bo nwage Yesus ca.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule fare nfamafia smatna lal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Fola tina, Yesuse nduri puis lolasca nfarerer re ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, fare si rhola mali gagaw isa ta ntutiyai. Mana lale to smat ta jaga rderera Ina, fare smate nesana lal bena ta rlafo mali batang Yudea, mali bendar Yerusalem, fare mali Tirus re Sidon, bendar silu ta si mali olat lapo tasa. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Si rlafo bo rlonga Yesuse ni fafculena, fare bo I nfamafia si mali riri owilna, fare smat ta setane ncung sina rdadi rmafia. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Farumi smat ta si manana rmario bo dice Yesus, ningalena en kawasa ta ncapang mali I ni badancana ta npei farumi si rmafia.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rcangnang mali Jou Lahatalla uhngona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat. 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesuse natngalo ni muritna fare nu laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Fsangnangna gaole mew ta namew paisa pana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">ningalena, mew osta fdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smate mew ta I nkawasa ndadi Kolano.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Fsangnangna gaole mew ta oras tae fbibisilna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ningalena Jou Lahatalla osta npei mew fbibisil panto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Fsangnangna gaole oras tae ta ftangisna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ningalena Jou Lahatalla osta npei mew famlif.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Fsangnangna gaole makse smatna riri le mew fare dailowe mew pa, daraga mew pa fare rfamayai ngahnyomewna, ningalena mew fderera Ya.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Fsangnange to oras ta mew fduk tinana fare fsenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:23">ningalena Jou Lahatalla nfasiape namew sagige mulona mamagal mali soroga i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:23">Ga, laina bena ta si hma re hburi tantubana rpei ta mayai lali nabi ta jaga rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnawna.”<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Ga mew ta oras tae fkayangna, osta fkapalange to mew ya, ningalena mew fbasam sangnangca to mali nimew aratana.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ga mew ta oras tae fmosina, fkapalange to mew ya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ningalena mew osta fbibisil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ga mew ta oras tae famlifna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">fkapalange to, ningalena osta fmagogoru mew fare ftangis.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ga mew ta fiyawa taitail mali smat lalona, fkapalange to mew,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">ningalena tina laisa ndadi i tantuba mali nabi ta damolang pana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">Nabi ta nesana du, dut Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw, naga enpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">Mew hma re hnye mew tantubana jaga rfamamagal si.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fmasie nimew musuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat. 5:38-48</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Ga mew ta flonga Ya oras taena, Ya bo ikuwa mew laitane: mew nane fmasie smat ta wlori lolo mew pana, fare fpei ta mafia lali smat ta riri le mewna. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Fsombayange bo fdor Jou npo ta mafia lali smat ta rcasi mewna, fare fsombayang si bena smat ta wlorina mayai lali mewina. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Gabe laisa smat isa naspakale ngengeo mew paona, fpo hawe paona. Gabe laisa en smatna rcefto nim jubana, mfabiar i to nyale nimew kabayaca. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Gabe laisa en smatna rdor okosesi lali mewi, foce i to ahai ta i ndorna. Gabe laisa en smatca ncefto nimew okosesina, fabiar i to, mati mew fowla hawena ahai ta i ncefto tina. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Ga ahai ta mafia ta mew flokolo smatna rpeo mew, tina to ta mew nane fpeo smate nesana.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Ya isula laina, gabe laisa mew fmasiye be smat ta rmasiye mewna be, ni ngale pa mali Jou Lahatalla uhngona. Ningalena smat ta rderera Jou pana ma rmasiye smat ta rmasiye sina bena. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Gabe laisa mew fpei okosesi ta mafia lali smat ta jaga rpei okosesi ta mafia lali mewina, ni ngale pa mali Jou Lahatalla uhngona. Ningalena smat ta rderera Jou pana ma rpei okosesi ta mafia lali smat ta rpei okosesi ta mafia lali silina. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Gabe laisa mew ffabao tiwi lali smat ta fmaulango, bo niwan tiwi tina, ningale pa mali Jouca uhngona. Ningalena, smat ta rderera Jou pana ma jaga rpei laina bena, si bisa rduk hawe tiwi tina, enpa ta nkurang.<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ga mew mati fpei lainana! Mew nane fmasiye nimew musuna fare fpei ta mafia lali sili. Mew ffabao si ahai ta me namewna, fare mati fmaulango bo rfaweo mew hawena. Gabe laisa mew fpei laina, mew osta fduk sagige mulona mamagal. Gabe laisa mew fpei laina, mew osta fdadi laisa Jou Lahatalla ta tigoca ntu mew. Ningalena, Jou Lahatalla ni mafiana mali farumi smat, makse si wlorina mayai fare rto pa rdor tarima kasena. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mew nane faeme nimew masiyena lali smatna, laisa ite Hmar ta mali sorogaica nfaeme I ni masiyena lali farumi smat.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati ffasala smatnana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat. 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mati mew ffasala smate nesanana, bo Jou Lahatalla ma mati nfasala mewna. Mati ffasale smatna, bo Jouca ma mati nfasale mewna. Fampunge smatna bena, bo Jouca ma nampunge mew bena. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mew nane flokolo foce smatna okosesi, bo Jouca ma noce mew bena. Ngisngis ta nmafia Jouca bo npo mew, tina laisa smat ta rngis pinge denabe ngisngisca nbakbak, fare ntibe i bo nfaifif taga nbang hawe denabe nmaraepa. Gabe laisa mew ffaocena okoce be, Jouca ma osta noce mewna ma okoce be. Gabe, laisa mew ffaocena lal, Jouca ma osta noce mewna lal bena.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesuse nu hawe andeande isa laitane, “Ncung akal pa smat ta nbiafca bo nfafcule laling lali smat ta nbiaf bena cana. Smat silu tasa osta rmarapawlo lopna. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Enpa murit ta foloi mali ni gurucana. Gabe laisa i ni guruca nfacule i, i osta ndadi laisa ni guruca bena.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Mew mati ftarokira be smatna riri sal ta nenena nana, taga nimew sal ta mamagalna fatengtengna. Tina laisa ai mumuno mali ramamewca mtana, mew ftarukira i, taga balak ungo ta ntibane mtamew naca ftarokira i pa. <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Gabe mfalaisa bo fuwa ramamcana, ‘Ramak ta aw, mali bo isalawe ai mumuno ta mali mtamnaca,’ taga balak ungo ta mali mtamnaca mfatengtengna i. Ee, mew tane smat ta fmadarawa, fsapnga isu balak ungo ta mali mtamew naca, taga mew femna mafia, bo mew bisa fsalawe ai mumuno ta mali ramamewca mtana.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat cia nmafia fare nmayaina, tto mali ahai ta nu fare ta npeina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat. 7:16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Yesuse nu andeande isa hawe, “Ai ta nbokaca bisa pa bo piyona mayaina. Laina bena ai ta nboka paca, bisa pa bo piyona mafiana. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Smatna osta rto, ai ohlo aisa nmafia pare nmayaina mali piyona. Ga osta enpa tkati ara piyo mali ai ta ni soganana, fare osta bisa pa tkati anggur piyona mali mom ta ni soganana. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Laina bena smat ta rmafiana. I ni mautingna, fare ta i npei tina mafia, ningalena ta mali wlona okosesi ta mafia. Ga smat ta rmayaina, i ni mauting fare ta npeina mayai, ningalena ta mali i wlonana okosesi ta mayai. Ningalena ahai ta smat cia nuna mafia pare mayai, farumi tina ncapang mali smat cia wlona.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rdelana nane rpei ahai ta Yesuse nuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat. 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Pesa mew fololaw Ya, ‘Jou, Jou’, naga mew fpei pa ahai ta Ya ikuna? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Smat ta rlafo mali Ya i fare rlonga ta Ya ikuna fare rpei tina, i laisa smat ta npande mali andeande taena: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Smat ta npande cia nfaosal ebai. I n'gali rakrakcana mlaman, taga npei fandasi npake pat ta cicoalna. Taga nfaosal ebai cia puis fandasi cia popo. Gabe oras ta ipisca nlafo fare nyof ebai cia, ebai cia ncicoal ningalena ebai cia rfaosal i mali fandasi ta ncicoalca popo. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ga smat ta nlonga ahai ta Ya iku ga i npei pa, i laisa smat isa ta nfaosal ebai mali nyinyenca popo, mali fandasica popo pa. Gabe oras ta ipisca nlafo, ebai cia namop, fare nmaraluka ndumi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia tentarana riri komandanca ni smat karajan isa nowil</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat. 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Oras ta Yesuse nmautinge fola re smat laloca, I nfan lali bendar Kapernaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mali bendar cia, tentara Romawina riri ta nfaboboko sica. I ni smat karajan isa ta n'gogoru ica. Nowilna mamagal, denabe bo nmat. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Oras ta komandan cia nlonga ga du Yesusna, i ncula simosimo diranca mali smat Yahudina rfane bo dololaw Yesus, ndore bo nfamafia ni smat karajanca. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Gabe oras ta simosimo Yahudi tina rlafo Yesus, si rdore bo I n'gali komandan cia. Si duwa Yesus, “Apa e! Komandan tae ta mafiana Apa mgali i. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Ningalena, i n'gogoru am smat Yahudina fare i bena n'gali am kfaosale nimam ebai sombayangcana, naga i cia, agama Yahudi i pa.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Gabe Yesuse nfan nfarerer re si. Oras ta Yesuse ndahle komandan cia ni ebaica, komandan cia nua ni del-delona bo rfadukduk re Yesus taga du laitane, “Apa! Mati mfakangela awe bo mlafo mali nik ebai taena, ningalena ya pantas pa bo ikailow Apa mali nik ebai taena. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Gabe tina, ya ibasamna imampo pa bo ibo Apana. Ta mafiana Apa mu mauting fapusa mali mantane, osta nik smat karajan cia nmafia. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ningalena, ya ito Apa msula smatna rdadi rmafia, laisa amam tentarana bisa kparenta tentarana. Ya nik atasan ta nkawasa ya, fare ya ma nik wawai ta rlonga ya. Gabe laisa ya iparenta nik wawaina, ‘Mfan!’ Osta i nfan. Gabe laisa ya isula nik wawai ta nesana, ‘Mlafo!’ Osta i nlafo. Fare ya isula nik wawai karajan ta nesana, ‘Fpei tane!’ Osta rpei ahai ta ya isula si tina.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Nlonga komandanca ni mauting ta rfalafo tina, Yesuse ndadi nherangna gaole ningalena komandan cia ni delana cicoal. Gabe Yesuse nfulasi nbo smat lalo ta rderera Ina taga nu laitane, “Flonga famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane, bahnga paube Ya iduke smat isa mali batang Israel ta ni delana cicoal laisa smat ta mali batang Roma taena!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Oras ta smat ta komandanca ncula si tasa rlolai lali komandanca ni ebai i, si dem smat karajan cia nmafia to.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfapaling I hawe ngolo baloca ntu ta nmatca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan lali bendar isa ta ngahnyo Nain. I ni muritna fare smate nesana lal bena rfan rfarerer re I. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Oras ta Yesuse i re smat laloca bo rdahle lali bawa ta bo rcung bendar cia, en smat diranca rcapang rpapa smat isa nmat. Ta nmat cia ngolo baloca ntu man i, taga isa cia be. Fare lal bena smat mali bendar cia ta rderera ngolo cia ga rfagaile. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Oras ta Jou Yesuse nem ngolo balo cia, I nbasamna nmasie i. Gabe I nua ngolo cia, “Ngolo, mati mtangisna to e!”<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />I ndahle smat ta rpapa smat ta nmat cia, fare I nice babailean cia. Fare smat ta rpapa smat ta nmat cia rhola. Gabe Yesuse nu laitane, “Wai man po! Ya ikuwa aw, mpalinge to!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Yesuse nu hola tina, wai ta nmat cia npaling hawe. I ntotolang, taga nmulaine nmauting. Gabe Yesuse npo wai cia lali hnye i.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Farumi smat ta dem ahai ta ndadi i tina, si damcait gabe rfamamagal re rcuba Jou Lahatalla laitane, “Nabi mamagal isa i mali iti mantane! Jou Lahatalla fatutua nlafo to bo n'gali I ni smatna!” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Abar ahai ta Yesuse npei tina ncapange to mali farumi gagaw puli batang Yudea re farumi batang ta ndahle manana.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohanes ta ncisope smatca ni muritna rfautno Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat. 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Yohanes ta nfasisopca en i ni murit. Murit tina rfabinga Yohanes ga farumi ta Yesuse npeina. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Nlonga tina, Yohanese nololaw ni murit silu taga ncula si lali Jou Yesus i bo rfautan laitane, “Apa, Apa to ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo mlafo tina? Pare amame nane ktotoman ta nesana?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Oras ta smat silu tasa rlafo lali Yesus i, si du laitane, “Yohanes ta nfasisopca, ncula am kfautno Apa laitane, ‘Apa, Apa to ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo mlafo tina? Pare amame nane ktotoman ta nesana?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Oras ta si rlafo tina, Yesuse nfamafia smatna lal mali riri panyaketna, panyaketna rupa lalo i. I ma nfaungo setan ta rcunge smatnana. Fare I bena nfamafia smat ta rbiafna denabe si bisa dem hawe. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Gabe Yesuse nua Yohanese ni muritna laitane, “Mew flolai lali Yohanes i taga fabinga ahai ta mew fem fare flongana: smat ta rbiafna ndadi dem, smat ta rfanfan pana ndadi rfanfan, smat ta rpadona rmafia, smat ta rlonga pana rlonga, smat ta rmatna rpaling hawe fare smat ta riri re rari pana rlonga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i.” <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Fare Yesuse ncula si duwa Yohanes hawe, “Smat ta ntaf Ya pa ga nailow Ya fare ndela turus, i cia ta ncangnang.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Oras ta Yohanese ni muritna rfane to, Yesuse mulaine nua smat lalo ta si manana ga Yohanis. I nu laitane, “Oras ta Yohanese nfafcule mali padang gurun, gagaw ta namliley nalaspa mali pnu i, mew ffan lalina bo fpesa? Pare mew bo fem smat ta wol tae nu nesa mdoma nu nesa, laisa mom ta ngangala lali re mali ningalena latanca nufi? Osta enpa, pa ga? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Pare bo ahai mew ffan lalina? Pare mew bo feme smat ta rpake kabaya mafiana? Osta enpa, paga? Ningalena smat ta jaga npake kabaya mafia fare ta rtubna rcangnangna, si gagaori mali kolanoca ni ebai i. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Gabe bo ahai mew ffan lalina? Mew ffane fem Yohanes! Ningalena i cia nabi ta jaga rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw. Fatutua to! Ga mew flolam e, Yohanes cia nfoloi mali nabi ta biasana. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ningalena ta ntuba mali be Jou ni Kitabca ene rlefo ga i laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Ftarokira e! Ya bo isula nik susulaca bo ntuba mali Awi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">I cia ta bo ncalawe laling, bo nfasiape smatna wlorina bo dailow Aw.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Flolam famafia e, mali farumi smat ta mapingna rdadikna si mali dunia tae, isa pa ta nmamagal foloi mali Yohanes ta nfasisopcana. Ga tane, ise be makse smat nenena i, gabe Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali i ni tubca, smat cia nmamagalna foloi mali Yohanes i.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Farumi smat ta rlonga ahai ta Yesuse nu tina, fare smat ta rfayalo pajakna, si rfatuwo Jou Lahatalla tina fatutua, ningalena si rduk sisop mali Yohanes i to. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ga smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi re guru agamana, si dailow pa bo Yohanese nsisop sina, gabe re laina, si dailow pa bo rderera Jou Lahatalla ni rencana bo si riri tubcana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Ya bo ifatailo smat ta rtub oras taena re ahai, ga si tina laisa ahai e? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ya ifatailo si laisa re wawai ta rtotolang mali pasar ina, ga rfable rgigam lali riri del-delona laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‘Amame kuf suling bo mew, ga mew fowa pa. Amame kmanyanyi nyanyian matmat, ga mew ftangis pa.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Mew laisa wawai tina. Ningalena oras ta Yohanes ta nfasisopca nlafona, mew failowi pa. I nan roti pa re ndom anggur pa, ga mew fu, ‘I setane ncung i’. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Tane, Ya Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica ilafo to. Ya ipuasa pa fare Ya ma jaga idom anggur. Ga mew fu, ‘Co fem! Smat tae nmasefsefat fare nmadom. I ma jaga nfadeldelo re smat ta rfayalo pajakna, fare smat ta rbaradosa nesana.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ga makse mew failow Ya re Yohanes pa, Jou Lahatalla ni mafiana osta mew fem oras ta smat ta rderera Jou Lahatalla ni mautingna, nfaem si riri tubna mafia ndumi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maping isa ta nbaradosaca nmomsa egat pau mafia mali Yesuse ficona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />En smat Yahudi isa mali fatfato Farisina, i ngahnyo Simon. I nololaw Yesuse bo nceli mali ni ebai i. Yesuse nlafo lali i ni ebai i, gabe ntotolang nceli mana. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mali pnu cia, maping isa ta smatna rto i maping mayai i. I nlonga Yesuse nceli mali smat Farisi cia ni ebai i. Gabe i nlafo mana nut egat pau mafia ta mulona mamagal mali botol isa. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />I nosal mali Yesuse taona, ndahle Yesuse ficona, taga ntangis. I nfasisongit Yesuse ficona re i na oyangna, taga i ntolase ga nfamang re i ni utana. I nfatan Yesuse ficona, fare nepo egat pau mafia mali Yesuse ficona. <figure style="fig" file="CN01778B.TIF" size="col" ref="7:38">Maping isa ta nbaradosa nmomsa egat pau mafia mali Yesuse ficona</figure><verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Oras Simon ta nololaw Yesus ca nem ahai ta maping cia npeina, i nututa mali wlona laitane, “Gabe laisa Yesus fatutuwa nabi i, I osta nto ise maping ta nice Ica, fare mfalaisa maping cia ni tabeatna. I osta nto, maping cia maping mayai i.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Ga Yesuse nua Simon laitane, “Simon, en ta Ya bo ikuwa awna.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simone nu, “Mu to, Guru.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Gabe Yesuse nu, “En smat silu rbawi tiwi mali smat isa ta jaga nfabawo tiwi. Smat isaca nbawi slubilim tiwi dinarna, fare isaca nbawi yafalim tiwi dinarna. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ga smat silu tasa dafena panto bo rhawe tiwi tinana. Gabe smat ta nfabawo si tiwi cia nfayangise si riri linganna. Tane laisa aw Simon, ise mali smat silu tasa ta ni masiyena foloi mali smat ta nfabawo si tiwica?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simone ncanglo, “Japa smat ta rfayangise ni lingana lalca laha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesuse nu, “Aw msanglo tina molang.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Gabe, Yesuse nning-ningo maping cia, fare nua Simon, “Simon, aw mem maping tae. Oras ta Ya ilaho lali aw nim ebai i, aw mfasiap waya pa bo Ya ikuwase ficok, laisa ta ite jaga tpeona. Ga maping tae, i nfaberesi Ya ficokna npake i na oyangna taga ntolas nfamang re i ni utana. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Nanai oras ta Ya ilafo malina, aw mfatan Ya pa laisa ta ite jaga tpei bo ttotoman smat ta rlafona. Ga maping tae, Ya ilafo denabe tane, i nfolhola pa nfatan Ya ficoknana. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Aw bena mduplo filifan pa egat mali Ya bobokok taena, tderera laisa ta ite ttotoman smat ta rlafona. Ga maping tae, i nduplo egat pau mafia mali Ya ficokna. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Gabe tina, flonga famafia e, maping tae ni dosa ta lal tina nduk ampunge to. Gabe i, nfaeme ni masie ta mamagalna mali Ya i. Ga laisa smatca ni dosana okocebe, okocebe bena i nfaeme ni masiyena, ningalena okocebe i ni dosa ta dampungna.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua maping cia “Aw nim dosana ikampunge to!”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Rlonga tina, smat ta rceli farerer re Yesusna, dututa mali wlori laitane, “I nu japa I Jou Lahatalla laha ta bisa nampunge smatna riri dosa?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ga Yesuse nua maping cia, “Aw msalamate to ningalena aw mdela Ya. Gabe muwe to re wlomna tengtengan!”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Maping-maping ta rgali Yesusna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfane nyel bendar fare pnuna, I nfabinga Abar Mafia ga Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela Ina. I ni murit yafasa re silu tasa rfarerer re I, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />fare en bena maping diranca ta rfarerer re Ina. Mali maping-maping tina en bahngana Yesuse nfaungo setan, fare en bena ta Yesuse nfayangise riri owilna. Isa mali silina ngahnyo Maria, ta jaga smatna du Magdalena, bahngana Yesuse nfaungo setan sifit mali i ina. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />En bena Yohana, Khuza ni ngolota. Khuza tae ta nfaboboko smat ta rkarajan mali kolano Herodese ni istanaca. Fare en ta ngahnyo Susana, re lal sube mapinge nesana. Farumi maping tane rpake riri aratana rgali Yesus I re ni muritna riri tubca wol de wol.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande gei ta ntub mali rakrak gagaw pifat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat. 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mrk. 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bahnga na, smatna lal rlafo mali pnu-pnuna rfayalo si lali Yesus i. Oras ta si rfayalo ndumi si to, Yesuse nfabinga andeande isa laitane, <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“En smat bet isa, i nfane ncake gei mali beti. Oras ta i ncake gei tina, en gei ta marapawil mali lalingca lapo gabe smatna rfilo. Fare manina rlafo ga dan gei tina denabe myei. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />En gei ta nesana marapawil mali rakrak ta ni patna. Gei tina ntub ga ndadi mang ningalena nduk waya pa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ga en bena gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta ni momna soga. Mom ta soga tina ntub farerer re gei tina ga mom ta sogana mamagalna foloi, gabe nlataf gei ta ntube to tina denabe nmat. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ga en gei ta nesana marapawil mali rakrak ta nboka. Gei tina ntub fare piyona lal denabe tuwtuaf slubisa.” <figure style="fig" file="LB00094B.TIF" size="col" ref="8:8">Andeande smat ta ncake gei mali rakrak gagaw pifat</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Nu hola andeande cia, Yesuse nu hawe, “Flonga tina famafia, fare fising mali wlomew!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gei ta marapawil mali rakrak gagaw pifat tina ni ngale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mrk. 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Fola tina, Yesuse ni muritna rfautno I, andeande ta nanai cia ni ngale ahai. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Gabe Yesuse ncanglo, “Jou Lahatalla npei bo mew fto mfalaisa I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano, mali smate nesana, tina Ya ifabinga ipake andeande, bo re laina, ‘Makse si dem, si rtaif pa ahai ta si demna. Makse si rlonga, si rtaif pa, ahai ta si rlongana.’ <verse eid="LUK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Tae andeande ta nana cia ni ngalena: Gei tina Jou Lahatalla ni mauting. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Gei ta marapawil mali lalingca lapona, tina laisa smat ta rlonga to Jou Lahatalla ni mautingna ga setane ni kolanoca nlafo fare nyal Jou ni mautingna mali si wlorina, bo si mati rdelana fare rcalamatna mali riri dosana. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta ni patna, tina laisa smat ta rlonga Jou ni mauting fare dailow tina re wlorina sangnang. Ga mauting tina si dising famafia pa mali wlorina, gabe ntahanna mnu pa. Gabe laisa si rduk susa re kangela, si rdela Jou panto. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta ni momna soga, tina laisa smat ta rlonga Jou ni mauting, ga si wlorina tengtengan pa re si riri tubcana, si diyawa be arata, fare rlokolo tubca ncangnang be. Gabe Jou ni mauting ta si rlonga tina si rpei pa, denabe mauting tina ni ngale pusa pa, laisa gei ta piyo pana. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ga gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta nbokana, tina laisa smat ta rlonga Jou ni mauting, si dising mauting tina mali wlori ta mafiana, fare si rpei turus mauting tina mali si riri tubca wol de wol.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande laisa padamarana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mrk. 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Enpa smat ta rtaping padamara taga rtabak padamara cia re paisa nesa pene pa dising i mali baleca papapona. Ga ta molangna padamara cia nane rfatigi mali i gagaona bo farumi smat ta rcung mali ebai ciana dem padamaraca plangnona. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Tina ni ngale, ahai ta oras tae fgoganna, ga smatna bo rto, fare farumi ta ncapang pana osta bo ncapang bo smatna dem. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Gabe tina, flonga famafia ahai ta Ya iku tane. Gabe, laisa smatna rlonga ahai ta Ya iku tane, osta Jou Lahatalla n'gali i bo ntaifna foloi. Ga smat ta rlonga pa ahai ta Ya iku tane, ahai ta i nu ntaifna, Jou Lahatalla osta nyal hawe mali i ina.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rpei Jouca ni mauting, i cia Yesuse ni smat i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mrk. 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Bahnga na, Yesuse hnye re rama re tenona rlafo bo dem I, ga si rdahle lali pa ningalena smatna lal. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Manana en smat isa ta nfabinga Yesus, “Apa, Apa hnyem ramamna re tenomna si po talil. Si dailow bo rfadukduk re Apa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Gabe Yesuse nu, “Ise ta nlonga fare npei Jou Lahatalla ni mauting, si to Ya hnyek ramak re tenokna.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfahola latan ta ncicoalca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mrk. 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Bahnga na, Yesus i re ni muritna rdawil pelang asa. I nua si, “Mali to bo it lali talaga tae puli pao.” Gabe si lali. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Orasta si rfalaina, Yesuse namtuli. Rgarayana, latanca nufna ncicoal gabe si riri pelang tasa bakbaka re waya, denabe si bo damduri.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Gabe Yesuse ni muritna dolol I gabe duwa I, “Guru, Guru, ite bo tmat tane ya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesuse npaling gabe nfahola latan fare mumat mamagal tina. Fare, latan re mumat tina nhola, gabe talaga cia ndadi namnin.<verse eid="LUK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Gabe Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Pesaga mew ffdela Ya pana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Si rdadi damcait fare rherang, gabe rfauwo si, “Smat tae ise ga denabe, I ncula latan fare mumatna gabe latan fare mumatna rderera ta I nunana!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo setan mali smat isa puli batang Gerasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:2-34">Mat. 8:2-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:5-20">Mrk. 9:5-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesus I re ni muritna rfalai turus denabe rlafo talaga Galilea puli pao, mali smat Gerasana riri batang. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Oras ta Yesuse nduri mali pelang tasa, man isa nlafo lali Yesus i. I setanna lal rcung i. I nlafo mali bendar ta ndahle manana fare mnu to i npake kabaya pana fare mnu to nteteam mali ebai i pana, i nteteam be mali piling goana. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Laina i nem Yesus, i n'gigam fare naftiba pupuo tasa nap mali Yesuse nbona. Fare i nmautingna nfacicoali nu laitane, “Adodo Yesus Jou Lahatalla ta tigo molangca ntu Aw! Aw bo mpeo ya ahai? Ya idor mati mfasusa yana.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Smat cia nua Yesus laina, ningalena Yesus taga ncula setan tina rcapang mali smat cia. Ningalena setan tina ta jaga rkawasa i, denabe smat ta mali bendar ciana rpitane kakamo fare ficona rpake rante bo rtahan i. Ga smat cia nfaorit rante tina, gabe setanna duti lali padang gurun, gagaw ta namliley fare laspa mali pnuna. <figure style="fig" file="CN01709B.TIF" size="col" ref="8:29">Yesuse nfaungo setan mali smat isa puli batang Gerasa</figure><verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Gabe Yesuse nfautno setan ta en mali smat ciana, “Aw ngahnyom ise?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Setan cia ncanglo, “Amame ngahnyomamna? Legion,” Ligione ningalena lalna gaole setan ta rkawasa smat ciana.<verse eid="LUK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Gabe setan tina rdor lali Yesus i, bo mati ncunga si namul gagaw ta jaga rtahan setannaca.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Lawpa mali tinana, bouna lal oras ta diyawa an mali lolase ppunana. Gabe setan tina rdor lali Yesus i, bo I nfabiar si rcung mali bow tina. Gabe Yesuse nderera ta si duna. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Gabe setan tina rcapang mali smat cia, taga rcung mali bowna. Hola tina, bowna rfarera lali ta maratopasna lapo, fare farumi rtasapil nap talagaca gabe rmat mana.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Smat ta rjaga bowna dem tina, si rfarera. Rlafo mali bendar fare pnu-pnu ta ndahle manana, si dafetang farumi ta ndadi i tina. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Fola tina, smat ta mali bendar cana fare mali pnu-pnu ta ndahle manana rlafo bo dem ahai ta ndadi ina. Si rlafo lali Yesus i ga dem smat ta setane ncungica ntotolang ndahle Yesuse ficona, i nmafia to fare npake kabaya to. Dem tina, si ndadi damcait. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Smat ta dem farumi tina, si dafetang lali smat ta rlafo manana, mfalaisa denabe smat ta setane ncungi cia nmafiana. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Gabe farumi smat ta mali batang Gerasana rdor lali Yesus I bo I nfanenowe riri batangna ningalena si farumi damcaitna gaole. Gabe tina Yesuse ndawil mali pelang tasa taga rfalai hawe.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Smat ta nanai setane ncungi cia ndor lali Yesus i bo nderera Yesus. Ga Yesuse ncula i nfan i. Yesuse nu <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Ta mafiana, aw muwe to lali nim ebai i, fare mafetang farumi ta Jou Lahatalla npeo awna.” Gabe smat cia nuwe fare nafetngo smatna mali farumi gagaw mali bendar cia farumi ta Yesuse npeo i na.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfapaling Yairuse ntu ta nmatca fare nfamafia maping ta nfanye laflafca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mrk. 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Oras ta Yesuse nlolai mali talagaca puli pao mali, smatna lal rtotoman I re rbasamna rcangnang, ningalena farumi si rtotoman I. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Oras ciana, smat isa nlafo Yesus, i ngahnyo Yairus. I cia ta nfaboboko si mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina isa. I naftiba pupuo tasa nap Yesuse uhngona, ndore bo Yesuse nlafo lali ni ebai i. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Ningalena, i ntuca isaca be nowilna mamagal denabe bo nmat. I ntu cia maping i, ni umurna sal pana taun yafasa re failu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesuse nfan lali Yairuse ni ebaica. Oras ta Yesuse rfan lalina, smatna lal ta rfakoskos lali bo rdahle Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mali smat ta lal tina, en maping isa taun yafasa re failu to nkangela ningalena nfanye laflaf. I ni aratana mnyei to ningalena npake nfalalaw mali farumi dokter, Ga isa pa ta bo nfamafia ina. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Maping cia ndahle Yesus mali taona taga i ndumi Yesuse ni jubaca cicapona. Oras tina to, i nfanye laflafna ma nhola i. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesuse nfautan, “Ise ta ndumi Yaca?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Farumi smatna isa ncanglo pa. Gabe Petruse nua Yesus, “Guru, en smatna lal ta rfakoskos re Guru tane!” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Yesuse nu, “Ga fatutuwa smat isa ndumi Ya, ningalena Ya ibasam en kawasa ta ncapang mali Ya nik badan tae bo ifamafia i.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Maping cia nbasam ahai ta i npei tina bisa n'gogan pa, gabe namderer i lali naftiba pupuo tasa nap Yesuse nbona. Mali farumi smat tamanana uhngorina, i nafetang mfalaisa denabe i idumi Yesuse ni juba ciana. I ma nu oras ta ya idumi Yesusna, tina to ya imafia.<verse eid="LUK 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Gabe Yesuse nua maping cia, “Ngolo, tane aw mafia to ningalena mdela Ya. Muwe to re wlomna tengtengan.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ga Yesuse nmauting sube, smat isa mali Yairuse ni ebaica nlafo gabe nua Yairus, “Apa, apa ntumca nmate to. Gabe mati mfaboboko ntoi Gurucana to.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Oras ta Yesuse nlonga ahai ta smat cia nuna, I nua Yairus, “Mati mamcaitna, mdela be. Ningalena ntumca osta npaling hawe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Oras ta si rlafo to mali Yairuse ni ebaica, Yesuse nailow pa bo smatna rcung namulna. Ga ta rcungna langisa Petrus, Yohanes, Yakobus fare wai cia hma fare hnye be. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Farumi smatna rtangisna rmasisewle mali wai ta nmat cia. Ga Yesuse nu, “Mati ftangisna. Wai tae nmat pa. I namtuli be.” <figure style="fig" file="LB00311B.TIF" size="col" ref="8:52">Yesuse nfapaling Yairuse ntu ta nmatca</figure><verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Rlonga ta Yesuse nu lainana, si damlifa I, ningalena si rto wai cia nmate to. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Fola tina Yesuse nice wai cia kakamona fare nu laitane, “Wai ta aw, mpalinge to!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Fare wai cia npaling hawe, fare nosal. Hola tina Yesuse ncula si rfaseli wai cia. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Wai cia hma re hnye tasa rherangna gaole. Ga Yesuse nua si, “Mdel pa fafetngo smatna ahai ta ndadi i tina.”<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncula ni muritna rfabinga Abar Mafia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mrk. 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesuse nololaw ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, taga npo si cicoal fare kawasa bo rfaungo setan fare bo rfamafia smat ta rpanyaketna rupa lalo i. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Hola tina, Yesuse ncula si rfane bo rfabinga smatna ga mfalaisa Jou Lahatalla bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali ni smatna fare I ncula si rfane rfamafia smat ta dowilna. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Oras ta si rfan paube, Yesuse nfatnawe si, “Mati ffut fapaisana mali fanfancana. Mati ffut titialna, tasna, anna, tiwina fare pake afianna. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Laisa en ta dailowe mew mali si riri ebai i, fteteam mana to denabe fdirake mew mali bendar cia. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Laisa en ta dailowe mew pa, mew fsapang mali si riri bendar cia, fare pepesa ta en mali ficomewna ffatibtibe mana, bo si rlolam, si rcale to mali Jou Lahatalla i.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Fola tina, Yesuse ni muritna rfan jele pnuna, rfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i fare rfamafia smat ta dowilna mali farumi gagaw.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolano Herodese niyawa bo nto Yesus tae ise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mrk. 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Oras tina, Herodes ta ndadi kolano mali batang Galilea. I nlonga ndumi ga ahai ta Yesuse npeina. I wlona kangela ningalena, smatna du, Yesus cia Yohanes ta nfasisopca ta popise i nmate ga npaling hawe. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />En bena ta nesana du, Yesus cia nabi Elia ta popiseica ga nlafo hawe. Fare en bena ta du, Yesus cia isa mali nabi tantubana ga npaling hawe.<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Gabe kolano Herodese nu, “Wol cana ya ifasula rkati Yohanese bobokoca, ga ise hawe Smat tae? Ya ilonga to ga mujizat ta Yesuse npeina.” Gabe Herodese niyawa lalinge bo nfadukduk re Yesus.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfatub smat lalan lim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mrk. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Yesuse ni murit ta ncula si tasa, rlolaie to. Si dafetngo Yesuse ndumi ta si rpeina. Hola tina, Yesuse nut si lali gagaw isa ta namliley ndahle bendar ta ngahnyo Betsaidaca bo si rtutuling mana. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ga smatna lal ta rto gagaw ta Yesus I re ni muritna rfanyo ica. Gabe si rfane rderera I. Yesuse nailow si famafia fare nafcule si mfalaisa Jou Lahatalla bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano lali smat ta rdela Ina, fare I ma nfamafia smat ta dowilna.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Orascana bo dorame to, Yesuse ni murit yafasa re silu tasa rlafo lali Yesus i gabe du, “Guru, gagaw tae namliley fare nalaspa mali pnu i. Ta mafiana msula smat ta lal tane rfane bo diyawa an fare diyawa gagaw ta bo damtulina, mali pnu-pnu ta ndahle mali tanena.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ga Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Mew ta nane fatub si!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">I ni muritna du, “Guru, ta en mali amam i tane roti pilim fare iyan silu be. Gabe laina nane amame kfane kgon an hawe bo kfatub farumi smat tane.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Yesuse ni muritna du laina ningalena smat ta manana lalorina japa lalan lim, tina tetang manna be.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Gabe Yesus nua ni muritna, “Fsula si bo rtotolang rfayalo si. Gagaw isa japa smat yafalim.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Gabe muritna rpei ahai ta Yesuse nculana. Si rcula farumi smat tina rtotolang. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Oras ta si rtotolang, Yesuse nyal roti pilim fare iyan silu tasa. I natngal nais langitca, fare nu tarima kase Jou Lahatalla. Taga, I nfawogwogla roti tina taga npo lali ni muritna bo si rlowto smat lalo tina. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Gabe si farumi rceli denabe rmosi. Rceli hola, Yesuse ni muritna rfayalo an ta gleona. Ni lalona en pupurang yafasa re pilu.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petruse nfatuwo Yesus cia Mesias</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat. 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mrk. 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Bahnga na, Yesuse ncombayange ntutuling. I ni muritna ma en mana bena rdahle I. Ncombayange hola, Yesuse nfautno ni muritna, “Ta mew flongana, smatna du Ya tane ise?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Si rcanglo, “En ta du, Guru cia Yohanes ta nfasisopca npaling hawe. En ta du, Guru cia nabi Elia nlafo nduri mali sorogai. En hawe ta du, Guru cia isa mali nabi tantubana ga npaling hawe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Gabe I nfautno si hawe, “Gabe laisa mew, Ya tane ise?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petruse ncanglo, “Guru cia Mesiase to, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo mfasalamate smatca.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Fola tina Yesuse nua si, “Mdel pa ta fabinga smatna Ya tane Mesias.”<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga I bo nmat fare mfalaisa ni laling ta bo tderera Ina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat. 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mrk. 8:31</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Fola tina Yesuse nu hawe, “Smate ntu ta mali sorogai ca, nane nduk kangelana lal, fare dailowi pa simosimo Yahudina, imamna riri ta rfaboboko si fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa. I osta nduk punpun denabe nmat, ga wol pitol Jou Lahatalla nfapaling I hawe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Yesuse nua si farumi, “Ise ta bo nderera Ya, i bisa pa bo nderera i wlonana. Ga wol re wol i nane nciap nduk kangela denabe nmat ningalena nderera Ya, tina fatailo laisa i npapa ni salipca bo nderera Ya. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ningalena, ise ta ntube ga nem be i ni tubca ntutuling, i cia nmatna osta i re Jou Lahatalla pa denabe lali. Ga smat ta nderera i wlona pa ningalena i nderera Ya, i cia osta nduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ni ngale pusa pa o, gabe laisa smat isa nduke ndumi arata ta mali dunia tae, ga nmatna i re Jou Lahatalla pa denabe lali. <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ningalena ise ta nmai bo nfatuwo i nderera Ya fare nderera Ya nik fafculena, lomanta oras ta Smate ntu ta mali sorogaca nlafo hawe, Ya ma osta imai bo ifatuwo i nderera Yana. Oras ciana, Ya ilafo re nik Apa ni kawasa ta mamagalna fare malaekat ta mali sorogai. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Flonga famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane. Mali ta mew mantanena, en ta osta rmat pawbe gabe si dem pawbe Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfadukduk re nabi Musa re nabi Elia puis lolasca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat. 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mrk. 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Japa wol piwai Yesuse nu tina hola, I nololaw Petrus, Yohanes fare Yakobus, rfane rdawil nais lolas isa bo rcombayang pulina. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Oras ta Yesuse ncombayangna, I uhngoca temna naiwani ndadi nesa fare I ni pakena ndadi bubulang sasaletam. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Rgarayanna, en smat silu rmauting re I. Si tina nabi Musa i re nabi Elia ta rtub tantuba malina. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Smat silu tasa daplangan bena. Si rmauting ga Yesus osta nmat, fare tina osta ndadi i mali Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Oras ta smat sitol tasa matingna, Petrus i re ni del silu tasa damtoal. Oras ta si rpaling, si dem Yesuse naplanganna gaole, fare nabi silu ta dosal rdahle I tasa. <figure style="fig" file="CN01728B.TIF" size="col" ref="9:32">Yesuse nfadukduk re nabi Musa re nabi Elia puis lolasca</figure><verse eid="LUK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Oras ta nabi Musa i re nabi Elia bo rfateam Yesus, Petruse nua Yesus, “Guru, amame ksangnangna gaole am mantanena. Ta mafiana, smat am col tane kfaosal falogi nenena fasitol: isa bo Guru, isa nabi Musa, fare isaca bo nabi Elia.” Ga Petruse nmauting be to, i nto pa. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petruse nmauting sube, metna nduri ga nopi si, fare si ndadi damcait. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Si rlonga mauting mali met tina lolo nu laitane, “Tae Ya Ntuk ta Ya ifisang Ica. Flonga I to!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Laina rlonga mauting tina panto, Petruse nemna motle be Yesuse ntutuling. Ga mulain oras tina, murit si tol tasa dafetngo isa pa ahai ta si dem nanaina.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo setan mali wai man isa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat. 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mrk. 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ni semaca, oras ta Yesus I re ni murit sitol tasa rduri to mali lolasca, smatna lal rlafo Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Garayanna en smat isa mana nmautingna nfacicoali nu laitane, “Guru, mgali ya meme ntukca lae! Seni, ya ntukca isa tae be. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />I setane ncung i, i n'gigamna nfacicoali fare setan cia npei denabe nkaci i gabe bukbukna ncapang mali hmona. Setan cia npeina nfakangela i fare nailow pa bo nfateam ina. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ya idor fagali to lali Apa Guru nim muritna bo rfaungo setan cia mali ya ntuk tae, ga si dafena pa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Gabe Yesuse nu, “Susana gaole mew, smat ta oras taena fdela pa Ya nik kawasa fare fdele fsal! Mnuwo laisa hawe Ya nane iteteam farerer re mewna? Fare denabe mnuwo laisa Ya nane ifolfolo re mewna? Futi mali to wai cia!”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Oras ta wai cia nfan lali Yesus i, setanca npesa i nap rakrakca gabe nkaci i. Ga Yesuse nmautingna nfacicoali lali setan cia bo ncapang mali wai cia, fare wai cia nmafia. Fola tina, Yesuse npo wai cia lali hma i. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43a" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43a" />Farumi smat ta si manana rdadi rherang dem Jou Lahatalla ni kawasa ta mamagal tina.<verse eid="LUK 9:43a" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ta failuna, I osta nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mrk. 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43b" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43b" />Oras ta smatna rherang sube ningalena deme ndumi mujizat ta Yesus npei tina, Yesuse nua ni muritna, <verse eid="LUK 9:43b" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Flonga fare ftarokira famafia ta Ya iku tane. Lomanta Smat ta mali sorogaica bo rpo i lali smatna.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ga Yesuse ni muritna rtaif pa ahai ta I nuna. Jou Lahatalla npei paube bo si rtaif tinana, bo si rto paube ni ngalena. Sile ma damcait bo rfautno Yesusna, ahai ta I nu tina ni ngalena.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ni muritna rfautan ise ta nmamagal mali farumi silina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mrk. 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Bahnga na, Yesuse ni muritna rfakotale ga ise ta osta ndadi smat ta nmamagal mali si farumina. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ga Yesuse nto wlorina, gabe I nyal wai nena isa taga nisingi mali lapona. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Gabe, I nua si, “Ise ta nailow smat ta biasa be laisa wai nena tae ningalena smat cia ndela Ya, tina fatailo laisa re i nailow Ya. Fare ise ta nailow Ya, I ma nailow Jou Lahatalla ta ncula Ya. Ningalena ise nbasame ni dirica biasa be mali mewi tane, I cia to ta Jou Lahatalla nu i nmamagal.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rfakotale re it pana, tina ite rir del si</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mrk. 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Fola tina, Yohanese nua Yesus, “Guru, amame keme smat isa nfaungo setan npake Guru ngahnyomna. Ga amame ktolea i, ningalena i cia animam del i pa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ga Yesuse nua si, “Mati ftolea i na! Ningalena smat ta rfakotale re it pana, i cia ite rir del i.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse smat Samariana dailow i pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Yesuse ni oras bo ndawil nais sorogaina nlafo i to, gabe I nu, nane nfan Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />I ncula smat diranca rfane rtuba. Si rfane rtuba lali pnu isa mali batang Samaria, bo rfasiap farumi ahai ta Yesuse nparluna. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ga smat ta mali pnu ciana dailow Yesus pa, ningalena si rto I bo nfan Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Oras ta Yesuse ni murit silu Yakobus re Yohanes rlonga mauting ta smatna du tina, si duwa Yesus, “Jou, ta mafina ame kdor yap mali sorogai bo ktaping fayei smat tane!”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ga Yesuse nfulasi ga, natngalo smat silu tasa taga ntolea si ningalena si rmauting laina. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Fola tina, si rfan lali pnu nesana.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gabe bo tderera Yesus nane fatutua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat. 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Oras ta Yesus I re ni muritna si mali fan-fanca, en smat isa ta nua Yesus laitane, “Guru, ya bo iderera farerer re Guru manca be Guru bo mfanna.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesuse nua i npake andeande laitane, “Fun ailolona en gagaori bo damtuli. Laina bena re manina, en riri fafual. Ga Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica, ni gagaw pa bo nfafolfola Ina.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Fola tina Yesuse nua smat ta nesana hawe, “Mali bo mderera Ya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ga smat cia ncanglo I, “Apa, mpo oras bo ya igaile hmakca su. Hola tina, taga ya ilafo iderera Apa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Ga Yesuse nua i, “Smat ta rdela Ya pana, laisa re smat ta rmate tona. Gabe inanai to smat ta rdela pa tina duruse si riri pilingna tutuling. Ga aw, aw mfane bo mfabinga abar ta Jou Lahatalla kawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdelana riri tubca.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />En smat isa hawe ta nu, “Apa, ya bo iderera Apa, ga mpo ya oras bo ikuwe ifabinga mali hmak re tenokna su. Hola tina taga ya ilafo iderera Apa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesuse nua i, “Smat ta rbapacole ga jaga nningo be namul tao, i ni karajanna molang pa. Laina bena re smat ta dailow rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat ta I nkawasa ndadi Kolano, smat cia bisa panto nlolam okosesi ta nesana hawena.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncula smat yafafit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Fola tina, Jou Yesuse nfisang smat yafafit mali smat ta jaga rderera Ina. I ncula si na sililu bo rfane ntuba lali bendarna fare gagaw ta hola I bo nlafona. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />I nua si, “Smat ta rciap rlonga fare dailow Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i tina lalna gaole, fatailo laisa gandum ta lal mali beti motle be tkati, ga smat ta bo rfakatina lal pa. Gabe tina, mew fdore to lali Jou Lahatalla i ta na bet cia, bo I nbange smat ta bo rfakati mali Ina betcana.<verse eid="LUK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Tane mew ffane to, ga flolam famafia, Ya isula mew ffan lali smat ta rmayaina fapaluan, tina fatailo laisa re domba ntu isa nfan lali fun ailolona fapaluan. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Oras ta mew ffanna, mati ffut tiwi gagaona, mati ffut tasna fare mati ffut nalna. Mati fmauting fauatuna re smat mali lalingcana, ga ffan falaw.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Gabe laisa mew fsung mali smatna riri ebaina, mew nane fu, ‘Tabea ntuba, kdore bo Jouca ni mafiana en mali mewi ta mali ebai taena’. <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Gabe laisa smat ta mali ebai ciana dailowe mew, barakat ta mew fdor tina osta en mali sili. Ga laisa smat ta mali ebai ciana dailowe mew pa, barakat ta mew fdorna ndadi i mali sili pa. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Gabe en smat ta dailowe mew, mew fteteame to mali ebai cia. Mati fdir-dirka gagawo mewna. Fseli fare fdom ahai be ta si rpo mewna, ningalena ise ta nkarajan, i osta nduke mulona mali i ni karajan tina. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Laisa mew fsung mali bendar isa lae, pnu i lae, ga smat ta manana dailowe mew, mewe fan be to ahai ta si rpona. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Fare mew nane, famafia smat ta dowil mali gagaw ciana, fare fabinga smat ta manana, ‘Mnu panto Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela Ina’. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ga laisa mew fsung mali bendar isa, pnu lae, gabe smat ta manana dailowe mew pa, ffan lali laling mamagalna taga fu facicoale mew laitane, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Mew failow pa flonga Jou ni Abar Mafia tane, gabe amame bo kfane to. Pepesa mali nimew pnuca ta en mali ficomam tane, ame ktibe mantane bo flolam, mew fsale to mali Jou Lahatalla i. Tane mew ftanggo nimew salna to. Ga mew nane fto re flolam tane e: tane to Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela Ina, ga mew failow pa.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe lali I ni muritna, “Flolam famafia e, lomane mali wol kiamat cia, smat ta mali pnu ta dailowe mew pa tina bo rduk salna tebteb. Salsal ta si osta rduk tina, tebtebna foloi mali salsal ta bendar Sodome nduke tona.”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ntolea smat ta dailow pa rderera Jouna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat. 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Ee mew smat Khorazim fare Betsaida! Mew fkapalange to! Jouca bo nfasale mewna tebteb, ningalena Ya ipei mujizate to, ga mew fiwane wlomewna pa bo fderera Jouna. Gabe Ya ipei mujizat tina lali smat ta mali pnu Tirus fare Sidon, makse si wlorina mayai, osta diwane wlorina rderera Jou gabe dising gigiyap puis bobokorina fare rpake kabaya karung, tina fafayal si diwane wlorina rderera Jou. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Gabe, loman ta mali wol kiamatca, oras ta Jouca bo nadili farumi smat, smat Tirus fare Sidonna rfasal sina osta mayana mali mewi.<verse eid="LUK 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Fare mew smat ta fteteam mali bendar Kapernaum, mew ftona Jouca bo nlange mew nais soroga i? Enpa! I osta ntopa mew lali narakaca.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfulasi ga nu hawe lali smat ta rderera Ina, “Smat ta rlonga mewna, tina fatailo laisa re i nlonga Ya. Smat ta dailowe mew pana, i cia ma nailow Ya pa. Ise nailow Ya pa, i cia ma nailow Jou Lahatalla pa ta ncula Ya.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat yafafit ta Yesuse ncula si tasa rlolai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Smat yafafit ta Yesuse ncula si tasa, si rlolai lali Yesus i fare wlorina sangnang, gabe duwa I, “Jou, setanna ma rderera ta amame kparenta oras ta ame kfaungo si kpake Jou ngahnyomna.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesuse nua si, “Ime, fatutua. Ya ikeme to setanna riri kolanoca nmarapawil mali langitcana, i nmarapawilna fatoal laisa re lemlemna. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Flolam famafia ta Ya ikuwa mewna. Kawasa ta Ya ipo mew tina mamagal, denabe mewe ma bisa ffilo gu ta nbisa re mamyatif, fare bisa fakala nimew musuna, cia setanna riri kolanoca. Fare kawasa tina, isa bisa nfakapalange mew pa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Makse mfalaina ma, mati wlomewna sangnang fauatuna su ningalena setan tina rderera ta mew fparentana. Ga mew, nane fsangnang ningalena ngahnyo mewna rlefo mali soroga i.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nu tarima kase lali Jou Lahatalla i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat. 11:25-27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Oras tina to, Jou ni Rohca nkawasa Yesus gabe npei I wlona sangnang. Gabe I nu, “Ya iku tarima kase lali Apa i, Jou ta nkawasa mali soroga i fare mali dunia i. Ya iku tarima kase ningalena Apa mfabinga pa tina lali smat ta rpande fare smat ta rto okosesina lal, ga mali smat biasana, Apa mpei denabe si rtaif. Apa, tina to ta npei Apa wlomna sangnang.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Farumi ta en mali Ya nik Apa ina, Apa npo Ya to. Smatna isa pa ta ntona ise molang Ya Lahatalla ntu Ya, langisa Apa be ta ntona. Gabe smatna isa pa ta nto ise cia Apa, langisa Ya be Lahatalla ntuca ta ito, fare smat ta Ya ifisangna bo rfayala Apa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Fola tina, Yesuse nbo ni muritna, I nmauting re sili be, I nu, “Mew fsangnange to, ningalena mew feme to ahai ta Ya ipeina. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ningalena, tantubana lal nabi fare kolanona rlokolo bo dem ahai ta mew fem oras taena, ga si deme rcuna pa. Si ma rlokolo bo rlonga ahai ta mew flonga oras taena, ga si rlonga rcuna pa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande Smat Samaria ta wlona mafia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Bahnga na, en guru agama isa ta nto Musa ni kitab silim tasa bo niyawa Yesuse na sal. Gabe i nosal taga nfautan laitane, “Guru, ya nane ipei ahai bo Ya bisa iduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lalina?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesuse nu, “Ahai ta rlefo ga tina mali fatfato pumul Musa ni kitab silim tasana? Ahai ta aw mbaca manana?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Smat cia ncanglo, “En rlefo laitane, ‘Mew nane fatutua fmasie Jou Lahatalla, mewe nimew Jou i. Mew nane fmasie Ina foloi mali farumi ta mewe fmasiena, fare ni lalingna fpo nimew cicoalna bo fpei ta I nailowna, fare mew bena nane flolam I. Fare mewe ma nane fmasie smate nesana, laisa re mew fmasie nimew dirica tutuling.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesuse nua guru agama Yahudi cia, “Fatutua ta aw mu tina! Gabe laisa aw mpei laina, aw osta mtub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ga guru agama Yahudi cia nailow bo smatna rto i ni dirica namolang, gabe i nfautno Yesus hawe, “Gabe smate nesa ta ya nane imasie i cia ise?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesuse ncanglo npake andeande tae, “En man isa smat Yahudi i ta nduri mali bendar Yerusalem bo nfan lali bendar Yerikho. Mali lalingca fapaluan, i nfadukduk re smat ta wlorina rmayaina. Si rpun i taga rcefto ndumi ta en mali i tina. Ni morco napna, si rfateam i denabe bo nmat mana.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Mnu pa na, imam agama Yahudi isa ndelo laling cia. Oras ta i nem smat ta rpun i cia, i nfan turus ndel mali lalingca lapona. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Laina bena re smat isa agama Yahudi i mali suku Lewi. I ma ndelo laling cia. I tae ta jaga n'gali imamna rleleane Jou Lahatalla mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalcana. I ma neme smat ta nduk punpun cia, ga i ma nfan turus delmali laling cia lapona.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Mnu pa na, en smat isa mali batang Samaria i bo nfanna laspa, ndelo laling cia bena. Oras ta i nem smat ta rpuni cia, nbasamna nmasie i. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />I ndahle smat cia taga nfaberesi ni yabatna npake anggur taga nlalaw npake egat, fare npitane smat cia ni yabatna. Hola tina, i ncaple smat cia nais i ni keledaica, fare nuti lali ebai ta tcewana. Mana i nurus i famafia. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ni semaca, smat Samaria cia npo tiwi perak silu lali smat ta ni ebaica. I nu ‘Apa, mgali ya muruse smat tae famafia. Tane ni mulona, gabe laisa tiwi tane nlafo pa, lomanta ya ilolai, taga ibang.’ ” <figure style="fig" file="CN01749B.TIF" size="col" copy="Davd C. Cook" ref="10:35">Andeande Smat Samaria ta wlona mafia</figure><verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfautno guru agama Yahudi cia, “Gabe laisa bo mew, mali smat sitol tasa, ise ta nfaeme ni masiena lali smat ta rpuni cia?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Guru agama Yahudi cia ncanglo, “Smat ta nfafcule ni masiena lali smat ciaca.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Gabe Yesuse nua i, “Fatutua tina! Gabe tane, mfane to bo mpei laisa tina.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus i mali Marta re Maria riri ebai i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Oras ta Yesuse I re ni muritna rfaturusa riri fanfanca bo rfan lali bendar Yerusalem, si rtuli mali pnu isa. Mana, en maping isa ngahnyo Marta. I nololaw Yesuse bo nfan lali i ni ebaica. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Marta en teno maping isa, ngahnyo Maria. Oras ta Yesuse i mali si riri ebai ina, Maria ntotolang ndahle re Jouca fare nlonga turus I ni mautingna. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ga Marta, i lali re mali nfasiap an. Marta ndahle Yesus fare nu, “Jou, Jou mpusinge tenokca pa, nfabiar ya ikarajanna itutuling? Msula i n'gali ya.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ga Jou Yesuse ncanglo Marta laitane, “Marta! Marta! Aw wlomna ncusa fare mfapusing be nim dirica lali re mali mututa be tane re tina! <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ga ta ni ngale foloina pusa be, ga Maria nfisang ta mafiana to ta i npei oras taena. Gabe smatna bisa jal pa tina mali i ina.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nafcule ni murit-muritna rcombayang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat. 6:9-13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Bahnga na, Yesuse ncombayang mali gagaw isa. Ncombayange hola, murit isa nua Yesus laitane, “Guru, Yohanese nfafcule i ni muritna rcombayang. Gabe, ame kdor Guru mfafcule ame bo ksombayang.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Laisa mew fsombayang, fsombayangna laitane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Apa, farumi kfamamagal re ksuba Apa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ningalena Apa ngahnyomna mafiana gaole.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Ame kdor Apa mlafo bo mkawasa mdadi Kolano mali nimam tub tae.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Moce am an na wol re wol bo nlafo am.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Fare mampunge nimam dosana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">ningalena amame ma kampunge smat ta rcal mali amamina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">fare mati mfabiar am bo kpei okosesi ta mayai nana.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesuse nfaturusa ni sogarona ga sombayangna laitane, “Andeande, laisa smat isa mali mewi, oras ta wop fapaluan nfan lali i ni del isa ni ebaica taga nu, ‘Wataw, mfabawo ya nam rotina fapitol su, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />ningalena nik del isa bo nfanna laspa taga nlafo mali nik ebai i, ga ya nak paisa pa bo ikoce ina.’<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Mfalaisa smat cia bo ncanglona, ‘Mati mfasusa yana, ya ikait bawaca to, ningalena ya re ntukna kamtuli to. Gabe ya osta ipaling pa bo igali awna.’<verse eid="LUK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ya, flonga bo ikuwa mewe: i ni del ta mali ebai cia japa nailow pa npalinge bo n'gali ni del ta nlafo cia. Ga laisa i ni del cia nmaipa ga ndor turus, morco napna, i ni del ta pumul ebai cia osta npaling gabe n'gali i ahai ta i nparluna.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Laisa re tina, Ya ikuwa mew, fdore to lali Jou Lahatalla i ahai ta mew fparluna, lomanta I osta npo ahai ta mew fdor tina. Fiyawa to mali Jou Lahatalla i ahai ta mew fparluna, lomanta mew osta fduk tina mali I. Ftoke to Jou Lahatalla ni bawaca, I osta ncupati bawaca bo n'gali mew. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ningalena smat isa ta ndor lali Jou Lahatalla i, i osta nduk. Smat isa ta niyawa ni parluna lali Jou Lahatalla i, i osta nduk. Fare smat isa ta ntok-ntok Jou Lahatalla ni bawaca, Jou Lahatalla osta ncupat bawaca bo n'gali i. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Mew ta fdadi apa tona, osta bisa pa gabe laisa ntumewca rdor iyan ga mew foce i guna? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Pare foce i mamyatif gabe laisa i ntuca ndor tatale tolo? Osta bisa pa o? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Gabe makse mew wlomewna mayai, mew fto bena mfalaisa fpo okosesi ta mafia lali ntumew nana. Laina bena nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica! I osta npo Rohca lali smat ta rdoro Ina.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna du Yesuse npake Beelzebul ni kawasa nfaungo setanna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat. 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mrk. 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Bahnga na, en smat isa nmomow ningalena setane ncungi, gabe Yesuse nfaungo setanca, mali smatca. Oras ta Yesus nfaungo setanca ga ncapang, smat ta nmomow cia mulaine nmauting. Gabe smat lalo ta rfayalo si manana rherangna gaole. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Gabe smat ta manana rfauwo si du laitane, “Ta molangna I npake Beelzebul, setanna riri kolanoca nikawasa, denabe I bisa nfaungo setan tina.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Fare en bena ta nesa bo diyawa Yesuse na sal, gabe si rdore bo Yesuse npei mujizat, bo si rto fatutua Yesus cia I mali Jou Lahatalla i mali.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ga Yesuse nto si wlorina, gabe I nu andeande isa laitane, “Gabe mali kerajaan isa ni smatna rfakotale gabe rfasak-sake si, kerajaan cia osta namewis. Fare laisa man re maping ese rfakotale be morco napna rfasak-sake si. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Laina bena gabe laisa setanna riri Kolanoca nfaungo ni wawaina setanna, si tina osta rfasak-sake si, fare setanna riri Kolanoca ni kerajaanna osta ntahan pa. Ya iku laina, ningalena mew fu, Ya ifaungo setanna ipake kawasa mali Beelzebul. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Gabe fatutua laina, smat farisi ta rderera mewna si tina rfaungo setanna rpake ise ni kawasa? Gabe mew fu si ma rpake setan ni kolanoca ni kawasa, si osta du ta mew fu lali sili re Ya i tina ncal! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Gabe Ya ifaungo setanna npake Jou Lahatalla ni kawasa, tina ni ngalena Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi kolano mali hapaluwno mewna.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Andeande laitane, gabe laisa smat isa ncicoal fare npake snapan paisa nkurang pa njaga i ni ebaica, farumi ni okosesina osta pepaisa pa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ga laisa smat isa ncicoalna foloi mali i ina nlafo ga npun i nafena i, smat ta ncicoal foloi cia osta nyale ndumi smat cia ni snapan ta nmaulango bo npei i npepaisa pa. Fola tina, smat ta ncicoalna foloi cia osta ncefto ndumi ni okosesina taga nlowto ni del-delona. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Smat ta rderera Ya pana, i cia ni le Ya. Fare smat ta n'gali Ya pa nfayalo smate bo rdela Ya, i cia ta npei smatna dalaspa mali Ya ina.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Setanca bisa nlolai ntetemo hawe smat ta i jaga ntetemo i to ca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat. 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe laisa setanca ncapang mali smat isa, i nfan nyelyel mali gagaw ta mninna, niyawa gagawe bo nfafolfola i ga i nduk pa, gabe nututa laitane, ‘Ta mafiana ya nlolai lali smat ta ya itetemo i to ntubaca.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Oras ta i nlolai lali smat cia, i nem smatca wlona lolo paisa pa, laisa ebai isa ni paisa pa rlesani ga nberesi fare rfato nmafia. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Gabe setan cia nfane nololaw ni del sifit ta wlorina mayaina foloi mali i ina. Fola tina, si rcunge smat cia taga rteteam mana. Ni morco napna, smat cia ni tubca ncangsarana foloi mali tantuba malina.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Smat ta rcangnang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Oras ta Yesuse nmauting sube re smat laloca, en maping isa nmautingna nfacicoali lali Yesus i, “Ta ncangnangna gaole cia Apa hnye to. I ta ndadikna fare nfamamagal Apa toca.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ga Yesuse nua i, “Ta rcangnangna, smat ta rlokolo rlonga Lahatalla ni mauting fare rderera tina!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna rdor fafayal, Yesus i mali Jou Lahatalla i mali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat. 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Oras ta smatna nbang i ga lal rjel Yesus, fare I nu, “Smat ta rtub oras tae, si rmayai. Si rdor Ya ifaemo si mujizat faisa bo ndadi fafayali, Ya mali Jou Lahatalla i mali. Ga Ya osta ifaemo si pa mujizatna, Ya ifaleneto si okosesi ta ndadi i ntuba mali Nabi Yunus ina. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ningalena tantuba, oras ta nabi Yunus i pumul iyan mamagalca hnyaona, ga Jou Lahatalla ncapnga i, tina ndadi fafayali mali mewi smat Niniwena, Jou Lahatalla ta ncula i. Laina bena re Smat ta nlafo mali sorogai, en ta bo ndadi i mali I ina, bo ndadi fafayal mali smat ta oras taena.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Loman ta mali oras Jouca bo nadili farumi smat, kolano maping ta potao malica osta npaling hawe nfarere re mew smat ta oras taena, fare i osta nfasal mew bo mew fduk sal-sal. Ningalena, tantuba oras ta i nlonga kolano Salomo ni fafculena, makse i nalaspa i nfane bo nlonga. Ga oras tae mantane, en smat ta nfoloi mali kolano Salomo i ta nfafcule mewca, ga mew flonga pa tina! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Lomanta oras Jouca bo nadili farumi smat, smat Niniwe tantubana osta rtub hawe farerer re mew smat oras taena, fare si osta rfasale mew. Ningalena smat niniwena diwane wlorina to oras ta Yunuse nfabinga Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali silina, ga oras tae mantane, en Smat ta nfoloi mali nabi Yunus i, ga mew flonga pa bo fiwane wlomew nana.!”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jouca ni mautingna laisa padamara ni plangnona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Yesuse nu andeande isa hawe laitane, “Smat isa pa ta ntaping padamaraca taga nising i mali ebaica ni sasunna penepa ntabaki re paisa nesa bo plangnona mati ncapangna. Ga ta molangna i osta nisini mali gagaoca bo farumi smat ta rcung mali ebai ciana si dem padamaraca plangnona. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Mew mtamewna laisa padamaraca bo nfaplangno nimew dirica. Gabe laisa mtamewna femna mafia, nimew tubca ma ndadi naplangan. Gabe laisa mtamewna femna mayai, nimew tubca ma ndadi ndororam. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Gabe tina, mew nane fjaga famafia, mati denabe plangan ta en mali nimew tub cia ndadi ndororam. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Gabe farumi nimew tub tae naplangan fare enpa ta dororam makse okocebe, ta molangna nimew tubca osta naplanganna gaole laisa padamaraca plangnona ta nfaplangno mew.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ntolea ta rfaboboko agama Yahudinana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrk. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Oras ta Yesuse nmautinge hola, smat Yahudi isa mali fatfato Farisi nlafo nololaw Yesus bo nceli mali i ni ebai i. Gabe Yesuse nfane nceli mana. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Nbo nape bo nceli, Yesuse nuase kakamo napa, derera laisa agama Yahudina riri fatfato napa. Gabe smat mali fatfato Farisina rherang ningalena si riri fatfato cia dicena cicoal agama Yahudi ni fatfatona.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Gabe Jou Yesuse nua i laitane, “Mew smat Farisi tane. Potalil, temna frajin mew fpei agamaca ni fatfatona, naga mali wlomewna, mew flokolo fsefto smate nesana rari okosesi fare mew wlomewna mayai. Tina fatailo laisa smat ta duas galas fare dodai potalilna beresi, ga pumul lolona pererekna gaole. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Fto pana gaole mew tane! Jou Lahatalla to ta npei nimew badanca, I ma ta npei wlomewna, gabe tdarawa I pa, I nto mewe ndumi. <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Gabe tina, fpo to ahai ta en mali mewina bo fgali smat ta rcusana fare wlomewna mafia. Bo re fpei laina, mew fatutua osta wlomewna ndadi beresi.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Fkapalange to mew smat mali fatfato Farisina! Mew, frajinna gaole fpei sadakana denabe namew ane ni rampa-rampa ta nenena bere fpeo sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla i. Naga mew famolang pa re smatna fare fmasie Jou Lahatalla pa. Mafia laisa mew fpei sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla i, fare mewe ma nane fpei ta molang lali smatna fare fmasie Jou Lahatalla bena. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Fkangela to mew smat mali fatfato Farisina! Laisa mali ebai sombayangca, mew flokolo ftotolang mali gagaw ta potao, fare mali gagaw smat lalo flokolo smatna rfamamagale mew. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Fkangela to mew ya! Ningalena, nimew tabeatna potalil temna mafia ga pumulna mew wlomewna mayai. Mew tina fatailo laisa piling ta ni fafayal pa, gabe smat ta rfanfan manana, si rto pa ahai ta en pumul lolona.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Ga en isa mali guru agama Yahudi ta nto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, nua Yesus laitane, “Apa Guru, Apa nim mauting ta nanai tina, laisa Apa mfamayai am hawe tina.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Gabe Yesuse nfulasi ga nua i, “Ee, mew guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, mewe ma fkangela! Ningalena mew fpei agamaca ni fatfatona lal fare tebtebna gaole, taga fsula smatna rderera tina. Naga mew fpei pa tina fare fgali smatna pa makse okoce be bo fderera fatfato tina. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Fkangela to mew ya! Ningalena, mew fpei famafia nabi tantubana riri piling, naga hma re bbu mew tantubana rderera si pa, taga rpun famat si hawe. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Gabe mewe famafia piling tina, tina ningalena, mewe fatuwo hma re bbu mew tantubana ta rpun rfamat nabi tina. Ningalena, si ta rpun famat nabi tina, gabe mewe fyal lowat mana ni lalingna famafia riri pilingna. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Farumi tina ndadi i, ningalena Jou Lahatalla ta nto ndumi, I nu ntuba to laitane, ‘Ya bo isula nik nabina re susulana bo rfalafo Ya nik fatnaw lali smat Israelna, gabe smat Israel tina ta bo rpun famat diranca mali sili, fare en bena ta nesana bo rfakangela si.’<verse eid="LUK 11:49" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Gabe re laina, Jou Lahatalla bo nfasale mew smat ta ftub oras taena, poko be farumi nabi ta fpun famat si tona mali oras ta Jou Lahatalla npei dunia taena, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />mulain mali Habel i denabe nabi Zakharia, ta rpun famat si mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, mali gelgelto ta jaga rtaping aiwani ta rpeo sadaka, fare gagaw ta nmafia ta Jou biasa nlafo i mana. Flonga famafia ta Ya iku tane: smat ta oras taena ta bo rduk sal-sal mali farumi ta ndadi ito tina.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Fkangela to mew guru agama Yahudi ta fto Musa ni kitab silim tasa! Mew fto laling ta bo tderera Jouna ga mew fderera tina pa. Mewe ma ta jaga ffabatal smate nesa ta bo rderera Jouna. Tina ifatailo laisa mewe fice kuci bawa, ga mew fising be kuci tina.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Nu hola tina, Yesuse nfane nowe gagaw cia. Gabe mulain oras cia, guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa fare smat mali fatfato Farisina diyawa hal re Yesus. Si dakale rfautno I bo I nmautingna lal. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Si rpei laina bo rwafo I mali ni mauting ta ncal tina.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mati tdarawa smatna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat. 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Oras cia, smatna re calan ta rlafo rfayalo si mali Yesus ina. Rfakoskoso si denabe rfafilfilo. Fare oras cia to, Yesus mulaine nfafcule. Nfafcule ntubana I ni muritna, I nu, “Mew fpei famafia re smat ta rderera fatfato Farisina, matina denabe mew fderera si riri tabeatna. Si rfaemo smatna si tina ta jaga rderera Jou Lahatalla, ga ta molangna si rdarawa. Si riri tubca jaga dakal be smat, tina fatailo laisa ragi okoce tfulta re tirigu gabe tiriguca nca.” <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ga ahai ta oras tae fgoganna, osta smatna bo rto, fare farumi ta fgoganna osta ncapang. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Gabe, ahai ta ffauwo mali gagaw ta isa nto pana, tina osta rto mali smat lalo uhngo. Fare ahai ta mew fauwo pumul kamarina, tina osta isa nfabinga puis ebaica gabe smat laloca nlonga.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farumi smatna Jou Lahatalla nmasie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat. 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Ya nik dele mew, flonga famafia ta Ya iku tane, mati mew famcaite smat nana. Smatna dafenana rpun famat be nimew badanca, ga si bisa pa bo rtibane mew fan lali sorogacana. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Tane, Ya bo ifafcule mew ise ta nane mew famcaitica. Mew nane famcait be Jou Lahatalla, ta ni kawasa npun famat nimew badanca fare en kawasa bo nfasale mew mali narakaca. Gabe, Ya ikuwa mew, mew nane famcait be I!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Co mew fikir, mani budubadang silim ta smatna rwage, mulorina okocebe. Ga makse laina, isa pa ta Jou Lahatalla bo nlupana. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Laina bena mew, mati famcaitna, ningalena mew foloi mali mani budubadang tina, denabe uta ta mali boboko mewna Jouca nto nilalona.”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe, “Flonga tane famafia, ise ta nfatuwo ndela Ya mali smat laloca uhngo, Lomanta smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica ma osta nfatuwo I nfayala i mali Jou Lahatalla ni malaekat ta mali sorogaina uhngori. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ga ise nmanyakal Ya mali smat laloca uhngori, Ya ma osta imanyangkal i mali Jou Lahatalla ni malaekatna uhngori.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Gabe laisa smatna du okosesi ta rlawang Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica, i osta nduk ampung sube. Ga ise nu ta mayai lali Jou ni Rohca, i osta nduk ampung pa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Gabe laisa smatna dute bo duruse mew, makse tina mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina, pare mali smat mamagal ta rkawasa batang taena, mew mati famcaitna ahai ta bo funa fare mfalaisa bo fbela nimew diricana. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Ningalena mali oras cia to, Jou ni Rohca osta nfabinga ahai ta mew bo funa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta ni re na ga nlupa Jou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Gabe smat isa mali smat ta lal tina nua Yesus laitane, “Apa Guru, muwa tenokca bo nloate namam warisna.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Gabe Yesuse nua i, “Ee wataw, ise ta nafcul Ya bo idadi hakim bo ilowate smate mew lu namew warisnana.”<verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Gabe Yesuse nmauting lali smat lalo ta en manana, “Fpei famafia fare fjaga nimew dirica famafia, matina denabe nlafo mew pa re ahai ta namewna. Ningalena smatna rtubna mali aratana be pa makse smatca ni re na.” <figure style="fig" file="CN01774B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="12:15">Smat ta nkayang ga nlupa Jou</figure><verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Gabe, Yesuse nafetngo si andeande isa, “En smat isa ni re na, na betna anona lal denabe ebai ta nafrao i okosesica nkos. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Gabe i nu mali wlona laitane, ‘Ya nik gagaw panto bo ikisinge nak an bet tanena, fare an bet ta gleo nesana bo ikising manca? Ahai ta ya nane ipeina?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Gabe nututa hawe, ‘Tane ta ya bo ipeina: ya bo iluka okosesi gagaona, taga ipei ifamamagal i hawe. Mana ya bisa ikising farumi nak an betna fare okosesi ta nesana. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Hola tina, ya iku: Ya bo ifasangnang ya su. Ya ikising an fare okosesi ta nesana lal ta ya bisa ipake re taun-taun. Gabe ya motle iseli, idom fare ifasangnang ya.’<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ga Jou Lahatalla nua i, ‘Ee, aw tane mto pa. Doram tae to aw osta mmat. Gabe arata ta mising tina bo ndadi smate nesana rari.’<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Ta lainana ta bo ndadi i mali smat ta rfayalo be arata bo i ni dirica. I ntafuso pa re Jou Lahatalla ni mautingna, i cia fatailo laisa smat ta riri ngale pa mali Jou Lahatalla uhngona.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati wlomewna ncusa re nimew tubcana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat. 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Gabe Yesuse nua ni muritna laitane, “Gabe tina, Ya ikuwa mew: mati wlomewna ncusa re nimew tubcana, ahai ta mew bo ffanna, fare ahai ta bo fpake mali nimew diricana. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ningalena nimew tubca nfoloi mali ahai ta mew bo ffanna, fare nimew dirica nfoloi mali kabaya ta bo fpakena. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Co mew ftarokira mani gokgokna. Mani tina rcake gei pa, fare rfakati pa, fare riri gagaw pa bo dising anna, ga Jou Lahatalla nfatub si. Taga bo mew! Mew foloi mali mani tina! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Gabe laisa wlomewna ncusa re nimew tubca wol de wol, mew osta falanga okoce nimew umurna? Bisa pa o? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Gabe fafena pa falanga nimew umurna makse okoce be, ta mafiana mew mati wlomewna ncusana re ahai ta bo fan fare fdomna. <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Co ftarokira mfalaisa bunga tina ntubna. Bunga tina rkarajan pa, fare rpei lawe pa bo ndadi kabayana. Ga flonga famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane, kolano Salomo ta ni re na cia bere, makse ni kabayana mafiana gaole, ga foloi pa mali bunga tina ni mafiana. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Mom ta mali betina bere, Jou Lahatalla neyan fare npei famafia, naga mom tina en wol tae be, fare mdoma bo rtaping. Ga bo mew smatna, osta Jou Lahatalla neyane mew fare nfamafia nimew tubca. Ga mfalaisa mew fdela I uatu pana? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Gabe, inanai to mati wlomewna ncusana re ahai ta mew bo fan fare ahai ta mew bo fdomna. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ningalena ga smat ta rdela Jou Lahatalla pana be ta wlorina ncusa farumi tinana, ga mew, mati wlomewna ncusana, ningalena nimew Apaca ta nto mew fparlu farumi tina. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ta mafiana, mew fiyawa Jou Lahatalla to bo I nkawasa ndadi kolano mali nimew tubca. Fare laina, Jou Lahatalla osta npo ndumi ahai ta mew fparluna.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule mfalaisa bo tising aratana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat. 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Mew ta fderera Yana falal pa, fatailo laisa domba gagaw isa. Ga makse laina mew mati famcaitna! Ningalena nimew Apaca ncangnangna gaole mew bo farerer re I fkawasa laisa Kolanona. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Fwage to nimew aratana bo ni tiwina foce smat ta rcusana! Gabe mew fpei laina, tina laisa mew fayalo arata mali sorogaca fare osta myei pa. Ningalena mali sorogaca enpa ta bo rloisna fare enpa gigoap ta bo rfamayai arata tinana. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ya iku laina ningalena manca nimew aratana en, mana bena mew wlomewna.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat karajanca nane nciap nleleane ni tuanca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe, “Mew nane jaga fsiap bo fpei ta Jou Lahatalla nuna, fatailo laisa re smatna mali wol-wolo rpake kabaya karajan bo rciap oras ta bo rfane rkarajanna, laina bena smatna mali oras doram rtaping padamara bo rciap rkarajan doram. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mewe ma nane fsiap laisa smat karajan ta rtotoman riri tuanca bo nuwe mali rame fasawca. Gabe laisa si riri tuan cia nuwena dorame to fare ntoktok bawaca, si rciap rcalawe bawaca. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Smat karajan tina rcangnangna gaole, ningalena oras ta si riri tuanca nuwe, ncuna si rtotoman i. Ya bo ikuwa mewe: si tina rcangnangna gaole, ningalena tuanca osta npake kabaya karajan. Taga i ncula ni smat karajan tina rtotolang bo rceli, lomanta i ta nleleane si. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Gabe laisa tuan cia nlafona oras wop fapaluan ma pota mdoma, ga i ncuna si rciap rtataman laisa tina sube, si tina osta rcangnangna gaole.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ga mewe ma nane wlomew yaneto famafia andeande isa tae: Gabe laisa smat ta ni ebaica nto oras laisa ta bo nloisca nlafona, ga i osta nfabiari pa bo ncunge ni ebai cana. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Laina bena re mew, mew nane fsiap turus, ningalena Smate ta mali sorogai malica bo nlafo hawe mali oras ta mew osta fto pa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande smat ta rkarajanna mafia fare smat ta nkarajanna mayai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat. 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Fola tina, Petruse nfautno Yesus, “Jou, andeande ta nanai cia bo ise? Bo amam be pare farumi smat?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Gabe Jou Yesuse ncanglo si npake andeande laitane, “Gabe laisa en smat karajan ta nto okosesina lal fare nmanahan mali ni tuanca, ni tuanca osta nlange i ndadi nfaboboko bo nfatub farumi ni smat karajan ta nesana gabe laisa ni orasna nlafo ito.” <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Smat karajan ta nfaboboko cia osta ncangnangna gaole, gabe laisa ni tuanca nlafo, ncuna i npei ni karajan tina famafia. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Flolam famafia ta Ya iku tane, fatutua to ni tuanca osta nlange i fare ndela i bo njaga farumi tuanca ni ginana.<verse eid="LUK 12:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ga laisa smat karajan ta nfaboboko cia wlona mayai, i osta nu mali wlona laitane, “Ya nik tuanca mnu sube taga nuwe. Gabe i nmulaine npun smat karajanna man fare maping, taga i nceli re ndom denabe nmoni. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Ga lomanta mali wol ta i nto pana, fare oras ta i ntopana, engarayanna i ni tuanca nuwe. Fare ni tuanca osta nfasal i re salsal ta tebteb. I nduk salsalna nmat. Gabe i laisa smat ta rdela Jou Lahatalla pana.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Smat karajan ta nto i ni tuanca nailowna ga nciap pa re npei pa ahai ta ni tuanca nuna, i cia bo nduk punpunna tebteb mali ni tuanca. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ga smat karajan ta nto pa ni tuanca nailowna, ga npeina ncal denabe nduk punpun, i cia nduk punpunna okocebe. Ningalena ise ta Jou Lahatalla npoi cicoalna lal, Jou Lahatalla ma osta nfautno i na foloi mali ta nesana. Fare ise ta Jou Lahatalla ndela i na lal, Jou Lahatalla bo ndorna foloi mamagalna mali sili.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rdela Yesus pana rfakotale re smat ta rdela Yesusna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat. 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Ya ilafo mali dunia tae, tina ta npei denabe smat ta rdela Ya fare smat ta rdela Ya pana rfakotale. Ta rfakotale tina fatailo laisa Ya itigea yap nap dunia tae, fare imaulango yap cia nloblobe to. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ga osta en hawe kangela ta Ya bo iduk. Ya wlokna tengtengan pa gabe laisa kangela cia iduki paube. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mew fu japa ya ilafo mali dunia tae smatna bo rfamafio ndumi si? Enpa! Ga Ya ilafo, smat ta rdela Ya pana bo rfakotale re smat ta rdela Yana. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Mali oras tae rmulaine to, gabe laisa en smat silim ebai isa, sitol ta rderera Ya rfakotale re silu ta rderera Ya pa, pene pa silu ta rderera Ya rfakotale re sitol ta rderera Ya pa. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Si rfakotale isa re ta nesana. Apa i re ntu manna rfakotale. Mama i re ntu mapingna rfakotale. Malafaca nfakotale re ohmo ta mapingica.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ite nane ttarokira famafia ta Yesuse npeina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat. 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Gabe Yesuse nua smat laloca, “Gabe laisa mew fem metna kapcut fare gogo polei, mew osta fu, ‘Wol pusa tae bo ulan,’ fare fatutua ulanca nduri. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Gabe mew fbasam latan simica nuf, mew fu, ‘Tae fafayali, wol tae bo mfanas,’ fare fatutua mfanasna gaole. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mew tane fmadarawa! Mew bisa fto batang tae fem be fafayal mali langitca fare mali dunia tae. Ta Jou Lahatalla npei mali uhngo mewna, mew ftaif, ga ta ipeina mew fderera pa?”<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ite nane tfamafio it re smat ta rlokolo it pana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat. 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Gabe laisa mew fatotole re smat, mewe to ta nane famafio mew. <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Gabe laisa en ta du mew fsal, ga bo dute mew lali hakimna, ta mafiana famafio mewe to re i oras ta mali lalingca subena. Ningalena, gabe laina pa, i osta nute mew lali hakimna. Fare hakimna osta rpo mew lali smat ta rjaga buicana, taga si bo ncunga mew bui. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Flolam famafia, mew osta fsapang mali bui cia pa gabe laisa nimew linganna fpalas faye i paube.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga smatna bo diwane wlorina rderera Jou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Oras ciana, en smat sifis ta rfabinga Yesus du smat Galilea ta Gubernur Pilatuse npun nfamat sina. Si rpun famat si na oras ta si rpo aiwani ndadi sadaka mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalcana. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesuse nua smat ta rfabinga tina, “Mew fto smat tina rduk punpun ta nfalaina puli tinana, ningalena si riri salna foloi mali smat Galilea nesana? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Enpa! Ga Ya ikuwa mew e: Laisa fiwane wlomewna fderera Jou pa, mew farumi ma osta fmat laisa re si. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Fare en bena smat yafasa re siwai ta rmat re menara ta ndahle Siloam mali bendar Yerusalemca ntabi sina. Mew fto si tina rmatna ningalena si rpei dosana foloi mali smat nesa ta en mali bendar Yerusalemna? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Enpa! Ga Ya ikuwa mew hawe, laisa fiwane wlomewna fderera Jou pa, mew farumi ma osta fmat laisa re si.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande laisa ai ara ta piyo pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Fola tina, Yesuse nu andeande isa laitane, “En smat isa ta na ai ara mali i na bet anggurca. Bahnga na, i nfan lali niyawa ai cia piyona. Ga piyo pusa ma i nduk pa. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Gabe i nua smat ta njaga bet cia laitane, ‘Mem, taun faicole to ya ilolai ma ilolai ikiyawa ai ara tae piyona, ga bahnga pa ya idukna. Tcelapi to ai tae! Pesa bo i ntub puis rakrak tae gabe laisa i piyo pa!’<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ga smat ta njaga bet cia nu laitane, ‘Matina su apa. Tfabiar i su taun bahnga hawe.’ Lomane ya ipacol iyela i taga ikafrao i pupuk. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ise nto taun tatbo tae i piyo. Gabe laisa piyo pa, tcelapi to.”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia maping isa ta npugut mali wol Sabatca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Bahnga na Yesuse nfafcule smat mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. Oras ta Yesuse nfafcule tina, neta wol Sabat, wol ta smat agama Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mana, en maping isa ta nowil taun yafasa re piwai e to, ningalena setanca nkawasa i denabe i npugut, fare nosalna ma molang pa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Oras ta Yesuse nem maping cia, I nololaw i taga nu laitane, “Ngolo, mmafia to mali aw nim owilna.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Nu laina hola, Yesuse nising kakamona lali maping cia, tina to i ma nosalna molang. Gabe maping cia ncuba re nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Nem tina, ta nfaboboko ebai sombayang agama Yahudi cia ntole, ningalena Yesuse nfamafia smat mali wol Sabatca. Gabe tina, i nua smat lalo ta manana, “En wol piwonam ite tpake bo tkarajan. Gabe laisa mew failow, flafo mali wol tina, mati mali wol Sabatcana.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Gabe Jou Yesuse nua smat cia, “Ee, mew smat ta fmadarawa! Makse cia wol Sabat i hawe, mew jaga fsapnga nimew sapi re keledai mali gagaorina, taga ffan faroma si waya. Tina ma karajan bena! <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Maping tae Abrahame ntu re hbu i laisa re mew. I taun yafasa re piwaie to Setane ni Kolanoca nkawasa ina. Gabe, paisa pa laisa Ya ikowe i mali Setane ni Kolanoca ni kawasana, makse tane wol Sabat.”<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Rlonga Yesuse nmauting laina, farumi smat ta jaga rfakotale re Ina rdadi rmai. Ga smat laloca, si rcangnangna gaole ningalena farumi ta Yesuse npei tina mafia.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande laisa gei pusa ta nnenena fare ragi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat. 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mrk. 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano mulain mali smatna lal pa, gabe wol de wol nbang i ga lal. Ya bo ifatailo tina re ahai? Tina ifatailo laisa re andeande tae: <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />En gei pusa ta smatna rtiwa i mali beti. Makse gei cia nnenena, ga laisa ntube to, i ndadi oslo aisa. Taga manina rlafo rpei fafual mali ni magalna.” <verse eid="LUK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Fola tina, Yesuse nu hawe, “Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali ni smatna, mulain mali smatna lal pa, gabe wol de wol nbang i ga lal. Tina Ya bo ifatailo re ahai hawe e? Laisa re andeande tae: <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />En maping isa nyal ragi taga nfulta re tirigu liter yafafat. Ragi tina npei denabe tirigu ta rfulta tina nca ndadi lal.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse laisa re bawana bo it tcung Sorogana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat. 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfaturusa I ni fanfanca lali Yerusalem. I nfan nyele pnu-pnuna, I ma nfafcule smatna mali gagaw tina. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Gabe en smat isa ta nfautno Yesus: “Guru, lal pa smat ta bo rduk salamatna?”<verse eid="LUK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Yesuse nua smat ta manana, “Mew fmario to fsung fdelo bawa ta nkosca! Ningalena, smatna lal rmario bo rcung rdelo bawa ciana, ga si bisa rcung pa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Ningalena oras ta si rlafona, smat ta niebaica nkait bawaca to. Gabe oras cia mew osta fososal potalil taga ftoktok bawaca. Mew osta fu, ‘Apa, msalawe bawa tae lae!’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">I osta ncanglo mew, ‘Ya ifayala mew pa fare Ya ito pa mew manca mali.’<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Gabe mew osta fuwa I, ‘Amam ta jaga kseli re kdom farerer re Apana. Apa bena ta mfafcule am mali nimam pnuna ni laling nana. Osta Apa mfayala am.’<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ga oras cia to I bo nua mew, ‘Flonga famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane, Ya ifayala mew pa fare Ya ito pa mew manca mali! Fdirake mewe to mantane, mew ta jaga fpei okosesi ta mayaina!’<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Osta mew fem Abraham, Ishak fare Yakub rfarerer re farumi nabi ta rfalafo Jou ni fatnaw puli Jou Lahatalla ni gagaw ta Nkawasa ndadi Kolanoca, taga mew ta fsung mana pana, rfaungo mew fsapang, oras cia, mew osta ftangis re fkangelana gaole. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Osta smat mali gagawna lal mali dunia tae, mali polaw denabe polei, pap denabe pota, si tina, bo rtotolang rceli pumul Jou Lahatalla ni gagaw ta Nkawasa ndadi Kolanoca. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Ftarokira famafia, manana lal smat mamagal ta riri ngale mali dunia taena, osta rdadi smat ta riri ngale pa, fare smat ta riri ngale pa mali dunia taena, osta rdadi smat ta riri ngale.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nmagogoru i, ningalena smat mali Yerusalemna dailow pa rlonga I</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat. 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Oras ta Yesuse nmauting sube, smat Yahudi sifis mali fatfato Farisina, rlafo I. Si du, “Apa, mfane to lali gagaw ta nesana, ningalena kolano Herodese bo npun famat Aw.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesuse nua si, “Mew ffan lali kolano Herodes ta nmapei akal cia, taga fu laitane, ‘wol pusa tae re mdoma Ya ifaungo setan re ifamafia smat ta dowil. Gabe wol pitolca, Ya nik karajanna bo myei to.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ga makse laina ma, wol tae, mdoma re oplu, Ya nane ifan lali Yerusalem. Ningalena Jou Lahatalla ni nabi ta rfalafo I ni fatnawna nane rmat mali pnu Yerusalem, bisa pa mali pnu nesana.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Ali, sene mew, smat Yerusalemna! Mew ta fpun famat nabi ta ntuba ta rfalafo Jou ni fatnaw, re mewe ma ftig si re pat denabe rmat smat ta Jou Lahatalla ncula si lali mewina. Lao faifise to Ya ikailow ifayalo mew bo fdahle re Ya, laisa tatale ngolo ta ntabake ntu re fayona, ga mew failow pa. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Gabe tina, Jou Lahatalla osta nfalaspa i mali nimew bendarca, gabe bendar cia mamagal cia ndadi namliley. Flonga famafia e, mew osta fem Ya panto. Ga lomane oras ta Ya ilafo hawe, mew osta fem Ya hawe re fu laitane, ‘Tfamamagal I ta Jou Lahatalla ncula nlafo mali.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat mali wol Sabatca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Bahngana neta wol Sabat, wol ta smat Agama Yahudina bisa rkarajanpa, Yesuse nfan nceli mali smat ta nfaboboko smat Farisina isa ni ebai. Puli tina, si farumi rtarokira be Yesus bo diyawa Ina sal. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Garayanna, en smat isa ta nowil, nlafo mali Yesus i, i ni owil tina npei denabe fico re kakamona nbosbos. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Gabe Yesuse nfautno guru agama Yahudi ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa re smat Farisi tina, “Gabe laisa tderera ite rir agamaca ni fatfatona, bisa tfamafia smat mali wol Sabatca, pare enpa?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ga farumi si tina rcanglo pa. Gabe Yesuse nkawce smat cia, fare nfamafia i. Hola tina, Yesuse ncula smat cia nuwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Gabe laisa ntumewca lae ma nimew sapica lae marapawil mali sumu i neta wol Sabat, osta mew fgali fsapnga i bena paga?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Rlonga Yesuse nu laina, smatna isa pa ta bo ncanglo Yesuse ni mauting tina.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati flokolo fiyawa uhngo mewna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Oras ta Yesuse nceli mali smat Farisi cia ni ebaica, I ntarokira smat ta rlafona rlokolo rtotolang mali gagaw ta potaona. Gabe tina, Yesuse nfafcule si npake andeande laitane, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Gabe laisa dololawe mew mali rame fasaw, mati mew flokolo ftotolang mali gagaw ta potaonana. Ningalena faramane smat ta ni rame cia nololaw smate nesa ta nmamagalna foloi mali mewi. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Mati denabe ta ni rame cia osta nlafo re nu laitane, ‘Tabea e, gagaw tae smatna riri i to.’ Gabe re fbasamna fmai nane fdirake mew ftotolang pumulo. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Mafiana, gabe dololawe mew puli smatna riri rame, mew nane ftotolang pumulo. Ise nto smat ta ni rame cia nlafo re nua mew laitane, ‘Mali, ftotolang potao.’ Re laina, si daraga mew mali farumi smatna uhngori ta rceli farerer re mew manana. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ningalena, ise ta nu i ni ngale, Jou Lahatalla osta npei i ndadi ni ngale pa. Ga ise ta npei i ni dirica laisa re smat ta ni ngale pa, Jou Lahatalla bo npei i ndadi smat ta ni ngale.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Fola tina, Yesuse nu hawe lali smat ta nololaw Ica, “Bahnga hawe gabe laisa apa mpei rame seli, wolwolo lae dorame lae, apa mati mololaw nim del-delonana tenom re ramamnana ma apa nim smat ta fadahdahle ebai ta rkayangnana. Ningalena osta si bo rbalco rfaseli apa bena. Re laina, ahai ta apa noce sina, si bo rbalco apa bena. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ga laisa apa mpei rame seli, ta mafiana mololaw smat ta rcusa, smat ta rpanyaket, smat ta rfanfan pana, fare smat ta rbiafna. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Gabe laisa apa mpei laina, Jou Lahatalla ta osta npo ni mafiana mamagal mali apa i. Ningalena makse si rari paisa pa ta bo doce apana. Lomane Jou Lahatalla ta osta nbalco apa ni mafiana mali wol kiamatca, oras ta Jou Lahatalla nfapaling hawe smat ta damolang mali I uhngona.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande rame mamagal puli Sorogai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat. 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Oras ta Yesuse nu laina, smat isa mana ta ntotolang nceli farerer manaca, nua I laitane, “Ncangnangna gaole smat ta bo rceli farerer mali gagaw ta Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolanoca.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Gabe Yesuse nua i npake andeande isa laitane, “En smat isa npei rame mamagal, fare nololaw smatna lal. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Oras ta okosesina farumi toto to, i nua ni smat karajanca nfane nfabinga smat ta i nololawna, laitane, ‘Mali to, ningalena okosesina farumi toto to!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ga farumi smat ta nololawna rlafo pa re barang be du. Ta ntuba cia nu laitane, ‘Ya taga igon bet, gabe tabea mati mtolena e, ya nane ifan lali ikem bet tina su.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Ta nesa benana du laitane, ‘Ya, ya taga igone hola sapi karajan pasang pilim. Gabe tabea mati mtolena e, ya nane itohnga si rkarajan su nik sapi-sapi tina.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Taga ta nesa benana du laitane, ‘Ya taga ifasawe hola, gabe bisa ilafo pa.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Gabe, smat karajan cia nlolai nfabinga ndumi tina lali ni tuanca. Gabe ni tuanca ntole, fare ncula ni smat karajanca laitane, ‘Gabe laina fatowale to aw mfan lali pnuca ni laling mamagalna denabe laling nenena. Aw mololaw re mut mali smat ta rcusa, smat ta rtempang, smat ta rbiaf, re smat ta rfanfan pana.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Nlonga parenta tina hola, smat karajan cia nfan npei laisa re ta ni tuanca nfasulana. Oras ta i nuwe, i nua ni tuanca, ‘Apa, farumi ta apa mparentana, ya ipeie to. Ga en sube gagaw ta rtotongo pawbena.’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Gabe tuanca nua smat karajan cia, ‘Gabe laina, aw mfan hawe lali laling mamagal, re laling nenena mali pnu tae potalilna. Aw mgega smat ta en manana rlafo mali bo ya nik ebai tae nbakbak.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Gabe flonga famafia ta Ya iku tane, farumi smat ta Ya ikololaw ga dailow pa tina, isa pa smatna ta osta nceli mali Ya nik rame taena.”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga mfalaisa bo tderera Ina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat. 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Fola tina, smatna lal rfan rderera Yesus. Yesuse ntoi namul sili fare nu laitane, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Smat ta nderera Yaca, i nane nmasie Yana foloi mali i nmasie ni ngolota, hye, hma, ntuna, tenona, ramana, fare i ni dirica. Gabe laisa i nmasie Ya laisa laina pa, i bisa pa nderera Yana. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Gabe ise ta npapa i ni salipca pa, tina ni ngalena i nciap nkangela pa denabe nmat re nderera Yana, i cia pantas pa bo nderera Yana. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Ifatailo laitane: gabe laisa isa mali mewi tane ta bo npei ebai, nane i netetang su, laisa ebai cia ni ongkosna. Re laina i ndadi nto, ni tiwina nlafo pare enpa bo nfatoto ebai ta i npeicana. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Gabe laisa i netange ntuba pa, ga i npei fandasi to, osta i nafena nfatotoi pa ebai cia, gabe smatna dem tina, si osta damamlifa i. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Si osta du, ‘Cei smat cia mulaine npei ebai cia ga i nafena nfatotoi pa.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Fare, en fatailo nesa bena laitane: en kolano ise ta i ni tentara lalan yafasa, gabe bo nfaparang re kolano nesa ta ni tentarana lalan yafalu. Kolano ta ni tentara lalan yafasa cia, nfane nfaparang pawbena nane ntotolang bo nututa famafia su, nafena pare nafena pa. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Gabe laisa i nto ni tentarana dafena pa, i nane ncula ni tentara diranca bo rdor rfamafio si oras smat ta i nbo sina dalaspa sube. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Laina bena re mew. Gabe laisa bo fderera Ya, mew nane fututa famafia su, laisa mew fafena fateam farumi ta nimewna, mew bisa fderera Ya. Laisa mew fafena fateam tina pa, mew bisa pa fderera Yana.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rderera Yana nane rpei ta mafia, laisa gasina en ni ngale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mrk. 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Yesuse nu andeande isa hawe laitane, “Gasi tina mafia, ningalena nfamna an. Ga laisa gasi tina ndadi mtu, bisa panto bo npayasing hawena. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Gabe laisa laina to, ni ngale pusa panto. Makse bo tpake mali beti bo tfaboka rakrak re bo tpei pupuk, bisa panto. Ta mafiana ttopa to. Flonga tina fare ftaif, taga fising mali wlomew!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Andeande domba ta namnyangis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat. 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Bahnga na laisa re tantuba malina, en smat ta jaga rfautno pajak fare smate nesana lal ta smatna du farumi si rbaradosa, si rlafo Yesus bo rlonga I ni fafculena. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mana en bena smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina, fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa. Oras ta si dem Yesus mana, si du laitane, “Cekedei Smat tae nfadeldelo re smat ta rbaradosana, taga nceli farerer re si hawe.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Nlonga si du laina, Yesuse nfafcule si npake andeande laitane, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Gabe laisa mali mewi tane en ta ni domba slubisa, gabe isa namnyangis, i nane nfateam su domba ta yafasiwe re esiwe tina puli gagaw ta nmamagal re nimom, taga i nfane niyawa domba isa ta namnyangis cia denabe nduki. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Laina i nduk i, i ncangnangna gaole. Gabe nyali nising i mali maglona, taga i nuwea i. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Nlafo puli ebai i, i nololaw ni delna re smat ta mali ni ebaica lapona farumi, taga nua si, ‘Ya nik domba ta namnyangisca iduki to hawe. Gabe mali ya re mew tfasangnang it!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ya ikuwa mew e, andeande cia ni ngale laitane, Jou Lahatalla re malaekat ta mali sorogaina osta rcangnangna gaole, laisa en smat isa ta nbaradosa niwane wlona nderera Jou. Si rcangnangna gaole hawe, laisa smat isa nbaradosa ta niwane wlona nderera Jou, laisa pa re smat yafasiwe reesiwe ta rbasamna damolang, gabe si diwane wlorina pa.” <figure style="fig" file="LB00001C.TIF" size="col" copy="Louise Bass" ref="15:7">Andeande domba ta namnyangis</figure><verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande tiwi perak ta namnyangis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yesuse nu andeande isa hawe laitane, “En maping isa ta ni tiwi perak yafasa. Bahnga na, i ni tiwi perakna isa namnyangis. Gabe ahai ta i npeina? Maping cia nane ntaping padamaraca, taga i nlesan ni ebaica fare niyawa famafia ni tiwi ta namnyangis cia denabe nduk i. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Gabe laisa i nduki to ni tiwi cia, i nololaw ni del-delona, fare smat ta mali ni ebaica lapona farumi, taga nua si laitane, ‘Ya nik tiwi perak ta namnyangisca iduki to hawe, gabe mali ya re mew tfasangnang it!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ya ikuwa mew, mali sorogaina ma laina, Jou Lahatalla ni malaekatna rcangnangna gaole, gabe laisa en smat isa ta nbaradosa ga i niwane wlona nderera Jou.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande wai isa ta namnyangis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesuse nu hawe, “En apa isa ntu man silu. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Ta wawaica nua ni apa, ‘Apa, mlowate rir aratana to bo ya iyal nak lowlowatna!’ Gabe ni apa nlowat si rari aratana lali ntu silu tasa. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ni wol pifis laitane, wai ta wawai cia nwage na lowlowatna ndumi, taga nfan lali batang ta laspa. Puli tina, i nalibiru ni tiwina, fare ntubna npei ta molang pa. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Oras i ni tiwina myei ndumi to, batang ta i ntetemona farumi smatna rmata an, denabe i ma mulaine nkangela. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Gabe i nfan niyawa karajan mali smat isa ta nteteam mali batang tina. Smat cia npo i karajanna njaga bow mali beti. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Mana wai cia nbibisilna gaole, fare smat isa pa ta noce i anna. Gabe makse bowna rari an i nlokolona gaole bo nan.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Gabe ni morco napna i nduke wlo re ni tub tina, gabe i nu laitane, ‘Ya nik apa ni smat karajan puli ebai ina si rari anna welo, ga ya mantane bo imata an. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ta mafiana ya ifateam gagaw tae taga ikuwe to lali nik apa i. Ya osta ikuwa apa, “Apa, ya ibaradosa to mali Jou Lahatalla i, re mali apa i bena. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ya pantas panto apa mu ntum yana. Ta mafiana idadi apa ni smat karajan ya beto.” ’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Gabe i nfateam gagaw cia fare nuwe lali ni apa i.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Oras ta i nalaspa sube mali ebaicana, i ni apa nemi to. Gabe ni apa nbasam nmasie ina gaole, fare nfarera lali nggopi re nfatan i.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Gabe wai cia nua ni apa, ‘Apa, ya ibaradosana gaole mali Jou Lahatalla i, re mali apa i bena. Ya pantas panto apa mu ntum yana.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ga ni apa nololaw smat karajanna taga nua si, ‘Fatowale to ffut mali kabaya ta nmafia molangca, taga ffapake i. Fare ffapake i bena yaliyali mali i lobona re sandal mali ficona. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Hola tina, fkati sapi isa ta lapona mafia taga fpei i. Fare mali tceli tfarerer, hola tina tpei rame, re towa. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ningalena ya ntuk tae laisa i nmate to ga tane npaling hawe. I namnyangis, ga ya iduki hawe.’ Gabe si mulaine rpei rame.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Oras ta si rpei ramena, ntu ta uwatica i mali beti. Oras ta wai ta uwatica nuwe gabe ndahle riri ebaica, i nlonga sulingca fare smat ta dowana liori. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />I nololaw smat karajan isa taga nfautno i, ‘Rame ahai mali ebai ina?’<verse eid="LUK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Smat karajan cia ncanglo, ‘Tuan tenomca nuwe to! Gabe nim apa nfasula rkati sapi ta lapona mafiaca, ningalena tuan tenom ta namnyangisca tduk i hawe to re ncalamat.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Nlonga laina, ntu ta uwati cia ntole. Fare i nalow pa ncung namul ebai ina. Gabe ni apa ncapang nmaumauting re i bo i ncung.<verse eid="LUK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ga i nua ni apa, ‘Apa, re taun ifacicoal ya ikarajanna bo apa. Ya bahnga pa ikaliw apa ni parentana. Ga makse laina, apa bahnga pa mpo ya kabil ta lapona mafia makse faisa bo ya ipei rame re nik del-delonana. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ga apa ntum cia ta nfayei apa ni tiwi re maping mayaina. Ga tane oras i nuwe, apa nkati sapi ta lapona mafiaca bo ina ba!’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Gabe ni apa nua i, ‘Wai ta awe, aw jaga mteteam farerer re apa. Gabe farumi ta apa nina, tina ma aw nim bena. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Aw tenomca laisa re smat ta rmate tona ga tane npaling hawe, i namnyangis, ga tane ite tduk i to hawe. Gabe tane, mafiana ite tpei rame re tfasangnange wlorna.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Andeande smat ta wlona molang pa ga nice tiwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Fola tina, Yesuse nu andeande isa hawe lali ni murit-muritna laitane, “En smat kayang isa ta ni smat karajan. Smat karajan tae ta nurus farumi smat kayang cia nina. Bahnga na, en ta rfabinga du smat karajan cia nfayei ndumi ta ndadi ni tuan cia nina. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Gabe tina, smat kayang cia nololaw smat karajan cia taga nu laitane, ‘Ya ilonga aw mfayei ndumi ya nik tiwinana. Mut mali farumi smatna riri lingan ta aw mlefona re ta murusna, ningalena ya bo ifafola aw.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Gabe smat karajan cia nu mali wlona laitane, ‘Ao, ya nik tuanca bo nfafola ya. Tane ya bo ipei karajan ahai? Bo ibapacol, ya ikafena pa, bo idor-dor mali smatna, ya imai. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Aa, ya ito ahai ta nane ya ipeina, gabe laisa nik tuanca nfafola ya, en ta bo dololaw ya iteteam mali riri ebai ina.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Gabe, smat karajan cia nololaw isa-isa lali smat ta rpei lingan mali ni tuancana. Mali smat tantuba cia i nu laitane, ‘Aw nim lingan mali ya nik tuancana laisa?’<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Gabe smat cia ncanglo, ‘Ya nik lingan egat zaitun liter lalanfat.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">Gabe smat karajan cia nu, ‘Tae nim karatas linganca, aw mtotolang mana fare mlefo fatowal liter lalanlu be.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Fola tina, i nu lali smat ta failu ica, ‘Laisa aw nim lingan mali nik tuancana?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Smat cia ncanglo, ‘Gandum karung lalanca.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Gabe smat karajan cia nua i, ‘Tae aw nim karatasca. Tane to mlefo karung slubiwai be.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Oras ta smat kayang cia nlonga ni smat karajan ta namolang pa cia npei laina, nfamamagal i. Ningalena, i ni smat karajan cia nto nyal smatna wlorina bo si bisa rgali i. Meman smat ta jaga rderera dunia taena rto rfatoitoya, laisa pa re smat ta rtub pumul planganca ta rderera Jou Lahatalla nuna. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Gabe tane ta Ya bo ikuwa mewna: Fpake nimew arata mali dunia taena bo fgali smatna bo fduke nimew delna lal. Gabe laisa nimew aratana abise to, mew osta fduk gagaw ta dailowe mew ftetemo mali sorogaina.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Smat ta rdela i bo npei okosesi ta nenena mafia, i osta rdela i bena bo npei okosesi ta mamagal. Fare, smat ta rdela i pa bo npei okosesi ta nenena, i ma rdela i pa bena bo npei okosesi ta mamagal. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Gabe laisa bisa rdela rfakawco mew pa arata mali dunia tae, enpa ta bo rdela rfakawco mew arata ta mali sorogaina. <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Gabe laisa mew bisa fjaga pa smate nesana riri okosesi ta smatna rdela rfakawco mew, enpa ta osta bo rpo mew okosesi bo ndadi nimewna.<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Smat karajan isa bisa pa nkarajan bahnga be mali tuan siluna. Ningalena laisa i ni tuanna silu, osta nlokolo i pa tuan ta isaca taga i nmasie tuan ta nesana. Penepa i osta nmanahan be mali i ni tuan ta isaca, mali ta nesana i nmanahan pa. Laina bena re mew, laisa mew ftubna fayalo be arata mali dunia tae, osta bisa pa mew fkarajan bo Jou Lahatalla re tutuona.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ntolea smat Farisina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat. 11:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mrk. 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Oras ciana, smat Yahudi sifis mali ta rderera fatfato Farisina rlonga ndumi ta Yesuse nu tina. Gabe si damamlifa I, ningalena si rlokolo tiwi. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mali smatna uhngori, mew fafcule nimew dirica namolang, naga enpa. Jou Lahatalla nto wlomewna. Flolam e, ahai ta smatna rlokolona gaole, tina ta Jou Lahatalla nlokolo pa.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Smatna jaga dafcule fatfato ta en mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa re ta en mali nabi-nabina riri kitabna, denabe oras Yohanes ta nfasisopca nlafo. Hola tina, smatna mulain rfabinga Abar Mafia ta Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolanona rlonga to manca-manca. Gabe smatna lal ta rmariona gaole bo rdadi I ni smat. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Makse laina ma, farumi ta rlefo mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa re mali nabi-nabi nesana riri kitabna fatutua bo ndadi i. Langit re batang tane bisa mjakam, langisa farumi ta rlefo mali Jou ni Kitab cana nane ndadi i.”<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Smat ta ntalake ni ngolota taga nfasaw hawe re mapinge nesa, mali Jou Lahatalla uhngona i ncale to, ningalena i nlokolo re mapinge nesa ta ni ngolo i paca. Taga, smat ta nfasaw re maping ta ni uwatca ntalak i cia, mali Jou Lahatalla uhngona i ma ncale to, ningalena i nlokolo re smat ta ni ngolo i paca.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande smat kayangca fare Lazarus ta ncusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yesuse nafetang andeande isa hawe laitane, “En smat kayang isa. I jaga npake kabaya colo, tina kabaya mafia ta mulona mamagal. Wol de wol ntubna ncangnang re i ni aratana. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Taga mana en bena smat isa ncusa, i ngahnyo Lazarus. I ni badanca bakbaka re yabat. I jaga namamtuli mali smat kayangca ni bawa mamagal ebaica nbona. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />I nbibisil gabe nlokolo bo nan an ta marapawil mali smat kayang cia ni mejacana. Ga i nduk paisa pa, ga hunna be ta rlafo gabe rlep i ni yabat tina.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Bahnga na smat susa cia nmat, gabe malaekatna duti lali gagaw ta nmafia, mali Abrahame lapona. Smat kayang cia ma nmat gabe smatna rgaile i. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Mali gagaw smat ta rmatna, smat kayang cia nkangelana gaole. Oras ta i ninga nais, mali laspa i nem Lazarus i mali Abrahame lapona. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Gabe smat kayang cia nmauting nfacicoali laitane, ‘Apa Abraham, mmasie ya lae! Msula Lazarus ncowla i loboca mali wayana taga nfasisongit ya papleok tae lae. Ningalena ya ikangelana gaole mali yap taena!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Gabe Abrahame nu laitane, ‘wai ta awe, mlolam ta ntubana oras ta aw mtub sube mali dunia ina, aw mduke to farumi ta mafiana. Ga seni Lazarus, ntub malina, i nduk be farumi ta mayaina. Gabe tane i nduk ta sangnangna mantane, taga aw mduk kangelana. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ahai hawe gelgelto ta aw re amamca, Jouca npei maratopas ta namlaman re namsaina gaole, bo smat ta en mantanena bisa pa si lalina, fare smat ta pulinana, bisa pa si malina!’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Gabe smat kayang cia nu hawe, ‘Gabe laina, idore mgali ya. Apa msula Lazarus nfan lali nik apa ni ebaica. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Ningalena pulina en smat silim ya tenokna. Msula Lazarus lali nua si bo diwane wlorina rderera Jou e to, bo si ma mati rcung mali gagaw ta nkangela taena.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ga Abrahame nu laitane, ‘Mali silina ene to nabi Musa ni kitabna re nabi-nabi nesana riri kitab-kitabna. Gabe mfabiar si rpei ahai ta rlefo puli kitab tinana to.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Gabe smat kayang cia nu laitane, ‘Tina ncukup paube, apa Abraham. Nane en smat isa mali smat ta rmatna ta npaling taga nfane nfabinga si bo diwane wlorina rderera Jou.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abrahame nua i, ‘Gabe laisa si rpei pa ahai ta nabi Musa re nabi-nabi nesana duna, fatutua si ma osta rdela pa, makse smat ta rmatna rpaling ga rfabinga si hawe si osta rlonga pa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule bo tampunge smat ta rpei salna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat. 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mrk. 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesuse nua ni murit-muritna laitane, “Osta en be okosesi ta npei smatna ndadi rcal denabe ndadi rdela pa hawe. Ga smat ta npei smate nesana rdadi lainana, smat cia ta osta nkangelana mamagal. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ta mafiana tpitan smat cia waoca re tcakto i pat mamagal pusa, taga ttopa i lalaw olatca, bo i nmat laina, mati i npei isa mali smat ta ndelana cicoal pawbe tane rdadi rbaradosana. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Gabe tina, mew nane fpei famafia!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Laisa nimew del isa ta ndela Ya, ga npei sal mali mew i, mew nane fuwa i famafia, fare laisa i nana salna, mew nane fampung i. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Fare laisa i npei sal lali mewina wol pusa lao faifit, gabe i nlololai nuna salna, mew nane fampung i.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule si bo rdela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Gabe, Jou Yesuse ni susulana dua I laitane, “Guru, mbang cicoal mali wlomam tane, bo amam kdela be Aw!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Gabe Jou Yesuse nua si, “Laisa nimew ta fdela tina en, makse laisa re sesawi peo ta nenena leo, mew bisa fuwa ai ara tae, ‘Mdirak awe to lalaw olatca taga mtolma aw polaw tina!’ Osta ai cia ndirak i nderera aw nim parentana.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rderera Yesusna laisa re smat karajan ta nane nleleyane ni tuanca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Ifatailo, laisa en smat karajan isa ta nkarajan mali beti, ma njaga ni tuanca ni domba, ga oras ta i nuwe lali ebai i, ni tuanca osta nua i, ‘Mali to, mtotolang mseli re ya mantane.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Osta laina pa! I ni tuanca osta nua i laitane, ‘Mpei nak anna to. Hola tina aw mafian nim pakena, taga aw mleleyane ya denabe ya iseli re idome hola, taga aw mseli re mdom.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Tuan cia enpa bo nu tarima kase lali i ni smat karajan ciana, ningalena tina i ni karajane to ta nane i npei. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Laina bena re mew. Laisa mew fpei ndumi to karajan ta Jou Lahatalla npo mewna, mew nane fu laitane, ‘Amam tane smat karajan am ta nimam ngale pa. Amame kpei ahai ta amam nane kpeina.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat yafasa ta rpado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Oras ta Yesuse nfan lali bendar Yerusalemna, I ndelo sipat rakrak batang Samaria fare Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Gabe oras ta Yesuse ncung mali pnu isana, en smat yafasa mana rpado rlafo rfaduduk re I. Si dosalna laspa okoce mali Yesus i. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Fare si du re liorina mamagal, “Yesus, Guru, mmasie amam!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Nem si laitane, Yesuse nu, “Ffan lali imamna faeme nimew badanna lali sili.” Gabe si rfan, fare mali lalingca hapaluanna, si rdadi rmafia.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Gabe smat isa mali sili tina, nem ina nmafia to, i nlolai gabe nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla re liona nfacicoali. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Fare naftiba pupuo tasa nap Yesuse ficona re nu tarima kase lali Yesus i. Smat cia smat Samaria i.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Gabe Yesuse nu, “En smat yafasa ta Ya ifamafia si nanaina. Taga isiwe tasa si manca? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Pesa si rlolai bo rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla pana, gabe smat isa tae be ta nlolai mali nfamamagal Jou Lahatallaca? Taga, smat tae ma smate nesa i, agama Yahudi i pa!” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Gabe Yesuse nua smat cia, “Mosal, fare mfane to. Aw mmafia to, ningalena aw mdela Ya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nlafo paubena smat ta rdelana nane si rciape to</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat. 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Bahnga na, en smat Yahudi sifis ta rderera fatfato Farisina, si rfautno Yesus, “Oras ahai Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi kolano mali dunia taena?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Oras ta Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi kolano mali ni smatnana, ni fafayale ntuba pa denabe smatna rdadi rtona. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Gabe tina, smatna mati duna, ‘Co fem, I mantane,’ pare ‘I puli tina!’ Ningalena tane Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano to mali hapaluwno mewna.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua ni murit-muritna, “Osta en ni orasna mew flokolo bo fem Smat ta mali sorogaica, makse wol pusa be, ga mew osta fduke femi pa. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Fare smatna osta duwa mew, ‘Co fem, I puli tina,’ pare ‘I mantane!’ Ga mdel pa mew ffan lali tina, mdel pa fderera si. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ningalena oras Smat ta mali sorogaica bo nlafo hawena, farumi smat ta mali dunia taena bisa dem. Tina laisa re lemlemca namce i mali langitca cicapo ta pusa denabe lali cicapo ta nesana. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ga Smat ta mali sorogaica nane nduk kangelana lal su, fare smat ta rtub mali oras taena dailow I pa, taga I nlafo hawe.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Gabe lomanta, oras I bo nlafo hawe, smatna riri tubna osta laisa re oras nabi Nuh ta ntuba. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Oras cia, si rdela pa ipis mamagalca bo nlafona, gabe si riri tubca laisa biasa, si rceli fare rdom, re si rfafasawo. Si riri tubca laina be denabe oras nabi Nuh ncung namul kapal mamagalca. Gabe ipis mamagal cia nlafo fare nfamat si ndumi.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Laina bena ta ndadi i re smat ta rtub mali oras Lotna: si rciap pa, rtubna laisa biasa: si rceli fare rdom, si rfagon fare rfawage, si rfatiwa re rpei ebai. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ga oras ta Lote ncapang mali pnu Sodomna, yap re luluwana nduri mali langitca laisa re ulanna gabe ntaping nfamat si ndumi.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Makse laina ma, smatna osta rciap pa oras Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafona. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Gabe mali wol ciana, smat ta en puis ebai popona, mati rduri bo jal okosesi ta pumul ebai lolonana. Laina bena re smat ta en mali betina, mati rlolai hawe lali ebai ina. Fatoal ffarera to! <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Flolam ahai tantuba ndadi i mali Lote ni ngolota ina. I nmat ningalena i nlolam sube ni arata mali dunia ina oras ta rfarera mali Sodomna!<verse eid="LUK 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Ise ta ntub bo i ni dirica be, i cia osta nmat nfarerer re Jou Lahatalla pa. Ga ise ta npo i ni tubca ningalena nderera Jou Yesus, i cia osta ntub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ya ikuwa mew: Oras Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo hawena, osta en doram cia smat silu damtuli puis bale isa, ta isaca Jou Lahatalla bo nut i, fare ta isaca bo nfateam i. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Gabe oras cia bena, laisa en maping silu rtok gandum, ta isaca Jou Lahatalla bo nut i, fare ta isaca bo nfateam i. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Gabe laisa oras cia en smat silu rkarajan mali beti, ta isaica Jou Lahatalla bo nuti, ta isaca bo nfateam i.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Rlonga tina, Yesuse ni murit-muritna rfautan, “Guru, manca tina bo ndadi ina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesuse ncanglo si, “Andeande laisa aiwani isa nmat mali gagaw isa, farumi smatna osta rto ningalena, osta manina rfayalo si dan aiwani ta nmat cia mana.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Andeande Hakim isa re maping balo isa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Fola tina, Yesuse nu andeande isa lali ni murit-muritna bo si rcombayang turus lali Jou Lahatalla i re mati damgaina bo rdor I n'gali si. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Yesuse nu laitane, “Mali pnu isa, en hakim isa, ta namcait Jou Lahatalla pa, fare i naraga smat pa. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Mali pnu ciana, en bena balo isa ta jaga nlafo lali hakim cia gabe nu, ‘Apa hakim, mgali ya lae! Mpei ikamolang mali smat ta rlokolo ya pana uhngori.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ga hakim cia nailow pa ta balo cia nuna, mnu laitane hakim cia nu pumul wlona laitane, ‘Makse ya ikamcait Jou Lahatalla pa fare ikaraga ise pa,’ <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ga ningalena balo tae nfabiba ya be, mafiana ya ifapepeya to i ni hal tina re ifaolang i, bo mati nlafo mali fare npei ya ikangelana to.”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Gabe Jou Yesuse nu, “Ftarokira famafia ahai ta hakim ta namolang pa cia npeina! Tina ndadi sogaro mali mewi. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Laisa smat ta namolang paca bo n'gali balo cia, foloi-foloi hawe Jou Lahatalla osta n'gali I ni smat ta I nfisang sina, ta dorame re wol rdor lali I ina. Osta bisa pa I ncuwa orasna bo n'gali sina. <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ya ikuwa mew, fatutua re fatowal be I bo npei nfaolang sina. Ga lomane oras Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo hawe, osta nduk sube pare enpanto smat ta rdela mali dunia taena?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande smat ta ntingkai re smat ta nbasam ni dirica ni ngale pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesuse nafetang andeande isa lali smat ta du si riri dirica damolang re ta daraga pa smate nesana. Yesuse nu, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“En smat silu rfan lali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca bo rcombayang. Smat ta isa i cia smat ta rderera fatfato Farisina, fare ta isa cia smat ta nfafayalo pajak. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Smat ta nderera fatfato Farisina cia nosal ntutuling gabe i ncombayang laitane, ‘Jou Lahatalla, ya iku tarima kase, ningalena ya smat ta isal pa laisa re smate nesana pa. Ya tane laisa smat ta rlokolo rlalim smat nesa rari okosesina pa, ya laisa smat ta damolang pana pa, ya laisa smat ta jaga rlokolo smate ni ngolona pa, re ya laisa re smat ta nfayalo pajak tae pa. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ya minggu bahnga i puasa wol pilu, re ya jaga ipo persen yafasa mali farumi ta ya i duk mali nik karajannana.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ga smat ta nfayalo pajak cia, i nosalna laspa. I namcait nbo nais langitcana, gabe i nsafsaf be ulaca ningalena nmanyasal, gabe nu, ‘Jou Lahatalla, mmasie ya lae, ya tane smat ta ibaradosa.’<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Gabe tane Ya bo ikuwa mew: smat ta nfayalo pajak cia nuwe lali ni ebai i, ga Jou Lahatalla npe i ndadi smat ta ncal pa mali Jou Lahatalla uhngona, ga smat ta nderera fatfato Farisina cia, enpa. Ningalena, ise be ta nu i namolang, Jou Lahatalla bo npei i ndadi smat ta ni ngale paisa pa. Ga ise ta npei ni tubca ni ngale paisa pa mali Jou Lahatalla uhngo, Jou Lahatalla bo npei i ndadi smat ta ni ngale.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nbarakati wai nenenana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mrk. 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bahnga na, en smatna rlafo dute nturi ta nenena lali Yesus i. Si dut wai tina lali Yesus i bo I ncombayang fare nbarakati si. Dem tina Yesuse ni murit-muritna rtolea smat tina. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ga Yesuse nololaw wawai tina taga nua I ni murit-muritna, “Fabiar si to wawai nena tina rlafo mali Ya i, ningalena smat ta rtingkai pa re ta fatoal be rdela laisa wawai nenena tane, si tina ta rpo riri tubca lali Jou Lahatalla i, bo I nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali si riri tubca. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Flolam famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane: ise ta nyal Jou Lahatalla pa laisa re wai ta rtingkai pa tane, i osta ndadi Jou Lahatalla ni smati pa ta I nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali i ni tubca.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat kayangna ncusa i bo rdadi Jou Lahatalla ni smatna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mrk. 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />En smat isa nfaboboko Agama Yahudina, i nfautno Yesus, “Guru ta mafiana, ya nane ipei ahai bo ya iduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali-lalina?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesuse nua i, “Smat isa pa ta nmafiana, langisa Jou Lahatalla be. Pesa ga aw mu Ya imafiana? <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Aw fatutua mto to, Jou Lahatalla ni parentana: Mati mlokolo smate ni uat re smate ni ngolona, mati mpun smatna, mati mlois smatna rari okosesina, mati mu okosesi ta molang panana, fare aw nane maraga hma re hnyemna.”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Ga smat cia nu: “Farumi parenta tina ya ipei ndumi to mulain mali ta po ya subena.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse nu, “Ga motle pusa sube ta aw mpei pawbena. Mwage farumi aw nim aratana, taga mlowto tiwi tina lali smat ta rcusana. Laisa aw mpei laina, aw osta mduk arata mali sorogai. Hola tina, mali to bo mderera Ya.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Smatca nlonga Yesuse nu laina, i wlona ncusa, ningalena i nkayangna gawle.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesuse natngalo i gabe nto i wlona ncusana. Fare Yesuse nu laitane, “Ncusaina gawle smat kayangca npo ni tubca bo Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali ni tubcana. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Gampang sube unta isa ncung ndelo paplakica mtana, ga bo smat kayangca npo ni dirica bo Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali i ni tubcana.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Fare smat ta rlonga Yesuse nu lainana, si rfautno Yesus, “Gabe laina, ise ta nduk salamatca?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesuse ncanglo, “Ahai ta smatna bisa rpei pana, Jou Lahatalla bisa npei. Gabe Jou Lahatalla be ta bisa nfasalamat smatca.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Gabe Petruse nu, “Amam tane kfateame ndumi to ta animamna gabe kderera Aw to Guru.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesuse ncanglo, “Flolam famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane, smat isa ta npo ni tubca bo Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali i ni tubca, denabe i nfateam i ni ebai, ni ngolota, teno re ramana, hma re hyena re ntuna, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />smat cia osta nduk mali dunia tae foloi hawe mali ahai ta i nfateam tina. Fare i osta nduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali-lali.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ta faicolna I osta nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mrk. 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesuse nfayalo ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, fare nua si, “Flonga e! Tane ite bo tfan lali bendar Yerusalem. Puli tina, farumi nabi-nabi ta rlefoe ntuba to bo Smat ta mali sorogai cia bo ndadi i. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica osta rpo i lali smat Romana. Smat tina rfamaimai I, re bo ditfo I. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Si bo rpun I re wala ta tubona mdalim, taga si rpun famat I. Ga mali wol pitol, I osta npaling hawe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Makse Yesuse nu laina, I ni murit-muritna rwafo pa ni ngalena, ningalena ni ngale ta Yesuse nu ta nanai tina n'gogan sube, gabe si rto pa ahai ta I nuna.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat ta nbiafca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mrk. 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Oras ta Yesuse bo nlaho mali pnu Yerikho, en smat isa ta nbiaf ntotolang ndor-dor mali lalingca lapo. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Smat ta nbiaf cia nlonga smat ta lalna rdel mana, gabe i nfautan: “En ahai tina?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Gabe si rfabinga i, “Yesus, smat Nasaret cia en del mantane.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Gabe smat ta nbiaf cia n'gigam, “Yesus Kolano Daut ntu re hbu, mmasie ya lae!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Smat ta rtuba potao mali Yesuse uhngona, si rtolea smat ta nbiaf cia bo nfatengtengan i. Ga smat ta nbiaf cia n'gigam facicoal i hawe “Apa, kolano Daud ntu re hbu, mmasie ya lae!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Gabe Yesuse nfola, fare ncula dut smat ta nbiaf cia mali. Laina smat ta nbiaf cia dut i mali, Yesuse nfautno i, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Aw malouna Ya ipei ahai mali aw ina?” <figure style="fig" file="Cn01739B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="18:41">Yesuse nfamafia smat ta nbiafca</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Smat ta nbiaf cia ncanglo, “Apa, ya idor bo bisa ikem!”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Gabe Yesuse nua i, “Mmafia to aw ya! Aw bisa meme to ningalena aw mdela Ya.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Fare tina to, smat ta nbiaf cia bisa nem, gabe i nderera Yesus re nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla. Smat lalo ta dem tina, farumi si rfa-famamagal Jou Lahatalla.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Zakheus niwane wlona nderera Jou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesuse ncung mali bendar Yerikho fare nfane ndelo pnu cia. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Mali bendar cia, en smat isa ngahnyo Zakheus. I cia ta nfaboboko rfayalo pajakna. I smat kayang i. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />I nmario bo nem Yesus, ga bisa pa ningalena smatca n'gaole, ningalena i ni badanna kokope. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Gabe i nfarera ntuba mali smat lalo tina, taga ndawil mali ai ara isa bo nem Yesus ta bo ndel manana.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Oras ta Yesuse nlafo mali gagaw cia, I nninga nais taga nu, “Zakheus, fatoale mduri, ningalena wol tae Ya nane iteteam mali nim ebai i.” <figure style="fig" file="CN01777B.TIF" size="col" ref="19:5">Zakheus niwane wlona nderera Jou</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Nlonga tina, Zakheuse nduri hatowal mali ai ara cia gabe i nailow Yesus mali ni ebai i re wlona sangnang. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Oras ta farumi smatna dem tina, si mulaine rmaumauting, si du, “Cei, Yesuse cia nteteam mali smat ta nbaradosaca ni ebaicana ba!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ga Zakheuse nosal taga nua Jou Yesus, “Apa, ya bo ilowat hapaluan nik arata tane bo ya ipo lali smat ta rari paisa pana. Re laisa en smat ta ya ikakal si, ya bo ihawe lali sili tuwtuaf pifat.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Gabe Yesuse nua Zakheus, “Wol tae, Jou Lahatalla nfasalamate to mew ta fteteam mali ebai taena, ningalena aw tane fatutua Abraham ntu re hbu aw. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Ya iku laina, ningalena Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo bo niyawa smat ta dalaspa mali Jou Lahatalla ina, re nfasalamat si.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande tiwi guraci yafasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Yesuse ndahle bendar Yerusalem, oras cia, smat laloca rfikir du, Jou Lahatalla to ta nkawasa ndadi kolano mali ni smatna mali oras ciana. Ningalena Yesuse nto tina, gabe oras ta si rlonga I sube, Yesuse nafetang npake andeande isa laitane. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Yesuse nu, “En smat isa kolano ntu re hbu i, i nfan lali batang ta laspa ningalena bo rlange i ndadi kolano. Laisa i rlange i to, i bo nlolai hawe mali ni batangna. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Oras ta i bo nfanna, i nololaw ni smat karajan yafasa taga npo tiwi guraci lali sili isa-isa, taga i nu laitane, ‘Mew fpake tane bo ffawage denabe ya ilolai mali.’<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ga smat ta rteteam re i batang isa tina, si rlokolo i pa. Gabe, oras ta i nfan, si rfayeit riri smat isa bo nu laitane, ‘Amam kailow pa smat tae ndadi nimam kolano ina.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Ga makse laina, i rlange i ndadi kolano, gabe oras ta i nlolai hawe mali i ni batang. Ncula smat bo dololaw ni smat karajan ta I npo si tiwi to tina. I bo nfautno si tiwi ta rpake rfawage tina nbang i pare enpa.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Smat karajan ta ntubaca nlafo mali gabe nu, ‘Apa, tiwi isa ta apa mpo ya cia, tane nbang i to ndadi tiwi yafasa.’<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Gabe kolanoca nua ni smat karajan cia laitane, ‘Aw nim karajanna mafiana gaole, aw smat karajan ta mmafia. Aw mmanahan re okosesi ta nenena. Gabe tina oras tae ya bo ilange aw, bo mkawasa pnu yafasa.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Fola tina, smat karajan ta failuica nlafo gabe i nu, ‘Apa, tiwi isa ta apa mpo ya cia, tane nbang i to ndadi tiwi silim.’<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Gabe kolano cia nua ni smat karajan cia, ‘Gabe laina, ya ipo aw kawasa bo mkawasa bendar silim.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Fare smat karajan ta nesana rlafo gabe du, ‘Apa, tae apa ni tiwi ta apa mpo yaca. Ya ikising i pumul tuwalana bo mati nilangna. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ya ipei laina, ningalena ya ito apa cia smat ta wlomna cicoal gabe ya ikamcait. Laisa apa msula smatna diyawa ni bangbang apa ni tiwi cia, apa mmaulango i bo nduk bangbangna lal. Gabe laisa apa msula smatna rfatiwa, apa mmaulango si rfakatina lal.’<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Gabe kolano cia nua ni smat karajan cia, ‘E, aw smat karajan ta mmayai!’ Ya bo ifasal aw laisa re ahai ta aw muna. Aw mto ya tane smat ta wlokna cicoal: ya jaga iyal ahai ta ndadi ya nik pana, re jaga ikati ahai ta ya itiwa pana. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Gabe laina, pesaga ya nik tiwi cia aw mising i puli smat ta dising tiwina pana, bo oras ta ya ikuwe, ya bisa iyal tiwi cia re i ni bangbangna.<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Gabe kolano cia nua smat ta dosal manana, ‘Fyali to tiwi isa cia mali ina, taga fpo i lali smat karajan ta nduk tiwi yafasa cia.’<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Ga smat ta manana dua kolanoca, ‘Kolano, pesaga lainana? I cia ni tiwi yafasa to.’<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Kolano cia nua si laitane, ‘Ya ifaleneto mew e, smat ta nrajin nurus ahai ta en rfakawco ina, i osta nduke rfakawco ina foloi hawe. Ga smat ta nurus pa ahai ta rfakawco ina, ahai ta en mali ina makse okoce be, osta jal.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ga tane, farumi smat ta rlokolo rlange ya pa idadi si riri kolano yana, fwafo si taga ffut si mali, fare fpun famat si mali ya uhngok tane.”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna lal rtotoman re rfamamagal Yesus oras ta I ncung mali bendar Yerusalemna.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mrk. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesuse nafetang andeande cia hola, I nfane ntuba mali smat lalo tina, nfan lali bendar Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Oras ta bo ndahle pnu Betfage re pnu Betania, pnu silu ta puis popo Zaitun tasa, Yesuse ncula ni murit smat silu, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />re nfatnawe si laitane, “Mew ffane to lali pnu ta fboi cia. Laina mew fsung puli tina, mew osta fduk keledai po isa ta rpitna i, keledai cia smat isa ncaplo i pawbe. Mew fsalawe keledai cia taga ffut i mali. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Fare laisa smatna rfautno mew, ‘Pesaga mew fsalawe ina,’ mew fu laitane, ‘Jouca bo npake keledai tae.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Gabe smat silu tasa rfan. Si rduke ndumi laisa re ta Yesuse nua sina. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Gabe oras ta si rcalawe keledai cia, ga smat ta ni keledai cia nu laitane, “Pesa ga mew fsalawe keledai ciana?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Si rcanglo, “Jouca bo npake keledai tae.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Gabe si dut keledai cia lali Yesus i. Si difa keledai cia re riri jubana, taga rgali Yesuse ndawil nais keledai cia. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Oras ta Yesuse ncaplo keledai cia re ndelo lalingcana, smatna lal ta difa riri jubana mali lalingca bo rtotoman Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Oras ta Yesus bo ncunge to mali bendar Yerusalemna, neta mali laling ta nduri mali popo Zaitunca, farumi smat ta jaga rderera Ina, si mulaine rcenga re wlorina sangnang fare rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla. Si rpei laina ningalena farumi Mujizatna si deme to. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Si du laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Tfamamagal I ta Jou Lahatalla ncula I nlafo mali ndadi kolano!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Tane Jou Lahatalla ta mali sorogaica re smat mali dunia taena rfamafio si to.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Mali it tfamamagal re tcuba Jou Lahatalla ta tigo molangca!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Ga en smat Yahudi sifis ta rderera fatfato Farisina ta si mali smat lalo tina, si dua Yesus laitane, “Guru, mtolea smat ta jaga rderera Guru tina bo rfatengtengan si.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesuse ncanglo, “Ya ikuwa mew, gabe laisa rfatengtengan si, pat-pat tane ta osta rgigam re rcenga rfamamagal Jou.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ntangis neme bendar Yerusalemna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Oras ta Yesuse ndahle bendar Yerusalemna, I nem pnu cia fare I ntangis. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />I nu laitane, “Ali, senimew, smat ta fteteam mali bendar Yerusalemna! Ya imaulango to, mew ftaif ahai ta mew nane fpeina bo fduke ffamafio mew. Ga tane famease to, gabe tina ffamafio mewna enpanto, laisa rgoganne to mali mew i. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ningalena lomanta osta en ni orasna, smat ta rlokolo mew pana rlafo, si bo rpei titiban jele mew smat ta fdela Ya na mali nimew bendarca, taga si osta rpei e mew denabe mew ma ndadi fsapang pa mali tina. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Fare si bo rfajakam nimew bendar Yerusalem taga si bo rpun famate mew smat ta en fteteam manana. Re enpa pat pusa ta si osta rfateam ntotongo ta dirancana mali i gagaonana. Ningalena mew failow pa oras ta Jou Lahatalla nlafo bo nfasalamate mewna.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo smat ta rfawage mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagal cia ni kintalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mrk. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesuse ncung mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagal cia ni kintalna, taga I nfaungo ndumi smat ta rfawage puli tinana. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Yesuse nua si, “Mali Jou ni kitabca rlefo laitane, ‘Ya Nik Ebai tae ebai sombayang i.’ Ga mew fpei ndadi smat ta rmadarawana gagaori rgogan si.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Wol de wol Yesuse nfafcule puli Ebai Sombayang Mamagal cia ni kintalna. Smat Yahudina riri imam ta rfabobokona, guru agama Yahudi ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa, re simosimo nesana rmario bo rpun famat Yesus, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ga si rto pa mfalaisa ni fanfanna bo rpun famat Yesusna, ningalena farumi smat ta rteteam puli pnu ciana rlokolona gawle rlonga Yesuse ni fafculena.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Ta rfaboboko Agama Yahudina rfautno Yesus mduk kawasa manca mali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mrk. 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Bahnga tane, Yesuse nfafcule mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Fare I nfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i. Oras ta Yesuse nfafculena, imam ta rfabobokona, guru agama ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa, re simosimo agama Yahudina rlafo puli tina. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Si rfautno Yesus, “Co Aw mfabinga am, farumi ta mpei tina, Aw mduk kawasa manca mali? Fare ise ta npo kawasa tina mali Awi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesuse nua si, “Ya bena bo ifautno mew. Co mew fuwa Ya. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Ise ta npo kawasa lali Yohanes i denabe ncisope smatna? Jou Lahatalla, pare smatna?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Rlonga laina, si rfauwo laitane, “Laisa ite tu, ‘Jou Lahatalla ta npo kawasa,’ I osta bo nua it, ‘Pesaga mew fdela Yohanes pana?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ga laisa ite tu, ‘Smatna ta rpo kawasa,’ farumi smat tane osta rtig famat it re pat, ningalena si rdela, Yohanes tae nabi ta jaga nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Gabe si duwa Yesus, “Amame kto pa ise ta npo kawasa lali Yohanes i.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Gabe mew ffabinga Ya pa, Ya ma ifabinga mew pa, ise ta npo Ya kawasa ipei farumi tina.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande laisa smat ta rpei bet anggur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mrk. 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesuse nafetang andeande isa lali smat lalo tina laitane, “En smat isa npei bet anggur, taga i nfauwo re smat isa hawe ta bo nkarajan mali bet tinaca re bo njaga betnaca. Hola tina, i nfan lali batang nesa taga nteteamna mnu pulina. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Oras anggurna neta bo rfakati to, i ncula ni smat karajan isa lali smat ta rjaga bet ciana, bo si rpo ina lowloat mali betca ni okosesina. Ga smat ta rjaga bet ciana rpun smat cia, taga rcula i nuwe re nut paisa pa. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Fola tina, smat ta na bet cia ncula ni smat karajan ta nesana hawe. Ga i ma nduk punpun, re rfamaimai i, re dua i nuwe re nut paisa pa. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Gabe, smat ta na bet cia ncula ni smat karajan ta nesana hawe, ga i ma si rpun i denabe nyabate ndumi, taga rtigea i mali bet tina natalil.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Gabe smat ta na bet cia nu laitane, ‘Ya nane ipei ahai e? Mafiana ya isula ntukca, ta ya igogoru ica. Osta si rhormati i.’<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ga oras smat ta rjaga bet ciana dem smat ta na bet cia ntuca, si rfauwo, re du, ‘I tae to ta ndadi ina waris bet taneca. Gabe, mali ite tpun famat i, bo bet tane ndadi ite rar.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Gabe si rdasi natalil mali bet tina taga rpun famat i.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Gabe nafetange hola andeande cia, Yesuse nfautno smat ta manana, “Tane, smat ta na bet cia bo npei ahai lali smat ta rjaga bet ciana? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Osta I nlafo bo npun famat si. Hola tina, i npo lali smate nesa bo rjaga ina bet cia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Rlonga Yesus nu laina, si rtaif Yesus nfatailo si laisa smat ta rjaga bet tina ta rpun rfamat ta na bet cia ntuca. Gabe si tina du, “Matina! Mati fpun famat i na.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ga Yesuse nyelyelo si fare nu, “Makse mew fu mati fpun famat ina, ga mfalaisa re ta rlefoe to mali Jou ni Kitab taena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Pat ta smatna rpei ebai rpake pana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">tina ndadi laisa pat fandasi ta mafia re cicoalna gaole.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Ise ta npawil i puis pat tina, i osta namjakam. Re ise ta pat tina ntabi i, i osta nbange namjakam.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Guru agama Yahudi ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa re imam ta rfabobokona, si rtaif andeande ta Yesus nu i nanaica nu smat ta rcula si rjaga bet ciana, I nu tina ntelmo si. Gabe tina, si rmario bo rwafo Yesus ga si damcait smat lalo ta en manana.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta rfaboboko Agama Yahudina rfautan ga tpalas pajakna lali Kolano Romaca pare enpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mrk. 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Guru agama Yahudi ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa, re imam ta rfabobokona, si diyawa laling bo rwafo Yesus, gabe si rtarokira be I. Gabe si rcula smat sifis rning-ningo I. Si tina rdarawa rdadi smat mafia, bo si diyawa Yesuse na sal. Si rmaulango I nmautingna ncal bo si bisa rfabinga lali gubernur ta ni kawasa nuruse smatca. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Gabe si mulaine rfautno Yesus laitane, “Guru, amame kto, farumi ta Guru mu re ta mfafcule tina fatutua. Guru ma mlokolo pa miyawa uhngom mali smatna. Langisa Guru mfafcule be ta tutuona, mfalaisa ttub tderera Jou Lahatalla wlonana. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Gabe tane, amam bo kfautno Guru, laisa tderera animam agamaca ni fatfatona, bisa pare bisa pa amam kpalas pajak lali kolano mamagal Romacana?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ga Yesuse nto si wlori ta bo rdarawa Ina, gabe I nua si laitane, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Co ffaemo Ya tiwi ta mew jaga fpake fpalas pajakna. Ise ni gambar re ise ngahnyo mana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Si rcanglo, “Kolano mamagal Romaca ni gambar re ngahnyo!”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Gabe laina, fpo to lali Kolanoca ahai ta mew nane fpo ina, re fpo to lali Jou Lahatalla i ahai ta mew nane fpo lali Jou Lahatalla ina!”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Rlonga ahai ta Yesuse nu tina, si ndadi rherang gabe liori pa. Ningalena, si rduk I na salna pa mali smat lalo tina uhngorina.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule si ga smat ta rmatna osta rpaling hawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mrk. 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Hola tina, en smat sifis agama Yahudi mali fatfato Sadukina, rlafo lali Yesus i. Fatfato Saduki tane ta rdela pa, smat ta rmatna osta rpaling hawena. Gabe si rfautno Yesus laitane, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Guru, tantuba nabi Musa nparenta, man ise be ta nfasawe to ga nmat ntu pa, i tenona faisa nane nfasawa re i ni balo cia bo teno ta nmat cia en ntu bena. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ga bahnga ndadi i laitane: en smat man sifit rfatenow. Ta uwatica nfasaw re maping isa ga nmat ntu pa. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Gabe maping cia nfasaw hawe re teno ta papapo ica, ga i ma nmat ntu pa. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Laina bena re silu tasa papaporica, re laina to denabe smat sifit tasa rfasawa i ndumi. Si farumi rmat nturi pa. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ni morco napna, maping cia ma nmat. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Gabe, tane amam bo kfautan, lomanta mali wol kiamatca, oras ta Jouca nfapaling hawe farumi smat, ta manca molang mali si smat sifit tasa ta ndadi maping cia ni uwatica? Ningalena, smat sifit ta rfatenow tasa farumi rfasaw re i!”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Smat ta rtub mali dunia tae rfasaw, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />ga smat ta Jou Lahatalla nu pantase rtub hawena, si tina lomane I bo nfapaling si, re si tina rfasaw panto. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Ningalena, si rtub laisa re malaekatna re si rmat panto. Si tina rdadi Jou Lahatalla Ntu, ningalena I ta nfapaling si hawe. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Gabe laisa smat ta rmat ga rpaling hawena, nabi Musa nfabinga to tina, oras ta i mali mom sogana lapo ta lolob. Oras cia, Jou Lahatalla nu lali nabi Musa i laitane, ‘Ya tane to Jou Lahatalla ta Abraham, Ishak, re Yakub jaga rcuba.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Oras Jou Lahatalla nu laina, Abraham, Ishak, Yakub rmate to. Ga makse si rmate to, si rtub hawe to re Jou Lahatalla. Re laina, fatutua, Jou Lahatalla cia smat ta rmatna riri Jou i pa, ga smat ta rtubna riri Jou i.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Rlonga tina, guru agama Yahudi sifis ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa du laitane, “Guru, Guru msanglo tina fatutuana gaole.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Mana mali, si damcaite to rfautan ahai lali Yesus ina.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesias cia kolano Daute ntu re hbu i, re ni Jou i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mrk. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Gabe Yesuse nua si laitane, “Ta smatna jaga du, Mesiasca, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji ica, I cia kolano Daute ntu re hbu i. Ga I be Kolano Daute ntu re hbu Ina? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ningalena kolano Daut bahnga nu Jou Lahatalla ni jaji bo Mesias tina mali Kitab Mazmur laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Jou Lahatalla en nu lali ya nik Jouca laitane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Mtotolange to mali gagaw ta daraga i, mali Ya nik wela tane.<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Denabe Ya ifakala ndumi nim lawanna.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Gabe laisa kolano Daute nu Mesias cia i ni Jou i, enpa Mesias cia kolano Daute ntu re hbu i be pa?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati fderera guru agama Yahudi re smat Farisina riri tabeatnana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrk. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Oras ta smat laloca rlonga sube Yesuse ni mautingna, Yesuse nua I ni murit-muritna, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mew nane wlomew yaneto re guru agama Yahudi ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa, si tina laisa rfan, rlokolo rpake kabaya mlanga ta rfaem si smat ta riri ngale, fare si rlokolona gaole smatna rhormati si mali smat lalo uhngori. Laisa mali ebai sombayang re mali rame seli, si tina rlokolona gaole rtotolang potao mali gagaw ta daragana. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Si ma rlokolo rdarawa balona bo jale riri ebaina. Taga si laisa rcombayang mnuna gaole bo smatna rto si tina smat mafia. Si tane osta bo rduk sal-sal ta tebteb.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Maping balo ta ncusaca ni sadaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mrk. 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Oras ta Yesus i mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca sube, I ntarokira smat kayang ta rlafo dising si riri sadaka mali sadaka gagaocana. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Yesuse ma ntarokira balo isa ta ncusa nlafo nising ni sadakaca mali sadaka gagao cia. Ga, balo cia ni sadaka tasa tiwi sen silu. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Gabe Yesuse nu, “Flonga famafia e, mali Jou Lahatalla uhngo, balo ta ncusa tae ta npona foloi mali farumi smat ta rpo tina. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ningalena, smat kayangna, makse si rpona lal, ga mali silina gleona lal sube. Ga balo tae, makse i ncusa ma, i npo farumi to ta i nina.” <figure style="fig" file="cn01794B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="21:4">Maping balo ta ncusaca ni sadaka</figure><verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca bo rluka i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mrk. 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Oras cia, Yesuse ni murit sifis dafetang du Ebai Sombayang Mamagal cia nmafia, ningalena en patna mafia re okosesi rupa lalo i ta smatna rpo bo rhawe Jou Lahatalla ni mafiana. Gabe Yesuse nua si, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Ta mew fem puli Ebai Sombayang Mamagal ciana, osta en ni orasna, farumi tina osta rduke rfajakam denabe rata, fare enpa pat pusa ta bo nteteam mali i gagaona hawena.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ahai ta bo ndadi i mali wol kiamatca pawbena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mrk. 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Gabe Yesuse ni murit-muritna rfautno I, “Guru, ta Guru mu nana i tina, oras ahai bo ndadi i? Fare ni fafayal ahai, laisa farumi tina bo ndadi i?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesuse nua si, “Fpei famafia e, bo mati denabe dakale mewna. Ningalena lal smatna osta rlafo rpake Ya ngahnyok fare si du laitane, ‘Ya tane I to, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamat smatca!’ Si ma osta du, ‘Wol kiamatca bo nalawpa nto.’ Ga mew mati fderera sina. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Gabe laisa mew flonga abar smatna rfaparang, fare smatna rfatotole re pamarentana, mati mew famcaitna. Farumi tina nane ndadi i ntuba, ga tina enpa ni ngale dunia tae bo tina to nkiamatna.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe lali sili, “Lomane, smat mali batang isa osta rfaparang re smat mali batang ta pusa, fare kolano isa i re ni smatna osta rfaparang re kolano isa re ni smat ta nesana. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Fare osta en bena sui ta cicoalna gaole, re osta en panyaket ta nfasaplo lali smatna manca-manca, fare osta en bena smatna ncusa ina gaole diyawa anna. Fare osta bo ndadi i okosesi ta npei tamcait re fafayal-fafayal ta tgarayan mali langitca. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ga laisa farumi tina ndadi i paube, osta rwafo re rfasale mew, ningalena mew fdela Ya. Si osta rpo mew lali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina, gabe bo duruse mew taga rcunga mew bui. Re osta rfabowa mew lali kolano re gubernurna. Farumi tina bo ndadi i mali mewi, ningalena mew fderera Ya. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ga oras ta duruse mew tina, tina ndadi oras mali mewi bo fabinga Ya lali sili. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Gabe tina, facicoale wlomewna, bo mati mew ffikir ahai ta nane mew fu bo lomane fbela nimew diricana. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Ningalena, Ya to ta bo ipei mew fsanglona fto, denabe smat ta rlokolo mew pana rmampo rbalco nimew mautingna pa bo rbo re mewna. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Smatna osta rlokolo mew pa ningalena mew fderera Ya. Hma re hye mewna, tenomewna, ramamew ta nesana re nimew del-delona. Si ta rdela Ya pa tina bo rpo mew lali smat ta rkawasa bo duruse mewna. Re sifis mali mewina osta rpun famat si. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Farumi smatna osta rlokolo mew pa ningalena mew fderera Ya. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ga mew mati famcaitna, ningalena isa pa mali mewi tane ta ni uta mali bobokona osta bo myangis. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Laisa mew fmanahan fdela Ya turus, mew osta fduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali-lali.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga bendar Yerusalem bo namewis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat. 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mrk. 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Yesuse nua si hawe, “Lomane laisa mew fem tentarana jele bendar Yerusalem, mew osta fto, bendar cia mnu panto bo dewis i. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Oras cia, smat ta en mali batang Yudea mafiana fatoal rfarera lali lolasna. Re smat ta en mali bendarcana, mafiana fatoal rfane rcapang mali pnu cia potalil, re smat ta en mali pnu-pnuna, mati rcung namul bendar ciana to. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ningalena wol-wol tina, Jou Lahatalla bo npo sal-sal, bo ahai ta ene njaji mali Jou ni Kitab cana farumi ndadi i. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Gabe ta kangelana gawle oras ciana, maping ta riri badan re ta nturina rcus subena. Ningalena, osta en kangela ta cicoalna gaole mali farumi batang Israel, fare Jou Lahatalla bo nfasal smat Israelna. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />En ta osta rpun si re eta, en bena ta osta dut si rcung bui puli farumi bangsa. Gabe smat ta rfayala Jou Lahatalla pana bo rfafil-fila bendar Yerusalem, denabe sipat oras ta I nfato bo nfasale smat tina ndumi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fafayalna ntuba Yesuse nlafo pawbena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mrk. 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Yesuse nu hawe lali I ni murit-muritna, “Osta en fafayal ta npei smatna rherang mali wolca, ngaca fare ototafna. Re mali dunia tae, smat mali farumi batang tae osta ndadi damcait re rfatoto pa poko mumat mamagal ta liona cicoalca. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Smatna osta damdererna gaole bo rfikir ahai ta osta bo ndadi i mali farumi dunia taena, ningalena farumi ta en mali langitcana ndadi kacaw. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Gabe oras cia to, smatna osta dem Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica I mali metna hapaluan re farumi ni kawasana re naplangana gaole. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Gabe laisa farumi tina bo mulaine ndadi i to, fpaling taga facicoale wlomewna, ningalena bo mnu panto mew osta fduk salamat.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wol-wol ta kangelana ndadi fafayal Yesus bo nlafo hawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mrk. 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Gabe, Yesuse nafetang andeande isa lali sili. I nu laitane, “Co mew ftarokira famafia ai ara re ai ahai be. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Laisa mew fem ai tina ntipa i, mew ndadi fto, tina fafayal oras bo wolwolna ndahle to. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Laina bena, laisa wol-wol kangela ta Ya iku tina mulain bo ndadi i to, mew ndadi fto, mnu panto Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolanona mali I ni smatna.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Flolam famafia ta Ya iku tane, smat ta rtub oras taena, en ta rtub sube denabe farumi tina ndadi i. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Langit re batang tae bo myangis, ga Ya nik maumautingna osta en myangis pa denabe lali-lali.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nu ite nane tciap oras ta I bo nlafo hawena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Fjaga nimew dirica famafia, mati denabe mew ffikir be rame bena, re fdome bo nmone mewna, fare mati wlomewna ncusa nimew tubca wol de wolna. Ningalena gabe laisa mew ffikirna laisa laina, mew osta fsiap pa oras Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica nlafona, tina fatailo laisa aiwani ta nciap pa ta sisira nkiko sina. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Ningalena wol cia bo nlafo mali farumi smat ta mali dunia tae re tfatai-taifo pa. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Ga, mew nane fjaga dirica turus famafia, re fsombayang bo mew ndadi fcicoal fmanahan fbo farumi kangela ta bo ndadi i tina denabe mew fmaralapis mali tina. Re laina mew fsiape fbo Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Wol de wol, oras wolwolo, Yesuse nfan nfafcule mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, fare doram, I ncapang mali bendar Yerusalem cia, fare namtuli mali popo ta ngahnyo Zaitunca. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Fare etnga be dororami sube, smatna lal rlafo lali Yesus I mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca bo rlonga I nfafcule puli tina.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Smat ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rfauwo si bo rpun famat Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mrk. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Oras cia, smat Yahudina riri Wol Mamagal Roti ta rpake Ragi Paca ndahle to. Wol cia ta si du Paska, wol ta si rlolam oras ta Jou Lahatalla ni mafia nfabebas hma re bburi ta ntuba oras ta rfasusa si mali Mesirna. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Imam ta rfaboboko re guru agama Yahudi ta rto ndumi musa ni kitab silim tasa, rfauwo si bo rpun famat Yesus ni lalingna rgogogan si, ningalena si damcait smat lalo ta rlokolo Yesusna.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudase nwage Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat. 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mrk. 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Isa mali Yesus ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, i ngahnyo Yudas Iskariot. Oras cia, setane ni kolanoca ncung Yudase wlona. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Gabe Yudase nfan lali imam ta rfabobokona fare ta rjaga Ebai Sombayang Mamagalcana bo nua si, bo nwage Yesus lali sili. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Si rcenga fare rfajaji bo rpo tiwi lali Yudas i. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudase ma nailow. Fare mulain oras cia, i niyawa oras ta mafia bo bisa npo Yesus lali sili, re smat laloca nto pa. <figure style="fig" file="cn01812B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="22:6">Yudas nwage Yesus re nfatan i </figure><verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncula ni murit-muritna rfasiap okosesina mali wol mamagal paskaca bo si rceli farerer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mat. 26:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Mrk. 14:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Gabe nlafo i to ni orasna, smat agama Yahudina bo rpei si riri Wol Mamagal Roti Ta Npake Ragi Paca. Wol cia, smat Yahudina nane rkati domba Paska bo rlolam oras Jou Lahatalla nfabebas hma re hburi ta ntuba ta rfasal si mali batang Mesirna. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Gabe Yesuse ncula Petrus re Yohanes, I nu laitane, “Ffane to, ffasiap an Wol Mamagal Paskaca, bo ite tceli farerer.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Gabe smat silu tasa rfautno Yesus, “Manca gagaw ta Aw mu bo amam kfasiapna?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesuse nua si, “Oras ta mew fsung bendar Yerusalem, mew osta ffadukduk re smat isa ta npapa tampayang lolo waya. Mew fderera i denabe i ncung mali ni ebaica. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Fare fua smat ta ni ebaica laitane, ‘Nimam Guruca ncula kfautan, manca gagaw ta Guruca bo npake i bo rceli dan an wol mamagal Paska farerer re I ni murit-muritnaca?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Gabe smat cia osta nfafcule mew gagaw isa puis ta nmamagal re farumi okosesina ene to mana. Mew ffasiape to anna mana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Rlonga Yesuse nu hola laina, Petrus i re Yohanese rfan, fare rduk tina laisa re ta farumi Yesuse nua sina. Gabe si rfasiap an Wol Mamagal Paskaca.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nceli farerer re I ni murit-muritna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat. 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mrk. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kor. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Gabe ni orase to bo rceli mali Wol Mamagal cia, Yesuse ntotolang nceli farerer re I ni susulana. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yesuse nua si, “Mali wol mamagal Paska tae, Ya ilokolona gaole ikan an wol mamagal farerer re mew ta ikangela paube tane. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ningalena Ya ikuwa mew: morco tane Ya iseli ikan an wol mamagal mantanena denabe wol mamagal Paska tae ndadi i ndumi to taga tfadukduk hawe mali oras ta Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi kolano mali I ni smatnana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Fola tina, Yesuse nyal cawan isa lolo anggur fare nu tarima kase nais Jou Lahatalla i, taga I nua ni murit-muritna, “Fyal tane, bo mew smat isa-isa fdom. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Flonga famafia ta Ya iku tane, mantane bo lali, Ya osta idom panto anggur tane. Ga lomane oras Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna, taga Ya idom hawe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Gabe Yesuse nyal rotina, taga nu tarima kase nais Jou Lahatalla i. I nfawog-wogla rotina fare npo lali sili, I nu, “Roti tane, Ya nik badanca ta Ya ipo lali mewi. Fan tane bo flolam Ya!” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Laina bena rceli hola, Yesuse npo cawan ta lolo anggurca lali I ni murit-muritna. I nu, “Anggur ta pumul cawan tae, Ya nik laflaf ta maraepa bo fatutua Jou Lahatalla ni jaji ta pona. Gabe Ya nik laflaf ta maraepa tina ndadi nfatuo, Jou Lahatalla ni jaji bo smatna ndadi i to.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ga flonga famafia, smat ta bo nwage Yaca, oras tae nceli nfarerer re it mantane. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Fatutua Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica osta nmat laisa re ta Jou Lahatalla nfato ntuba tona, ga nbodito to smat ta nwage Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica, i osta nduk salsal ta tebteb.” <figure style="fig" file="CN01803B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="22:22">Yesuse nceli farerer re I ni murit-muritna</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Rlonga tina, Yesuse ni murit-muritna mulaine rfaututan, ise mali sili ta osta npei lainaca.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ise ta nmamagalna foloi mali farumi muritnaca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Gabe, Yesuse ni murit-muritna mulaine rfakotale ise ta ndadi smat ta nmamagal foloi mali farumi si. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Kolano-kolano mali bangsa-bangsa ta rfayala Jou pana, si rfaboboko riri rayatna re cicoal, makse laina si dailow smatna du, ‘Si tina rlokolo rgali si riri rayatna.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ga mew mati fiyawa kawasa bo ffaboboko fparenta smatna. Ise mali mewi tane ta bo ndadi smat ta nmamagal mali Jou Lahatalla uhngo, i nane nfanene i laisa smat ta ni ngale paisa pana. Gabe ise ta bo ndadi nfaboboko, i cia nane laisa smat ta jaga nleleane smat. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Co mew ffikir ise ta nmamagalna foloi, smat ta ntotolang ncelica, pare ta nleleane ica? Smat ta ntotolang ncelica? Ga Ya mfalaina pa, oras ta Ya mali fapaluwno mewna, Ya ta ileleane mew.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Oras ta Ya iduk kangelana, mew jaga farerer re Ya. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Gabe tina, Ya bo ipo mew kawasa bo fkawasa laisa re Ya nik Apa npo kawasa mali Ya ina. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Re laina, oras ta Ya ikawasa idadi Kolano mali Ya nike smatna, mew osta fseli re fdom mali mejaca farerer re Ya. Gabe, mew osta ftotolang puis kolano gagaoca bo furuse suku yafasa re silu ta mali Israel tasa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ntuba, Petruse bo nu nfayala Yesus pana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mrk. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesuse nua Simon Petrus, “Simon, Simon, co mlonga! Setanna riri kolanoca ndor lali Jou Lahatalla i, bo ntohnga mew bo mew mati fdela Yana to. Tina laisa re smat ta rtapis gandum rfara mali ni gicoca. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ga Ya isombayang bo aw mdela Ya, bo nim ta mdelana mati mnyangisna. Aw osta mtaul Ya, ga oras ta mdela Yana cicoal hawe, aw nane mfacicoal tenom re ramamna wlorina bena bo si rdela Ya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Simon Petruse nua Yesus, “Jou, makse ya isung bui, ya isiap. Ya ma isiape imat farerer re Aw!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Ga Yesuse nua i: “Mlonga famafia ta Ya ikuwa aw tane, Petrus, doram tae tataleca rkuku paube, aw faicole to, mu mfayala Ya pana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ni murit-muritna bo rciap makse rduk kangela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua I ni murit-muritna laitane, “Ta ntuba, oras ta Ya isula mew fabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla ina, ga Ya iku mati ffut tiwi gagaona, tas fare sandalna. Oras cia, mew fsusa ahai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Si rcanglo, “Enpa, amam ksusa paisa pa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ga oras tae laina pa, ise ta ni tiwi gagao ma tas, nane i nut, fare ise ta ni eta pa, i nane nwage ni jubaca bo bisa ngon eta fapusa. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ya ikuwa mew, ahai ta Jou Lahatalla njaji mali I ni kitabca bo Yana, meman bo ndadi i to. Tane ta rlefo mali I ni kitabcana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 22:37">‘Smatna du, I cia smat mayai i.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:37">Ningalena ahai ta rlefo bo Ya na, tane, farumi tina bo ndadi i.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Gabe Yesuse ni murit-muritna duwa I, “Guru, co mem, tane en eta silu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Yesuse nua si, “Laona to.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncombayang mali popo Zaitun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mrk. 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Gabe Yesuse ncapang nfanenowe bendar cia, re biasa, I nfan lali popo Zaitun. Ni murit-muritna ma rderera I. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Oras si rlafo mali gagaw cia, Yesuse nua si, “Mew fsombayange to, bo mati setanca nyakule mew fpei dosana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Gabe Yesuse nfalaspa i mali sili sal pana meter yafatol laona. Fare naftiba pupuo tasa nap taga ncombayang, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Ya Apa, laisa Apa mailow, Apa mfalaspa farumi kangela tane mali Ya i. Ga mati mderera ta Ya iku nana, mderera be ta Apa nuna.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Gabe malaikat isa mali langitca, nfaemi lali Yesus i bo npo I cicoal. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesuse wlona kangelana gaole fare I ncombayangna ta tutuwo. Ni sagige ta marapawil nap nyinyencana laisa re laflafna. <figure style="fig" file="cn01810B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="22:44">Yesuse ncombayang mali popo Zaitun</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Gabe ncombayange hola, Yesuse nosal taga nfulasi lali ni murit-muritna. I nem si damtowal ningalena damgai re wlorina kangela. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Gabe, Yesuse nua si, “Pesaga mew famtuli? Fpaling fare fsombayang, bo mati setanca nyakule mew fpei dosana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rwagfo Jou Yesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mrk. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh. 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Oras ta Yesuse nmauting sube, smatna lal ta rlafona, fare murit ta ngahnyo Yudas, isa mali Yesuse ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, i ta i potao molang. Yudase ndahle Yesus bo nfatan I. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ga Yesuse nua Yudas, “E Yudas, aw mfatan Ya tane, aw bo mwage Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Oras ta Yesuse ni murit-murit ta nesana dem ahai ta osta ndadi tina, si du, “Guru, ga amam nane kpake eta bo ktota si beto?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Fare isa mali Yesuse ni murit-muritna ntota imam mamagalca ni smat karajan isa kanyo welana denabe morit.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ga Yesuse nu, “ffola to!” Gabe, Yesuse nkawce smatca kanyona fare nfamafia i kanyona.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Gabe Yesuse nua imam ta rfabobokona, fare ta rfaboboko rjaga Ebai Sombayang Mamagalcana, fare simosimo Yahudi ta rlafo bo rwagfo Ina. I nu, “Mew ffikir Ya tane smat mayai ya, denabe mew ffut eta re ai bo fwagfo Yana? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Naga, wol de wol Ya mali hapaluwno mew mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna lolo, ga mew fwagfo ya mana pa. Ga inanai to. Tane to i ni orasna mew bo fwagfo Ya, re hawe ni orase to bo setan-setanna riri kolanoca nfafcule i ni kawasa dororamna.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petruse nfayala Yesus pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat. 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mrk. 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoh. 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Gabe, smat ta rlafo tina, si rwagfo Yesus taga dute rcapnga I mali tina. Si dut I rfan lali imam mamagalca ni ebai i, ga oras cia, Petrus en nderera si nalaspa. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Mali imam mamagalca ni kintalna hapaluan, smatna rpei yap fare si rtotolang jel yapca. Petrus bena ntotolang farerer re si. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />En leleyane maping isa, nem Petrus ntotolang ndahle yapca. I ntarokira Petrus famafia, gabe nua smat ta manana, “Smat tae bena nfarerer re Yesus.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ga Petruse npida, nu “Enpa, ya ifayala I pa!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ga mnu pana, en smate nesa isa nem Petrus gabe i nu, “Awe ma jaga mfarerer re sil bena!” Ga Petruse nu, “Enpa, ya pa cia!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Fare mnuona laisa tok bahnga, holana, smate nesa isa hawe nu re nfacicoal i, “Fatutua to, smat tae bena nfarerer re Yesus, ningalena i bena smat Galilea i.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ga Petruse npida, i nu “Enpa, ya ito pa ahai ta aw mu tina.” Gabe oras tina to, tataleca ma nkuku. <figure style="fig" file="cn01820B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="22:60">Petruse nu nfayala Yesus pa</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Gabe, Jou Yesuse ntoi i lali Petrus i. Gabe Petruse nlolam ta Yesuse nua ina, doram cia tataleca nkuku paube, i npida faicole to, nu i nfayala Yesus pa. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Nlolam tina, Petruse nfan natalil fare ntangisna nmasisewle.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna rfamaimai Yesus fare rpun I</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat. 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mrk. 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Gabe smat ta rtahan Yesusna, rmulaine rfamaimai Yesus. Si rpun I, <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />si rpitane mtana rpake kaing fare rfautno I, “Gabe aw fatutua nabi ta mut Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw, co mu ise ta npun Aw tae?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Fare lal sube maumauting ta si du bo rfamaimai Ina.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse duti lali Mahkama Agamana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mrk. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh. 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Oras ta dororam i sube, simosimo Yahudina, fare imamna riri ta nfabobokoca, re guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, farumi rfayalo si bo durus Yesuse ni halna. Si tina ngahnyori Mahkama Agama. Gabe en ta dut Yesus bo nbo si. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Gabe mana, si rfautno I, “Co Aw mfabinga amam. Gabe Aw tane fatutua Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji ta ntuba be?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesuse ncanglo, “Makse Ya ifabinga mew, ga mew osta fdela pa. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Fare makse Ya ifautno mew, ga mew osta fsanglo pa. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Gabe mulain oras tae, Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica ntotolange to mali gagaw ta daragaica, mali Jou Lahatalla ta nkawasa molangca ni welana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Rlonga tina, si farumi du, “Gabe laina, Aw tane Lahatalla ntu Aw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Yesuse ncanglo si, “Mewe to ta fu lainana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Gabe si du, “Ite tlonga to I ni mautingna, I npei I ni dirica laisa Jou Lahatalla! Gabe, ite matina to tiyawa saksi hawena, ningalena ite eto to I ncal gabe nane nmat!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse durus i mali gubernur Pilatus i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mrk. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Gabe farumi smat ta rderera sidang ciana dosal, fare si dut Yesus bo nbo gubernur Pilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Mana si rmulaine du Ina salna, du laitane, “I tae ta nua smat mali bangsa taena bo mati rpalas pajak lali kolano mamagal Romacana. I bena nu I cia Kristus, ta ni ngale Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji nfasalamate smatca.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Gabe gubernur Pilatus nfautno I, “Fatutua Aw tane smat Yahudina riri Kolanoca?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesuse ncanglo, “Apa awe to ta mu lainana.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Gabe gubernur Pilatuse nua agama Yahudina riri imam ta rfaboboko re smat lalo ta en manana, “Makse pusa ma ya iduk pa I na salna.” <figure style="fig" file="cn01825B.tif" size="col" ref="23:4">Yesuse durus i mali gubernur Pilatus i</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ga rbange rfacicoal si du Yesuse na mayai, si du, “I tae ta nua smat laloca mali farumi batang Yudea, re I ni nfafculena bo rlawang pamarentana. I nmulain mali batang Galilea denabe nlafo mantane, mali bendar Yerusalem.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gubernur Pilatus nfayeit Yesus lali Kolano Herodes i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Oras ta gubernur Pilatuse nlonga Yesuse nfabinga mulain mali Galilea, gabe i nfautno si, “Gabe, fatutua Yesus cia smat Galilea i?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Gabe i nto Yesus cia smat Galilea i, Pilatuse ncula si dut Yesus rfan lali Herodes Antipas i, ningalena Herodes ta nkawasa mali batang Galilea. Oras ciana, Herodes i mali Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Nem Yesus laitane, Herodes ncangnangna gaole, ningalena mnu to nlonga du Ina re mnu to bo nem Yesusna. Herodes nmaulango i bisa nem Yesuse npei mujizat. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Herodes nfautanna lal lali Yesus ina, ga Yesuse ncanglo paisa pa. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Oras cia, smat Yahudina riri imam ta rfaboboko re guru agama Yahudi ta rto ndumi Musa ni kitab silim tasa, rfan potao fare du na sal ta tebtebna lali Yesus i. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Gabe Herodes i re ni tentarana rmulaine du na sal fare rfamaimai Yesus, taga si rfapake I juba ta mafiana laisa kolanona rpakena. Taga, si rloila I lali Pilatus i. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Fare mulain wol cia to, Herodes re Pilatus rfadeldelo, naga ta ntuba malina si smat silu tasa rfasangnang pa.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna rfasal Yesus denabe nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mrk. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoh. 18:39</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Fola tina, gubernur Pilatuse nololaw imam ta rfabobokona, fare ta rfaboboko Yahudina re smat Yahudi ta nesana rfayalo si mali Pilatuse ni istanaca. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Fare Pilatuse nua si, “Mew fute Smat tae mali ya i, fu, I nua smatca n'gaole to bo rlawang pamarentana. Ga tane mew fem! Ya ikurus I to mali uhngo mew tane, ga makse pusa be ya iduke na salna pa laisa ta mew funana. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Herodese ma nduke I na salna pa, gabe i nfawe i hawe Smat tae mali amam i. Molang, I cia npei sal paisa pa, ta npei I denabe tfasali nmatna. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Gabe ya bo ipun I re wala, taga ikowe I.”<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Pilatuse nu bo nowe Yesus, ningalena etnga be taun oras ta smat Yahudina riri wol mamagal, I jaga biasa nowe smat isa. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ga oras smat laloca rlonga tina, si farumi ta manana rgigam farerer, du, “Mpun famat I to, bo mowe Barabas mali amam i!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Barabas cia smat ta nduk rcunga i bui, ningalena mali bendar Yerusalemna i re ni delna bo rfaungo pamarenta Romana, fare si npun famat smatna.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Ga Pilatuse nalow nowe Yesus. Gabe i nmauting hawe re liona nfacicoali lali smat ta en manana. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ga si rgigamna rfacicoal si hawe, si du, “Msalipi I to! Msalipi I to!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Gabe ta faicolna Pilatuse nua si, “I npei sal-sal ahai ga? Ningalena ya iduk I na salna pa, makse pusa be ta npei I bo nduk tfasali denabe nmatna. Gabe ya isula fpun I, hola tina ya bo ikowe I.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ga si re rpaksa gabe du re liorina rfacicoal si bo rsalip Yesus. Ni morco napna, si duntung ningalena si rgigam turus re rpaksa. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Gabe Pilatuse nyal nfaorit nap nderera si duna. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Pilatuse nowe Barabas nderera ta si duna. Barabas cia smat ta nduk rcunga i bui ningalena nlawanng pamarentana fare npun famat smatna. Ga Yesus i npo i lali sili, lomanta si bo rpei laisa.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse rsalip i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mrk. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Fola tina, tentara Romana dut Yesus rcapnga i mali bendar Yerusalem. Gabe mali lalingca fapaluan, si rfaduduk re smat isa i ngahnyo Simon. Simon tae smat Kirene i, i taga nlafo mali bendarca potalil mali. Si rtahan i gabe rcula npapa salipca taga nderera Yesus mali taona.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Smat lalo ta rderera Yesus mali taona. En bena maping-maping ta rtangis re rgigam rfacicoal si ningalena rmasie Ina gaole. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Ga Yesuse nfulasi nyelyelo si, fare nu; “Ee, mew maping-maping Yerusalem! Mati ftangso Yana. Ga ftangso nimew dirica fare ntumewna! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ningalena osta bo en kangela ta tebtebna gaoleca, gabe wol cia osta en smatna du laitane, ‘Rcangnangna gaole maping ta nturi pana, ta rdadikna pa re ta rfasuse nturina pana.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Gabe smatna osta du lali lolasna, ‘Maraciwe to bo ntabi amam bo kmat!’ Fare du lali popona, ‘Mpuco ame to.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ya iku laina ningalena Ya ta ipei dosa pa bere si rsalip Ya laitane, ahai hawe laisa mew ta jaga fpei dosana. Ya laisa re ai ta mang pawbena gabe ikamgini ndumi pa. Ga mew laisa ai ta mange tona, gabe laisa feta yap famgini ndumi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Oras ciana, tentara Romana dute smat silu bena, ta wlorina mayai, bo rsalip si farerer re Yesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Oras ta si rlafo mali gagaw isa ta ngahnyo “Gagaw Tengkorak”, si rsalip Yesus mana. Sile ma rsalip smat silu ta wlorina mayai tasa bena, ta isaica i mali Yesuse ni welana fare ta isa benaca i mali Yesuse ni balitna. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesuse ncombayang, “Apa, mampung si ningalena si rto pa ahai ta si rpeina.” Gabe tentarana rcibit lot bo rto ise re ise ta bo rduk Yesuse ni pakenana.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Smat lalo ta dosal manana deme ndumi ta ndadi ina, gabe ta rfaboboko smat Yahudinana du Yesuse na rfamaya i. Si du, “Smate nesana I nfasalamat. Tane inanai to bo I nfasalamat I ni dirica, gabe fatutua I cia Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla nfisang I bo nfasalamate smatca.” <figure style="fig" file="CN01836B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="23:35">Yesuse rsalip i re smat silu tasa</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Fare tentara Romana ma du Ina mayai, si rdahle I, taga rfaroma I anggur kakaninca. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Fare si du I hawe, “Gabe laisa fatutua smat Yahudina riri kolano Aw, mfasalamate nim dirica to!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Fare puis Yesuse bobokona fafan ungo isa rlefo laitane, “Tae smat Yahudina riri kolanoca.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Fare isa mali smat mayai silu ta rsalip si tasa isaca nu Yesuse na mayai, i nu, “Aw Kristus, paga? Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatca. Gabe laina, co mfasalamate nim dirica, fare amam bena!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ga smat mayai ta isaca ntolea i, “Ya, aw tina smat ta imayai ta mduk sal-sal ta laisa re I, pesa aw mamcait Jou Lahatalla pana? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Ite smat it lu tane pantas tduk sal-sal tane ningalena ite rir mayaina, ga I pantas pa bo nduk sal-sal tanena ningalena I npei sal paisa pa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Gabe i nua Yesus, “Yesus, mlolam ya oras ta mlafo mdadi kolanona.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Gabe Yesuse nua i, “Ya ikuwa aw, wol tae to aw osta mfarerer re Ya mali Firdaus.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nmat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-46">Mat. 27:45-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mrk. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Orasna japa tok yafasa re pilu, farumi batang cia ndadi ndororam denabe tok faicol malingin, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />ningalena wolca ntul pa. Gabe oras ciana, kaing titiban mamagal ta rcakta i bo rtibane rfara gagaw ta Jou nlafo ni smat mali gagaw isa mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagal cia nmarasekan ndadi silu. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Gabe Yesuse n'gigam nfacicoal i, I nu, “Apa, Ya ipo nik jiwa tae lali Awi.” Nu tina hola, Yesuse ulaya morit.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Oras ta komandan Romaca nem ahai ta ndadi i tina, i nfamamagal Jou Lahatalla fare i nu, “Fatutua, I tae smat ta ncal pa!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Gabe smat lalo ta rfayalo si manana, oras ta si dem ahai ta ndadi ina si duwe, si rpakal be ularina ni fafayalna si rmanyasal. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Farumi smat ta rfafayala re Yesusna, fare maping-maping ta jaga rderera I puli Galilea malina, si dosalna laspa fare deme ndumi ta ndadi i tina.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse rgaile i mali piling goaca</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mrk. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />En smat isa ngahnyo Yusuf. I cia smat isa mali agama Yahudina ta duruse smat ta nmamagal ta ngahnyori Mahkama Agama. I cia smat mafia i re ntubna fatutua mali Jou Lahatalla uhngo. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />I mali Arimatea, bendar ta mali batang Yudea. I cia ntotoman Jou Lahatalla bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna. I nlokolo pa re Mahkama agama Yahudi ta rfaorit bo rpun famat Yesusna, re i ma nlokolo pa ahai ta si rpeina. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Gabe I nfane nbo Pilatus taga ndore bo Pilatuse npo Yesus ni mayatca mali Yusuf i. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Oras ta Pilatuse nalow, Yusufe ndureya Yesus ni mayatca mali ai salipca. Taga i nopi re kaing bubulang ta muhuf laisa re smat Yahudina jaga rpei oras rgaile smat ta rmatna, taga n'gaile I mali piling isa ta rgali i mali popo patca. Piling tina smatna rpake rfagaile bahnga paube. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Yesuse nmatna wol jumat, neta smatna rciap ningalena mdoma bo wol Sabat. Gabe mali wol jumatcana, smat Yahudina nane rfatoto riri karajanna ndumi oras ta wolca ncop paubena, ningalena mali wol Sabat ciana smatna bisa rkarajan pa. Gabe, oras Yusuf n'gaile Yesusna bo dorame to gabe wol Sabatca bo nmulaine to.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Fare maping-maping ta rlafo farerer re Yesus mali batang Galilea malina, si ma rderera Yusuf oras ta bo n'gaile Yesusna, si deme gagaoca, fare mfalaisa Yesus ni mayatca nising i pumul piling goa puli popo patcana. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Fola tina, si duwe gabe rfasiap rampa-rampa ta pauna mafia fare egat ta pauna mafia bo si rmomsa Yesuse ni mayatca laisa re smat Yahudina jaga rpeina. Ga oras ciana malingine to, gabe mulaine wol Sabate to, gabe si rfola karajanna ningalena rderera agama Yahudina ni fatfato ta bisa pa smatna rkarajan mali wol Sabat ciana.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nmat ga npaling hawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mrk. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Wol Mingguca oras dororami sube, mapingna rfan lali piling goaca, dut egat pau mafia ta si rpei e tona. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Gabe rlafo mali pilingca, si dem pat ta mali pilingna cia, namolole to mali pilingca nbona. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Si rcung namul piling goa ciana, ga si dem Jou Yesus ni mayatca ini panto manana. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Oras ta si rfatoto pa ningalena farumi tina, garayanna en smat silu rpake kabayana sasaletam dosal rdahle si. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Maping-maping tina damcaitna gaole gabe si rlu nap denabe uhngorina neta rakrakca. Gabe smat silu tasa duwa si, “Smat ta rpaling hawena, mew mati fiyawa si mali gagaw taena, ningalena mantane smat ta rmatna gagaori. <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />I mantane pa, I npalinge to! Co mew flolam ahai ta I nua mewna oras ta I mali Galilea subena. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />I nu, ‘Smatna bo rpo Smate Ntu ta mali sorogai malica lali smat ta rbaradosna, taga si rsalip I. Ga mali wol pitol I cia bo npaling hawe.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Rlonga laina, taga si rlolam ahai ta Yesuse nua sina. <figure style="fig" file="cn01853B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="24:8">Yesus nmat ga npaling hawe</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Fola tina, si rlolai puli piling i mali gabe dafetngo farumi tina lali murit yafasa re isa tasa fare smate nesa ta en rfarerer re si manana. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Maping tina: Maria puli Magdala mali, Yohana, Maria Yakobuse hnye fare maping nesana. Si tina ta rfabinga lali Yesus ni muritna ta smatna du susula.<verse eid="LUK 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Oras ta Yesuse ni susulana rlonga mapingna dafetang tina, si rdela pa. Si du nama maping tina rpei mauting be ta ncung akal pa.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ga Petruse nosal taga nfarera lali pilingca. Oras ta i nninga namul pilingcana, i nem be kaing bubulangca be, ta dopeya Yesuse ni mayatcana. Gabe i nuwe nututa mali wlona, ahai ta ndadi i tona.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaem i lali smat silu ta rfan lali Emaus tasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mrk. 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Wol cia bena, smat silu mali sili ta jaga rderera Yesus, rfan lali pnu isa ngahnyo Emaus. Pnu cia laona bo sal pa kilo yafasa re pusa mali bendar Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Oras ta rfanna, si dafetang farumi ta ndadi ito mali Yesus ina. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Gabe oras si dafafetang sube fare rfapopo fikiran, Yesuse nlafo ndahle si gabe nfan farerer re si. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Si dem Yesus ga Jou Lahatalla npei si rfayala I pa, cia Yesusna. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ga ta mew ffan tane, mew fafetang ahai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Gabe si rfola re wlorina ncusa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Fare isa mali silina, ngahnyo Kleopas, nua Yesus, “Ga Apa be ta mlafo mali Yerusalem ga mto pa ahai ta ndadi i popise tanena?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesuse nfautno si, “Ahai ta ndadi i tona?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Si rcanglo, “Tane ta ndadi i mali Yesus i mali Nasaret. I cia Nabi ta jaga nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw. I reni kawasa nfafcule re npei mujizat. Jou Lahatalla fare farumi smatna du ahai ta I npei tina farumi fatutua. <figure style="fig" file="cn01860B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="24:18">Yesuse nfaem I lali smat silu ta rfan lali Emaus tasa</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ga amam agama Yahudina nimam imamna fare ta rfaboboko Yahudina rpo I to lali pamarenta Romana bo rfasal i taga si rsalip I, denabe nmat. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ga tantubana amame kmaulango I ta nlafo bo nfasalamat am bangsa Israelna mali pamarenta Roma ta rfasalamna. Ga tane maralapis wol pitole to I nmatna.<verse eid="LUK 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ga maping sifis ta rfarerer re Jouca ni muritna tasa rfagarayan am. Oras dororam i sube si rfan lali pilingna, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ga si dem Yesus ni mayatca ini panto manana. Gabe si rlolai mali amam i taga rfabinga, ‘Amame kem malaekatca puli tina.’ Gabe malaekatca nua si, Yesuse npalinge to. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Rlonga tina, riri del dirancana rfan lali piling cia. Gabe rlafo pulina si deme ndumi laisa re ta maping tasa du tina. Ga si ma dem Yesus pa.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ee mew smat ta fto pana gaole. Ta mnuo i tae mewe fdela paube farumi ta nabina rlefoe to mali Jou ni Kitabcana. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Nabina si du Mesias, Kolano ta Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatca, I cia nane nduk kangela su, taga rfamamagal re rcuba I mali sorogai.” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Nu laina hola, taga nfaolang ahai ta rlefo bo Ina mali farumi Jou ni Kitabcana, mulain mali kitab ta nabi Musa nlefo denabe mali kitab nesa ta nabi nesana rlefona.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Oras ta si rdahle pnu Emaus ta smat silu tasa bo rfanyo ica, Yesus npei laisa re I bo nfan turusna. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Gabe si duwa I “mtetemo amame to, ningalena tane malingine to, fare wolca bo ncope to.” Gabe Yesuse ncung nteteam farerer re si smat silu tasa.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Oras ta Yesuse bo nceli farerer re si, I nyal rotina fare nu tarima kase lali Jou Lahatalla i. Taga, I nfawog-wogla roti tina taga nlow to smat silu tasa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Gabe oras cia to Jou Lahatalla npei si rtaif, gabe si rto cia Yesus. Ga garayanna tina to Yesuse namnyangis mali si hapaluwnorina. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Gabe rfauwo si, “Fatutua oras ta I nmaumauting re it mali lalingcana I nfaolang Jou ni Kitab ciana, ite wlorna tcengana gaole e!”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Fola tina smat silu tasa dosal taga rlolai hawe lali Yerusalem. Pulina si rfadukduk re murit yafasa re isa tasa fare smate nesa ta jaga rderera Yesusna rfayalo si puli tina. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Gabe smat silu tasa rlonga abar mali riri delna laitane, “Ga fatutua to, Jou Yesuse npaling hawe, I nfaemi mali Simon Petrus i.”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Gabe smat silu tasa dafetang ahai ta ndadi i mali lalingca nanaina, re mfalaisa si rfayala Jou Yesusna oras ta I nfawog-wogla roti tinana.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaemi mali ni muritna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mrk. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Kis. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Oras ta muritna dafetang ahai ta ndadi i tina, garayanna Yesus nosal mali si hapaluwnorina fare nua si, “Jou, ni mafiana en mali mewi!”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Si rgarayan fare damcait, ningalena si duna ma si demica hantu i.<verse eid="LUK 24:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ga Yesuse nua si, “Pesaga mew famcait re laisa fdela pa mali wlomewna? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Co mew fem kakamok fare ficok tane, tane gabe Ya. Co mew fem re fkawce Ya. Ya wangtok re nik long, laisa re hantuna pa.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Oras ta Yesuse nu laina, I nfaem kakamo fare ficona lali sili. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Oras cia, si rcangnangna gaole, ga si rdela paube re rherang. Gabe tina Yesuse nfautno si, “An ahai ta en mali mewi tanena?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Gabe si rpoi I iyan sinanga kakati pusa. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Yesus nyal iyan tina gabe nan mali si uhngorina.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Gabe I nua si, “Oras ta Ya iku tane lali mewina, Ya ifarerer re mew sube: Farumi ta rlefo bo Yana mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa, re mali nabi nesana riri kitabna, fare kitab Mazmurna, farumi tina nane ndadi i.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Mana Yesuse npei si rtaif Jou ni Kitabca ni ngalena. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />I nua si, “Mali Jou ni Kitabcana rlefo, Mesias, Kolano ta Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamat smatca nane nkangela, nmat, gabe mali wol pitolca npaling hawe. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Fare osta Ya nik smatna bo dute nik Abar Mafia rpake Ya ngahnyok lali farumi suku ta mali dunia tae bo si diwane wlorina rderera Jou, bo Jou Lahatalla nampung si. Taga si bo rfabinga Abar Mafia tina lali smatna, mulain mali bendar Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Gabe mew ta feme re mtamew pilu ahai ta ndadi i mali Ya ina, mew nane fafetang lali smatna ahai ta mew feme to tina. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Fare Ya to ta bo idurea Jou ni Rohca mali mewi, ta Hmakca njaji tantubana. Ga mew nane fteteam mali bendar Yerusalem su, denabe kawasa ta mali Jou Lahatalla ina nduri nkawasa mew.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ndawil nais Soroga i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mrk. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Kis. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Gabe Yesuse nute ni muritna rcapang mali bendarca denabe laupa nto mali Betania. Si rfola mana, Yesuse nlange kakamona, taga nbarakati si. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Oras ta Yesus npo si barakat, I npupuang ndawil nais soroga i, fare mulaine nfateam si. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Gabe mana si daftiba pupuorina nap rcuba I. Hola tina, si duwe lali Yerusalem fare wlorina sangnangna gaole. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Si jaga si mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, fare rcuba re rfamamagal Jou Lahatalla. <figure style="fig" file="CN01883B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="24:53">Yesuse ndawil nais Soroga i</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>